<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Zul New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">LUK</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">Zo shirəm kan Luka rəsh gwa</para>
  <para style="mt">LUK</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Mbarǝm na womti rǝsh den bar ju kan pi gip dlom gǝmi gwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Wu rǝsh bar ju mǝ kum gwa, bi dǝ munju shin bar ju na ger gǝzǝn terka kan den ritǝn gip dlom gǝmi kan wu yari jen shirǝm kǝ Yam gwa, wi ni wu bi mi. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Den untuwo, ar ni na gam gǝni a zhit bar kup na ne gǝs kǝ pitǝn gǝzǝn, ar ni a shin ar ndari'e a rǝshi'i bar kup ndekes, mǝn nartǝn Tiyopilus, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />kǝ dǝ kǝ mom ge shirǝm kǝ bar ju kan kulci'i kup gwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yari gǝri kǝ Yohana mǝn pi Batisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Gip muri ju kan Hiridus ra den dandi kǝ Yahudiyawo, mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gon ra muntu na sun'e Zakariya gwa, ti ni gip mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam kan gǝs dǝ Abaya gwa, nagǝr gǝs Alisabatu pawo gǝs gal kǝ Haruna ni. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hiridus: Ti ni'e bari muntu kan ri Yesu eka gip wokoci gǝs gwa. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Kup gǝzǝn mǝn bǝrti Yam kan pi mbuni dǝmi cina dǝ Yam gwani, wu kop doka kǝ Yam kup asǝm na gǝse. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Ama wira na mimir da'a domici Alisabatuwo njikǝn ni, win ju ngap wu korsi wi.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Gasi gon, nan Zakariya ra den pi mbap gǝs kǝ mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam den am kǝ mbarǝm cina dǝ Yami, nan an ɗir den kungiya gǝzǝn gwa, <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />den bi al'ada kandatu ne kǝ dǝ mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam den am kǝ mbarǝm wu kop gwa, ba zǝzar ti kǝ tǝ te gip Bom kǝ Yam dǝ tǝ la kunu mǝn tǝmi kasǝri. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Mbarǝm na womti eso wu ra kari, wu den shirǝm na Yam, nan den la'i kunu mǝn tǝmi kasǝri gwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Kan mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam ba ɗǝl kar Zakariya, dlor den am shimli kǝ ba la'i kunu mǝn tǝmi kasǝri. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Nan Zakariya shin tǝwo, ar ni mbatl tari ti kan bǝrti ba nǝm ti. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />Ama mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ kum bǝrti da'a, Zakariya, Yam kum lirtǝn gi wi. Nagǝr gi Alisabatu ba gǝri'i nya, ki ne ti sun'e Yohana. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Ti dǝmi'i bar kǝ ghol mbatl na kumi tǝmi, mbarǝm na womti ba pi ghol mbatl na gǝri gǝsi, <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />ti dǝm mǝn nartǝn cina dǝ Babom Yami. Ti tla ɗu da'a na bar mǝn hutǝn kup, bar mǝn kemi gheri gami. Yam ba la'i ti na Ruhu gǝsi tun te tu dǝ naska. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Ti pali mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila na womti ɗir kar Babom Yam gǝzǝni. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Ti ri cina dǝ Babom gip Ruhu na iko kǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Iliya, ti pali mbatl kǝ mǝn gǝri kar mimir gǝzǝni, kan mǝn nge kopi shirǝm es den ho tǝp kǝ mǝn bǝrti Yami, ti kǝrkǝm mbarǝm kǝ dǝ wu dǝm mǝn bǝrti Babomi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />Zakariya wul mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami'e, &lt;&lt;Imni a mani momi argon tu kǝ yari ba pi rawu? Ami korsi ni nagǝr gǝn ngapo sheti ghon gǝs womti wi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />Mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami nǝmi ti, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ami ni'e Jibra'ilu, a dlǝr cina dǝ Yami, arni kan ba karǝm dǝ a shirǝm nan ki, a yari'i zo shirǝm kǝni. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Kǝkǝno ki sa shot, ki'i mani shirǝm da'a, se gas tu kan bar tu ni piwi gwa, den kǝ la shirǝm gǝn mbatl da'a, muntu ba dǝm hoyi den kanda tu a yari gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Mbarǝm ba dlǝr wu den ɓuti dǝ Zakariya ɗǝl teri, wu den damtǝn den ununu kem tǝ ɗǝl ter gip Bom kǝ Yam bǝle da'a. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Nan tǝ ɗǝl tero, tǝ'i mani shirǝm nan wur da'a. Wu mom'e tǝ shin ni ruya gip Bom kǝ Yami kan tǝ nǝm shirǝm nan wur na ame, ama tǝ'i mani shirǝm da'a.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Nan pǝt mbap gǝs pawo, ar ni tǝ pal rǝn bomka.<verse eid="LUK 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Den kar kǝ untuwo, kan nagǝr gǝs Alisabatu ba zam tu'e, ar ni tǝ ghundǝr gam gǝska kǝ kyar nantam gip bomi. <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />Alisabatu wule,&lt;&lt;Yam ni pim untu, Gip muri jino Babom Yam shin guna gǝni, tǝ ɗǝlim shamka gip mbarǝme.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yari gǝri kǝ Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Gip kyar kǝ mukka na zami tu kǝ Alisabatuwo, Yam kar mǝn kartǝn gǝs Jibra'ilu su gip bǝn Nazarat kan ra gip atl kǝ Galili gwa, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />kar nye gǝr kan mom moni wi da'a, muntu Isubu gǝs gal kǝ Dauda ri o da ti gwa, tǝ pǝn gip mbatl gǝs tǝ gudlǝmi nan ti gwa, sun kǝ nye gǝri'e Maryamu. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami ri kar ti tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Dǝ shirmi ika! Babom Yam ba kum tǝmi gi, Babom Yam ra nan ki.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Nan Maryamu kum shirmitǝn tuwo ar dlǝkǝn ti hoyi, tǝ den damtǝn den'e unu shirmitǝn utu untu. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Ama mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba dǝ bǝrti ci'i da'a Maryamu, kǝ zam cirtǝn cina dǝ Yam wi. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Ki zam tu'e, ki gǝr nya, ki ne ti sun'e Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Ti dǝm bar mbarǝme, ba wul ti’e nya bar gun kǝ to yamka, Babom Yam ba bi ti dandi kǝ bas Dauda. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Ti pi mulki gam bom kǝ Yakubu bat na patǝni, mulki gǝs ba pa da'a!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Maryamu wul mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami'e, &lt;&lt;Imnu untu ba pi rawu, ami kan a mom momi wi da gwawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami nǝmi ti, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ruhu kǝ Yam ba sur den ki, iko kǝ Bar Gun kǝ to Yamka baa ghum kika. Ra untuwo, nya tu ki gǝriwo ti nǝra na wani pitǝn da'a, ba wul ti'e Nya Yami. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Ar tu erǝm gi Alisabatu nan ba wule ti njikǝn ni ma na korsitǝn gǝsi, kǝkǝn untu tǝra na tu kyar mukka. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Argon ra da'a kan Yam ba mbu pi da gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Maryamu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ami zher kǝ Yam ni, naa ar dǝmim untu den yari gi.&gt;&gt; Ar ni mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami ndara.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maryamu ri kar Alisabatu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Murka njemo, ar ni Maryamu tli na zhotǝne tǝ ri gip bǝn gon gip atl tlǝndǝr kǝ mǝn Yahuda, <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />las tu Zakariya ra gwa, tǝ te gip bomi, tǝ shirmi Alisabatu. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Nan Alisabatu kum shirmitǝn kǝ Maryamuwo, ar ni nya kǝ te tu gǝska jiti ti, kan ba la'i Alisabatu na Ruhu kǝ Yami. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Tǝ shirǝm na bar yar tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ki mǝn albarka ni gip mǝtli, nya tu ki gǝriwo mǝn albarkani! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Unun kem zo bar kǝn zamǝn untu, nan nasi Babom gǝn ba ɗir ra karǝm gwa wu? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Nan shirmitǝn gi su kǝm damo, arni nya kǝ te tu gǝnka jiti ti na ghol mbatli. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Mǝn albarka ni'e muntu nǝm'e shirǝm tu Yam yari tiwo, ar ba pi untu gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Maryamu wuli kon ɗǝɗa Yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Arni Maryamu wule,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">&lt;&lt;Mbatl gǝn ba ɗǝɗa Babom Yami.<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />Ruhu gǝn ba pi pighol mbatl gip Yam mǝn ɗǝli gǝni.<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />Don tǝ mom namǝni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">ami zher gǝs gǝr mǝtli ni kan ami argon ni da gwa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Cina ɗewo mbarǝm kup ba wulǝm'e, &lt;ki mǝn albarkani,&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />den bar ju kan Yam mǝn nartǝn pim gwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">sun gǝso dlǝran ni ar ra.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Guna gǝs ba ri den mǝn ju ba bi ti nartǝn gwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">zhan ar kop zhan.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Ya pi kiri mbap na am gǝs mǝn ndǝrtǝn,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">tǝ gǝzan mǝn dlari gamka na kup arjen ju ba se wur gip mbatl gǝzǝn gwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Ya shu gunka den dandi gǝzǝni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">kan tǝ ɗǝɗa mun ju kan mom nan wur dagwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Tǝ la'i tu kǝ mǝn kumi guzum na mbuni bari,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">kan ti za mǝn bar kǝ am am koni.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Tǝ ne am zher gǝs Isra'ila ra,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">tǝ tune na gudlǝm shirǝm gǝs kǝ kumi guna'i<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />den tǝ pi ga gigi gǝmi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">Ibǝrahim na mimir gǝs kǝ kumi guna gǝzǝn an ri patǝn bari.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Maryamu dǝm na Alisabatu wule kǝ kyar myakan kan tǝ pal rǝn bomka.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gǝri kǝ Yohana mǝn Batisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Nan pǝt mbi rawi kan Alisabatu ba gǝr nya gǝso, ar ni tǝ gǝr nye moni <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Berǝm dǝmi na mǝn gǝs nan wu kum zo bar tu Yam pi tǝwo, ar ni wu pi ghol mbatl nan ti.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />Nan muri wuzupse la'i wo, ar ni wu ɗir kǝ dǝ wu sǝr nyayi. Wu ndu far'e wu ne ti sun kǝ bas Zakariya, <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />ama nas nge gǝs tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;O'o, dǝ la ti bi'e Yohana.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Murgon ra gip mǝn gi na sun tu daa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Ar ni wu pi bas ame, kǝ dǝ wu mom unu sun ni tǝ ndu'e dǝ ne nyayi. <verse eid="LUK 1:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Tǝ liri ba rǝshi, ar ni tǝ rǝshi, &lt;&lt;Sun gǝs'e Yohana.&gt;&gt; Bar tu dlǝkǝn mbarǝm ju ra lasi gwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Bartu, ar ni bi kǝ Zakariya ɓuli, tǝ shirǝme, kan tǝ nǝm ɗǝɗa Yami. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Kan bǝrti ba nǝm berǝm dǝmi gǝzǝn kup, mbarǝm ba nǝm yari shirǝm den bar tu nan pi untu gwa, kup gip atl mǝn tlǝndǝr kǝ mǝn Yahuda. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Kup muntu kum shirǝm tuwo, tǝ wul tor gip mbatl gǝs'e, &lt;&lt;Imni nya tu bari kǝ dǝmiwe?&gt;&gt; Den wu momi am kǝ Yam ra nan ti.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zakariya wuli kon ɗǝɗa Yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Bas Zakariya laa na Ruhu kǝ Yami, ar ni tǝ yari shirǝm kǝ Yam tǝ wule,<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />&lt;&lt;Mǝ ɗǝɗani Babom Yam kǝ Isra'ila</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">den tǝ ɗir kar mbarǝm gǝs tǝ ɗǝli wuri.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Tǝ bi mi mǝn ɗǝli gǝmi mǝn iko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">gip bom kǝ zher gǝs Dauda.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Kanda tu tǝ yari terka bi dǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam mǝn tsarki.<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />Den mii zam ɗǝltǝn wi am dǝ mǝn nge gǝmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">na mǝn ju ba ndu mi da gwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Yam gode kori gǝmi guna gere,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">kan tǝ tune na gudlum shirǝm gǝs kǝ far mǝn tsarki nan tǝ pi wur gwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />Gudlum shirǝm tu nan tǝ yari kori gǝmi kǝ far Ibǝrahim.<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />Tǝ ɗǝli mi am dǝ mǝn nge gǝmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">kǝ dǝ mǝ bote ti bat na bǝrti.<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />Mǝ dǝm ni dlǝran na pitǝn dlat cina dǝ Yam gip muri gǝmi kup.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Ki nya gǝn eso, ba la kibi'e mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ bar Gun kǝ to yamka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">Ki ri cina dǝ Babomi, kǝ kǝrkǝmi ti guntǝpe.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Ki yari mbarǝm gǝs kandatu wi zam tǝp ɗǝltǝn gip dun mbatl</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">tǝp kǝ ba ho’i warwat pitǝn gǝzǝnka gwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Gip womti shini guna kǝ Yam gǝmi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">cirtǝn kǝ pǝt kan ba ɗǝl tor gǝsi ba ɗǝl sur yam an cir den mi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">1.78 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Cirtǝn kǝ pǝt: Ar ni'e cwattǝn kǝ Almasihu kan ba cir den mi gwa. </char>
    </note> <verse eid="LUK 1:78" /><verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />ar ba cir den mǝn dǝmi gip dǝmǝni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">na gip gos kǝ mǝshtǝni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">ar baa kop nan mi den tǝp kǝ dǝmi zhilili.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Yohana nyayi nari, tǝ dǝm na ndǝrtǝn gip ruhu, tǝ dǝm gǝs rǝn gip lǝpka se gastu kan tǝ ɗǝl ɗir gip mbarǝm kǝ pi mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila wazu gwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Gǝri kǝ Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Gip muri jawo, la'i icǝn ɗǝl bi dǝ Kaisar Augustus, Gun kǝ Roma, dǝ dlǝm mbarǝm kǝ atl kup. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kaisar Augustus: Bar gunni’e ti. Bǝn ra na womti kup na gun gǝzǝni kan atli da ti gwa. Sun Kaisar yiwo sun gǝsni da’a, ama sun kǝ nartǝn ni kan mǝn bǝni ba bi kup muntu ne ti gun gwan. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Muntu ni'e la'i gǝs dlǝmi mbarǝm kǝ atl kup, gip muri ju kan Kiriniyus den dandi kǝ Siriya gwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Arni mbarǝm kup pal rǝn bǝn dawurka dǝ rǝsh sun gǝzǝni.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Isubu za bǝn Nazarat gip atl kǝ Galili ti pal to gip bǝn Baitalami gip atl kǝ Yahudiya, bǝn tu kan gǝr gun Dauda tunka gwa. Yusufu pal to bar taka ra'e ti mǝn bom kǝ Dauda ni. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />Ya pal toka na nye gǝr gǝs Maryamu, muntu kan tǝ ri o da ti kan ra na tu gwa, kǝ dǝ rǝsh sun gǝzǝn toka.<verse eid="LUK 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Wira to Baitalami kawo, ar ni pǝt gǝri gǝs ɗiri. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Tǝ gǝr nya gǝs kǝ pari, tǝ ghum tika gip tutul gǝs tǝ mur ti gip kungǝlǝn, tun kan wira na las muri gip ba shu'i mǝn dikiyi da gwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝn le tǝm na mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Rǝn bi lǝp kawo, mǝn le tǝm ra den muri kari, wu den ne ger den tǝm gǝzǝn kǝ gasi. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Karap ar ni mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam gon cwat kar wuri, gos kǝ Yam cir den wuro kan bǝrti ba nǝm wur na nari. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Ti ngapo kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ba dǝ bǝrti nǝm kǝnni da'a! Amo a ɗiri in na tǝmi shirǝmi, muntu ba kem mbarǝm kup wu pi ghol mbatl gwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Sekǝno gǝri in mǝn ɗǝli mbarǝm gip dun mbatli gip bar bǝn kǝ Dauda, Babom Almasihu. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Kandatu ki mom tiwo, ar ni'e, ki ri zam nya na ghumi gip tutul gǝs ɓom gip kungǝlǝn.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Wi ra untuwo sai gimǝtl na womti mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam na muntu ra far gwa gip wuri, wu den ɗǝɗa Yam, wu den wultǝn'e,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />&lt;&lt;Yam'e bari to yamka!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">sur atlo dǝ ghol mbatl kop mǝn ju kan Yam ba kum tǝmi gǝzǝn gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Nan mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam ju pal gǝzǝn to yamkawo, arni mǝn le tǝm ju wul ezǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Mǝ rini Baitalami mǝ shinni argon kǝn kan den pitǝn, kan Yam yari mi gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Wu zho wur wu te gip bǝni wu zam Yusufu na Maryamu, wu shin nyayi su gip kungǝlǝnka ɓom. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Nan mǝn le tǝmi shin tǝwo kan wu bali wur argon tu kan mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam tu yari wur den nyayi gwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Kup munju kum shirǝm tu yariwo, ar dlǝkǝn wuri, kan wu nǝm bi na am den argon tu mǝn le tǝm ju yari gwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Maryamu ngapo tǝ ne bar ju kup su mbatl ka, tǝ den damtǝn dene. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Mǝn le tǝm ju pal rǝn bi lǝp ka, wu den ɗǝɗa Yam hoyi den argon tu wu kum kan wu shin gwa, bar ju kup mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam yari wuro ar ni wu shini.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ne sun Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Nan nyayi mur wuzupsewo, ar ni wu sǝr ti kan wu ne ti sun'e Yesu, sun tu kano mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam bi wur nan zam tu gǝs wi da gwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Nan muri la kǝ dǝ pi argon tu kulci kǝ Musa yari kǝ hotǝn dǝ pal hoyi cina dǝ Yam kan ba pii ɗiro, kan wu pǝn ti wu te ti Urushalima kǝ dǝ ta ti am dǝ Yami. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mǝn Yahudawo, gǝrni gǝr nye moniwo, tǝ nǝra na cirtǝn cina dǝ Yam da’a. Se tin tǝ mur hauya rop kan dǝ mbosh mir kuɓur ko tattabara rop, kǝ pali gǝs hoyi cina dǝ Yami (den bi ho’i bǝran gǝrika). </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />Untun kulci kǝ Yam yari, den kup gǝri kǝ pari inkan nye moni no dǝ bi Yamka. <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />Wu ɗir pash Maryamu den yari kǝ shirǝm kǝ Yam den'e mir kuɓur rop ko mir tattabara ropni ba mboshi.<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Gip muri jawo, mbarǝm gon ra nan ba wul ti'e Saminu gwa, tini su Urushalimaka na dǝmi. Ti bar mǝn bǝrti Yam ni mǝn la'i Yam mbatl ni. Tin den ɓuti gas tu kan Yam ba ɗǝli Isra'ila gwa. Ruhu kǝ Yam ra nan ti. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Ruhu kǝ Yam yari ti den ti mǝsh da'a se tin tǝ shin Almasihu tu kan Ba-Gun Yam wule ti kar ti sur kani. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Ruhu kǝ Yam kem ti tetǝn gip dǝbom Bom kǝ Yam gas tu kan mǝn gǝri kǝ nyayi ɗir ti wu pi ti argon tu shirǝm kǝ Yam yari dǝ pi nye moni kǝ pari gwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Kan Saminu ba nǝm ti am dati tǝ goode Yami tǝ wule,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />&lt;&lt; Kǝkǝno Babomi, na dǝ zher gi mǝsh na ghol mbatli den yari gi.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Nan ger gǝn shin mǝn ɗǝli kǝ Isra'ila wi gwa,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />Muntu kǝ pi ti den ger kǝ bǝn kup gwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Cirtǝn tuni es ɓul guntǝp kǝ momi Yam dǝ mǝn ju kan mǝn Yahuda ni da gwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">tin ti kem mbarǝm kǝ Isra'ila wu pi sun ra.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Na kumi untuwo, kan bas na nas ba nǝm bi na am, den bar ju kan Saminu yari den ti gwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Kan Saminu ba lir Yam dǝ tǝ ne am Yusufu na Maryamu ra, ti wul Maryamu nas'e, &lt;&lt;Yam zǝzar nya tu, ti kem mbarǝm na womti kǝ jiltǝni, ti dǝm guntǝp kopi Yam kǝ mbarǝm na womti gip Isra'ila. Tin ti dǝm alama tu ɗǝl kar Yam kan mbarǝm na womti ba nge gwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Na untun arjen ju wu ghundǝri su mbatl da wurka ma ba ɗǝl kari, bar tu ba ci'i mbatl wule tuli ini tu na sǝɓǝri&gt;&gt;.<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Korsi mǝn shirǝm na Yam tu kan ba wul ti'e Hannatu, nya Fanuwel, nya Ashiru. Tǝ dǝm bom kos kǝ sheti ghon nyingi katl, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />kan kos gǝs ba mǝsh ka. Kǝkǝno sheti ghon gǝs hauya wupse na wupseni. Tǝ za Bom kǝ Yam da'a pǝt na gasi, tǝ ne Yam den ngustin kǝ liri gǝs na guzum male. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Saminu pa’i shirǝm gǝs ituwi arni Hannatu ter gipi, ti den goode Yam tǝ shirǝm den nya tu. Tǝ yari kup munju kan den ɓuti dǝ Yam ɗǝli wur gip dun mbatl gǝzǝn gwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Nan ga Isubu na Maryamu pa'i kup argon tu shirǝm kǝ Yam yari dǝ piwo, kan wu pal su bǝn gǝzǝn Nazarat gip atl kǝ Galili ka. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Nyayi ba nar na ndǝrtǝn gǝsi. Yam bi ti momi bar na nari, ndutǝn kǝ Yam kop ti kari.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nye Yesu gip Bom kǝ Yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Sheti ghon kupo, mǝn gǝri kǝ Yesu ba kur su Urushalima kǝ nyel jikat bǝdlabǝni. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Biki jikat bǝdlabǝni: Nyel ni kan mǝn Yahuda ba pi kǝ ghol mbatli, nan Yam dǝli wur am dǝ gun kǝ Masar gwa. Wu pini biki tu kup sheti ghone, las tu wu pi ngapo su bar bǝn gǝzǝn Urushalima kani.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Nan Yesu ri sheti ghon kutl cet rob na gǝriwo, kan wu su kǝ nyel jikat bǝdlabǝn kan wu kur pi gwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Nan wu pa’i nyel jikat bǝdlabǝniwo ar ni wu nǝm tǝp paltǝn gǝzǝn su bǝn da wur Nazaratka, Yesu nya tu ngapo tǝ sa gǝs su Urushalima ka, mǝn gǝri gǝs ngap wu mom da'a. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Wi ngapo wu wule ti nǝra gip mǝn ju wu den ritǝn nan wur gwa, wu nda pǝt den ɓomi asǝm nan gǝzǝni. Nan wu shin ti dawo kan wu nǝm ngeni gǝs gip ezǝn na berǝm gǝzǝni. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Nan wu zam ti dawo, ar ni wu pal su Urushalimaka kǝ ngeni gǝsi.<verse eid="LUK 2:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Muri gǝzǝn myakan, kan wu nde zami gǝs gip dlom kǝ mǝn kulci shirǝm kǝ Yam te gip dǝbom Bom kǝ Yamka, ti den kumi gǝzǝn kan tǝ pa ngen momi kar wuri. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />munju kan kum bar ju kup tǝ bali nan wuro ar ni momi shirǝm gǝs na bali shirǝm gǝs dlǝkǝn wuri. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Ar dlǝkǝn mǝn gǝri gǝs na shini gǝs lasi, kan nas ba wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Nya gǝni, unun kǝ pi mi untuwu? Ami na be den ngeni gi na zoti ger gwa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Tǝ ngen momi kar wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝ ngenǝm ni kǝ unu? Kǝ mom ni'e ar ndari a nǝra te bom dǝ Banka da'a ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Wi ngapo wu mom gǝs kǝ shirǝm tu ti bali wur gwa da'a. <verse eid="LUK 2:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Kan tǝ tlyam tǝ kop wur wu pal gǝzǝn su Nazaratka tǝ pi ta kumi bi kǝ mǝn gǝri gǝsi, kup bar juwo nas ne su mbatl da tika. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Kan Yesu ba pi ta nartǝn na ɓatli mbatl na tlyartǝni, tǝ zam cirtǝn kar Yam na mbarǝme.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Wazu kǝ Yohana mǝn Batisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Bar gun Kaisar Tibariya gip sheti ghon kutl cet nantam den dandi kǝ atl kǝ Roma, Buntu Bilatus ngapo ti ni den dandi kǝ atl kǝ Yahuda, Hirudus ni'e gun kǝ Galili, Filibus esi ni'e gun kǝ Ituriya na Tarakunitas, Lisaniyas ni'e gun kǝ Abiliya. <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />Ga Hanana na Kayafawo, wi ni'e kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa. Yam shirǝm na Yohana nya Zakariya gip lǝpe. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Tǝ kop atl kǝ bi ɓula Urdun kup, tǝ pii wazu mbarǝm dǝ wu za warwat pitǝn gǝzǝnka, wu kop Yam dǝ pi wur batisma dǝ Yam pǝni wur warwat pitǝn gǝzǝnka. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Untun ar ra na rǝshi gip tǝlankur kǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Ishaya nan tǝ wule,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;&lt; Yar kǝ gon den latǝn bi gip lǝpe,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">&lt;Kǝrkǝmi ni Babom guntǝp tu kan tii kop gwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">ta'i tǝni ngoyi guntǝp gǝs ka.<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Laa'ini dindika kup,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">tatlni kiri tlǝndǝrka kan kǝ ngash ni heli tlǝnɗǝrka kup.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">Dǝ ta guntǝp tu kan ra na ngoyi gwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">kan dǝ kǝrkǝm gurgǝzǝk guntǝpka ar mbuni.<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />Mbarǝm kup baa shin kandatu kan Yam pǝni wur warwat pitǝn gǝzǝnka gwa.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Yohana shin mbarǝm na womti den ɗirtǝn kar ti, kǝ dǝ tǝ pi wur batismawo ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝn badǝr kǝ wonzi! Won matl kǝn den kǝ kǝtǝrini lo kǝ Yam mǝn ɗirtǝnu? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Pini argon tu ba shin dǝ wule kǝ ci atl gam wu gwa. Ba kǝ wulni tor gip mbatl gin'e, Ibǝrahimo baa gǝmi ni da'a. domici a yari ine, Yam ra na iko tǝ tlii Ibǝrahim mimir gip tat ju. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Tare ne bi ndal den gǝs kin wi. Kup kin tu kan gǝr ho mimir dawo, ba wotlka dǝ laka gip utu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Kan womti mbarǝm ju ba wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Unun mi pi ituwi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Tǝ bali wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Muntu kup kan ra na lulur ropo, naa tǝ bi muntu kan ra nari da gwa nǝm, muntu na fingal ma naa tǝ pi untu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Mǝn nǝmi wurpi bom ɗir pa dǝ Yohana pi wur batisma, wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt; Ba mǝn Kulci, unun mi piwe?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;nǝm ni argon tu kan mǝn bǝn wule dǝ nǝm gwa katl.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Mǝn bi utu ma wu ɗir wu wule, &lt;&lt;mǝn ngapo unun mi piwe?&gt;&gt; Ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ getl ni mbarǝm den wu bi'in wurpi da'a, wi ni wu bi'in da ngapo ba kǝ ne wur ni lar te gam ka da'a. Nǝm ni ɓatltǝn gin na mbatl nǝm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Nan mbarǝm den ɓuti na zoti ger kan wu den pǝni tor gip mbatl gǝzǝn den'e, &lt;&lt;Ko Yohana ni'e Almasihu yi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Kan Yohana ba wul kup gǝzǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Amo a ne in den pi batisma na male, gon ra kan nar manǝm gwa den ɗirtǝne, muntu kan zap kaptǝlan gǝs ma a kǝm pǝtli da'a. Ti pi in batisma na Ruhu kǝ Yam na utu esi. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Tǝ ra na matanƙadi gǝs am da ti, ti ɗǝli gam oka, tǝ shot gesi su ɓindi da tika, kǝptiyi ngapo ti kerika na utu tu kan ba mǝsh da gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Na dǝli kǝm jen na womti, Yohana pi mbarǝm wazu kǝ zo shirǝmi.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Ama Yohana matl Hirudus gun kǝ bǝni, na pǝni Hirudiya gǝr kǝ mǝn bari gǝs Filibus, na wani bar jen na womti kan tǝ pi gwa. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Den kariwo kan Hirudus ba li ari ka, kan tǝ wule dǝ nǝm Yohana dǝ ɓal ti.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yohana pi Yesu batisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Nan pi mbarǝm kup batismawo, kan ba pi Yesu pa'e, nan ti den shirǝm na Yamo, ar ni yam ɓuli. <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />Ruhu kǝ Yam ba sur dlǝr den ti na dli wule kǝ kuɓuri. Kan yar gon ba ɗǝl sur yam ba wule, &lt;&lt;Ki ni'e nya gǝni, muntu kan A ndu ti gwa, mbatl gǝn ba ghol naar nan ki.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝn kǝ Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Yesu nǝm mbap gǝs kǝ kulci na pi wazuwo, ba shin wule tǝ ri sheti ghon hauya nǝm na kutl na gǝri wi. Mbarǝm pali tǝka wule nya Isubu ni, nya Heli. <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli nya Matat, Matat nya Lawi, Lawi nya Malki, Malki nya Yanna, Yanna nya Isubu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Isubu nya Matatiya, Matatiya nya Amos, Amos nya Nahum, Nahum nya Azaliya, Azaliya nya Najaya, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Najaya nya Ma'ata, Ma'ata nya Matatiya, Matatiya nya Shimeya, Shimeya nya Josek, Josek nya Yahuda.<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Yahuda nya Yowanan, Yowanan nya Refaya, Refaya nya Zarubabel, Zarubabel nya Sheyeltiyel, Sheyeltiyel nya Niri. <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Niri nya Malki, Malki nya Addi, Addi nya Kosama, Kosama nya Almadama, Almadama nya Er, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Er nya Joshuwa, Joshuwa nya Eliyazar, Eliyazar nya Yorim, Yorim nya Matat, Matat nya Lawi,<verse eid="LUK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Lawi nya Simiyon, Simiyon nya Yahuda, Yahuda nya Isubu, Isubu nya Yonam, Yonam nya Eliyakim. <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliyakim nya Malaya, Malaya nya Mainana, Mainana nya Matata, Matata nya Natan, Natan nya Dauda, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Dauda nya Jesse, Jesse nya Obida, Obida nya Bo'aza, Bo’aza nya Salmon, Salmon nya Nashon. <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nashon nya Amminadab, Amminadab nya Aram, Aram nya Hasruna, Hasruna nya Parisa, Parisa nya Yahuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Yahuda nya Yakub, Yakub nya Ishaku, Ishaku nya Ibǝrahim, Ibǝrahim nya Tera, Tera nya Nahor <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Nahor nya Serug, Serug nya Reyu, Reyu nya Peleg, Peleg nya Eber, Eber nya Shela <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Shela nya Kenan, Kenan nya Arfakshad, Arfakshad nya Shem, Shem nya Nuhu, Nuhu nya Lamek <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lamek nya Metusela, Metusela nya Enok, Enok nya Yared, Yared nya Mahalalel, Mahalalel nya Kenan, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kenan nya Enosh, Enosh nya Shitu, Shitu nya Adamu, Adamu nya Yami.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Shetan ndu kemi Yesu ndetǝne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />Yesu pal sur ɓula Jodan laa'i na Ruhu kǝ Yami, ar ni Ruhu kop nan ti rǝn gip lǝpka, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />lastu tǝ pi muri hauya rop tǝ ci argon da'a, nan wu pawo kan guzum ba ci ti. Ar ni Shetan, gun dun itǝr, ɗir kar ti kǝ dǝ tǝ kem ti ndetǝne.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Tǝ wul Yesu'e, &lt;&lt;In ki nya Yam no, wul tat ju'e wu dǝm bǝredi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ar ra na rǝshi gip shirǝm kǝ Yam'e, &lt;Mbarǝm ba mani dǝmi na ci burodi katl da'a.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Bartuwo, kan Shetan ba te ti den tlyari las goni, kan tǝ gode ti bǝn kǝ duniya kup wule gip njipkǝr gere. <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />Kan tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Aa bi'i mulki na kirtǝn gǝzǝnka kup gwanni, wu bin kawi. A mani bi kup muntu kano a adu'i ti bi gwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Ki ni kǝ ngus cina dam kǝ bim nartǝno, ar ba dǝm ge.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ar ra na rǝshi, ɗǝɗa Babom Yam gi, ti ni nangǝs ki bi ti nartǝni&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Kano Shetan ba si ti gip bǝn Urushalima, kan tǝ kem ti tǝ dlǝr to den gam Bom kǝ Yam kan to den Yam nar gwa, tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;In ki nya Yam no, ɓo tuma su atl ka. <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Ar ra na rǝshi'e, &lt;Yam ba wul mǝn kartǝn gǝs'e wu ga ki hoyi, <verse eid="LUK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />eso, wi nǝm ki gip am gǝzǝni, ki nda kǝ ɓo asǝm gika den tat da'a.&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Shirǝm kǝ Yam wule, &lt; dǝ kǝ gode Babom Yam gi da'a.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Nan Shetan pa'i godetǝn gǝs kupo, ar ni tǝ ndara tǝ za Yesu, kǝ dǝ tǝ ɓut zo pǝt goni.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbarǝm nge Yesu gip bǝn Nazarat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />Yesu pal gip atl kǝ Galili, iko kǝ Ruhu kǝ Yam ra nan ti. Ar ni shirǝm den ti ri gip bǝni kǝ bi atli kup, <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />kano tǝ nǝm kulci mbarǝm gip bom kumi shirǝm kǝ Yam gǝzǝni, ar ni mbarǝm pita yari zo shirǝm den ti.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />&lt;&lt;Ruhu kǝ Babom Yam ra na demǝni, tǝ zǝzarǝm kǝ dǝ a yar zo shirǝm kǝ Yam dǝ munju kano am ri wur kar da gwa. Tǝ karǝm kǝ dǝ a yar shirǝm kǝ ɗǝli munju kan ra na ɓali gwa, kano a ɓuli ger munju kano tabini gwa. Dǝ za munju kano jen pi wur hoyi da gwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />Kǝ dǝ a yari gin kǝ guna ger kǝ Babom Yami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Ar ni tǝ kucum tǝlankuri ka, kan tǝ bi mǝn mbap kǝ bom kumi shirǝm kǝ Yami, kano tǝ dǝm gǝs atli. Ger kǝ mbarǝm kup ngapo ar ra den ti, wu nǝm shini gǝsi. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Se kǝno, argon tu shirǝm kǝ Yam yariwo ar laa'i wi den ger gi ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Munju kup kan ra lasiwo, wu yar ho shirǝm den ti, kan wu nǝm bi na am na shirǝm mǝn tǝmtǝn kano tǝ yari gwa, wu wule, &lt;&lt;Muntuwo nya Isubu ni diya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Ar ni Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;A momi ki yarim shirǝm kolɗa bitu ba yari gwa'e, &lt;Mǝn bi uni, warke gam gi&gt;, ki wulǝm es'e, &lt;Pi mi argon tu kan kǝ pi su gip Kaparnahumka gwa.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Ar ni Yesu wul wur ra'e, &lt;&lt;A yari in ge shirǝmi, tǝ ci cina na shirǝm tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;ba nǝm shirǝm kǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam gib bǝn gǝs da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />&lt;Na ho bi ni a yari ine&gt;, &lt;&lt;gin tu kano mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Iliya rawo, munju kano kos gǝzǝn mǝshka gip Israilawo, wu womti, gini ni pi watlǝn myakan na kyar mukka ghon nda da'a, kano ba pi guzum na nari gip atli. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />Ama Yam kar Iliya kar ko nǝm gǝzǝn da'a, ar ni Yam kar ti kar guri gon gip bǝn Zarifat kan ra gip atl kǝ Sidon gwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Eso, mǝn ndǝcci jen ra na womti gip Israila, wokoci kǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam Elisha. Kup na untuwo, nǝm gǝzǝn gon ra kan Yam warke ti ndǝcci gǝska gwa da'a, se mbarǝm nǝm. ti ni'e Na'aman ba mǝn Suriya, muntu kan Yam warke ti ndǝcci gǝska gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Kup mbarǝm ju kan ra gip bom kumi shirǝm kǝ Yamiwo, lo ci wur nan wu kum shirǝm kǝ Yesu gwa. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Ar ni wu tlyam dlor, kano wu ɗǝli Yesuka kar bǝni, kan wu te ti den bi zhiki tu kan tu bǝn gǝzǝn dene gwa. Wu ndu'e wu byal ti tǝ nda su atl ka. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Ama Yesu kop gip wuri kan tǝ ndara won gǝsi.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɗǝli dun itǝrka gip mbarǝme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Kano Yesu ba ndara Kaparnahum bǝn gon gip kǝ Galili, kan tǝ kulci mbarǝm den pǝt shukutǝni. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Ar ni kulci gǝsi dlǝkǝn mbarǝme, den shirǝm gǝs ra wule kǝ gunye.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Gip bom kumi shirǝm kǝ Yamo, mbarǝm gon ra mǝn dun itǝri, ar ni tǝ la yar hoyi tǝ wule, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />&lt;&lt;Wayi! Ununu ghun ki nam mi, Yesu kǝ Nazarat? Kǝ ɗir ni kǝ dǝ kǝ pa'ika nam mi ya? A mom ki woni, ki ni'e muntu ɗǝl sur kar Yam gwa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Kano Yesu ba matl dun itǝri, tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Yoni ɗǝl ter gip mbarǝm tuka!&gt;&gt; Kan dun itǝri ba byal ti atl cina dǝ mbarǝm ju kan ra lasi gwa, kan dun itǝri ba ɗǝlka gip mbarǝmi tǝ pi ti argon da'a.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Kano mbarǝm kǝ lasi kup ba nǝm bi na ame, wu wul ezǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Unu ndǝri shirǝmi utu untu? Tǝ wul dun itǝr'e wu ɗǝl gip mbarǝmka, kano wu ɗǝli.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Argon tu kan Yesu piwo, ar ni kem mbarǝm nǝm yari shirǝm den ti gip atli kup.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu warke mbarǝm na womti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Yesu ɗǝl gip bom kumi shirǝm kǝ Yami kan tǝ ndara bom dǝ Siman. Nakon kǝ Siman ra hoyi da'a, tǝ den kumi dli hoyi. Kan wu lir Yesu, dǝ tǝ warke ti. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Ar ni tǝ ri dlǝr su gam da tika, kan tǝ matl kumi dliyi den tǝ za ti. Ar ni ar za ti, kan tǝ tlyam na zhotǝne, tǝ turi wur fingal tǝ bi wuri.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Nan pǝt nda bino, kup munju kan ra na berǝm na mǝn kan ra hoyi dawo, ar ni wu ɗir wur kar Yesu. Kan Yesu ba ne am gǝs den wur na nǝm nǝm den badǝr kumi dli ju ba ghun wur gwa, kan wu warke. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Untu ni'es dun itǝr ɗǝlka gip mbarǝm na womti, wu den la'i yare, wu den wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Ki nya Yam ni!&gt;&gt; Ar ni Yesu matl wur tǝ wule, ba wu shirǝm da'a, den wu momi ti ni'e Almasihu.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pi wazu gip bom kumi shirǝm kǝ Yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Nan bar tlowo, kan Yesu ba za lasi, tǝ ri gǝs las tu kan mbarǝm ra hoyi da gwa. Kano mbarǝm ba ngen ti ba ngen ti. Nan wu zam tiwo, ar ni wu ndu'e tǝ i ri las gon'es da'a. <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />Kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ar nǝmǝn te yarka a ri yari mbarǝm zo shirǝm kǝ zo dǝmi cina dǝ Yam gip bǝni jeni, den untuni karǝm suri.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Kan Yesu ba nǝm pi wazu gip bom kumi shirǝm kǝ Yam kǝ mǝn Yahuda.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Yesu labi mǝn kopi gǝs kǝ pari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Gasi gon kan, Yesu ra bi ɓula Jenesaratawo, mbarǝm na womti ra kar ti, wu den kumi shirǝm kǝ Yami. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Ar ni Yesu shin kungǝlǝn jikat mal rop bi ɓula'i, mǝn nǝmi kos ni za lasi, wu den ho'i bar kǝ nǝmi kos gǝzǝnka. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Kano Yesu ba to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal kǝ Siman, nǝm gip mǝn nǝmi kos ju, kan tǝ wul ti'e tǝ dǝl ti te gip malika njem. Ar ni tǝ dǝm gipi. Kan tǝ kulci mbarǝme.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Nan tǝ pa'i shirǝmo, ar ni tǝ wul Siman'e, &lt;&lt;Te kungǝlǝn jikat mali kǝ ba dlyami male, kan kǝ la bar kǝ nǝmi kos gi kǝ dǝ kǝ nǝm kose.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Ar ni Siman wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Babomi, mǝ pa mi kǝ gas kup ɗewi, ko nǝm mǝ nǝm argon da'a, kup na untu, tun kan kǝ yari untuwo, naa la bar kǝ nǝmi kosi suka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Nan wu la bar kǝ nǝmi kosi sukawo, kan wu nǝm kos na womti, ar kem bar kǝ nǝmi kos gǝzǝn ba nǝm tlyattǝnka. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />Nan wu shin untuwo, kan wu yiɓǝti ezǝn am kan ra gip kungǝlǝn jikat mali gon gwa, dǝ wu ɗir ne wur amra, nan wu ɗiro, ar ni wu la'i kungǝlǝn jikat mali kup pa rop, bar tuwo kungǝlǝn jikat mal gǝzǝn ba nǝm sitǝnka gǝs male na giɓǝrtǝn kǝ womti kose.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Nan Siman Bitrus shin untuwo, ar ni tǝ ngus cina dǝ Yesu, tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Za ǝm kǝ ndara, Babomi, ami mǝn warwat pitǝn ni!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Siman na berǝm nǝmi kos gǝs kupo, ar dlikǝn wur den womtitǝn kǝ kos ju kan wu nǝm unju gwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />Untun ga Yakubu na Yohana, mimir kǝ Zabadi, berǝm mbap kǝ Siman ar dlǝkǝn wur pa'e. Kano Yesu ba wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ kum bǝrti da'a, cina ɗewo mbarǝm ni ki nǝmi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Ar ni wu dǝl kungǝlǝn jikat mal gǝzǝn tor den bishidi, wu za kup bar ju wi ra nari gwa, kan wu kop ti.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu warke ba mǝn ndǝcci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Nan Yesu ra gip bǝn gono, mbarǝm gon ra kan ndǝcci ci ti narka gwa. Nan tǝ shin Yesuwo, ar ni tǝ nda cina da ti na ba ger gǝs su atlka tǝ lir ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, in kin kǝ ndu'o ki mani warke gǝni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Kano Yesu ba ta am gǝs tǝ ne den ti, tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;A ndu'i, da'i warke!&gt;&gt; Ar ri kǝti gon da'a arni ndicciyi za ti. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Pi untuwo, ar ni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ yari murgon da'a! Ama ri kar ga Lǝɓa kǝ Yam wu shin ki, kan kǝ bi bar ju kan Musa wule dǝ bi kǝ bi ho'i ndǝccika gwa, untu ni mbarǝm ba shin ki kǝ'i na ndǝcci da'a.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ho’i ndǝcci: Murgon nǝra na ndǝcciwo, mbarǝm ba nǝm wur gip dlom gǝzǝn da’a. Se Lǝɓa kǝ Yam ni wul wur’e wu bi bar ju kano doka kǝ Musa yari'e dǝ bi gwa. Wini wu biwo ar ni ga lǝɓa kǝ Yami ba yari mbarǝm’e ndǝcci gǝs za ti wi. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Kup na untuwo, ar ni shirǝm den ti kǝrkǝm ritǝn gip barǝm ra, kan mbarǝm na womti ba nǝm ɗirtǝn kar ti kǝ dǝ wu kum ti, kan tǝ warke munju kan ra hoyi da gwa.<verse eid="LUK 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />Yesu ngapo tǝ kur ri gǝs las ju kan mbarǝm ra hoyi da gwa kǝ dǝ tǝ shirǝm na Yami.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu warke muntu kan itǝr tle tǝka gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Gasi gon kan Yesu ra den kulci mbarǝmo, ar ni mǝn Parise na mǝn kulci mbarǝm doka kǝ Musa, munju kan ɗǝl ɗir gip mir bǝn kǝ Galili kup na kǝ Yahudiya na gip bǝn Urushalima ra njon njon lasi. Iko kǝ Babom ra nan ti kǝ dǝ tǝ warke mbarǝme.<verse eid="LUK 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Kan mbarǝm jen ba ɗir na gon kan itǝr tle tika gwa ra ɓom den ba muri gǝsi, wu ndu te gǝs gip bom las tu kan Yesu ra gwa. <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />Wu zam tǝp da'a, nan mbarǝm womtika gwa, ar ni wu to den rupi kǝ bomi kan wu tul shu wu ne mbarǝmi suka gip dlom kǝ mbarǝm ju den bamuri gǝs cina dǝ Yesu.<verse eid="LUK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Nan Yesu shin ngǝshtǝn gǝzǝn den yam untuwo, ar ni tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Berǝm, ho'i i warwat pitǝn gi kawi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Untu piwo, ar ni mǝn Parise na mǝn kulci mbarǝm doka kǝ Musa nǝm wultǝn gip mbalt gǝzǝni wu wule, &lt;&lt;Unu mbarǝmi ikǝn mǝn mburi Yam we? O fawo, Yam ni nan gǝs ba ho warwat pitǝnka da'a ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Nan Yesu mom unun wu den damtǝn denewo, ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kem kǝ damkǝn untu rawu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Gongeni ban mani, dǝ wule, &lt;Ho warwat pitǝn gi kawa,&gt; ko dǝ wule &lt;Tlyam kǝ ndarawe?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Ama kǝdǝ kǝ mom'e, Nya Mbarǝm ra na iko kǝ dǝ tǝ ho warwat pitǝnka gip duniya ni.&gt;&gt; Ar ni tǝ wul mbarǝm tu kan itǝr tle ti kayi gwa, &lt;&lt;Tlyam kǝ pǝn ba muri gi kǝ ndara bomi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Bar tuwo, arni tǝ tlyam dlor cina dawuri, tǝ pǝn ba muri gǝs cina da wuri kan tǝ ndara bomi tǝ den ɗǝɗa Yami. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Ar dlǝkǝn ko gonge mbarǝme kan wu ɗǝɗa Yami. Gip bǝrti na dlǝkǝntǝn wu nǝm wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Mǝ shin bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝnwi se kǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Den kar kǝ untuwo, ar ni Yesu ɗǝli kan tǝ shin mbarǝm gon mǝn nǝmi wurpi bom kan ba wul ti'e Lawi gwa, tǝra njon kǝ ba nǝmi wurpi bomi. Ar ni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kopǝni!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Kan Lawi ba tlyam tǝ za bar ju kup tǝ ra nari gwa kan tǝ kop ti.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Kano Lawi ba pii Yesu bar nyel bom da ti. Lasiwo mǝn nǝmi wurpi bom na womti, na mbarǝm jen ra lasi den ci bar kǝ ci nan wuri. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Ama mǝn Parisa na mǝn kulci mbarǝm doka Musa nǝm zhe'e shirǝmi, wu wul mir mǝn kulci kar ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ununu kem kǝn den ci na tle na mǝn nǝmi wurpi bom na mǝn warwat pitǝn rawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Munju kan ra hoyi ni ba ngen mǝn bi un da'a. Ama munju kan ra hoyi da gwani ba ngen mǝn bi uni. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />A sur gip duniya kǝn kǝ dǝ a labi mǝn ho pitǝn da'a, ama mǝn warwat pitǝne dǝ wu za warwat pitǝn gǝzǝnka. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngen momi kar Yesu den pi guzum mal na shirǝm na Yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />Kano jen ba wul Yesu'e, &lt;&lt;Mir mǝn kulci kar Yohana ba pi guzum mal na shirǝm na Yam ko gǝgasi, untuni es mir mǝn kulci kar mǝn Parise ba pi, ama gewo wu den ci na tle.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Kano Yesu ba nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝ shin wule ki hane berǝm kǝ mǝn pel gudlumi ci bar kǝ cika wi nǝra na mǝn pel gudlumi gwa ya? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Ama pǝt baa ɗir kan ba pǝn mǝn pel gudlumi tuka kar wuri. Gip muri ja ni wi pi guzum male.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Kan tǝ pa yari wur misali goni, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Murgon ra kan ba tlyati nye yadi den pel lulur kan tǝ bop den gusi da'a. Ti ni tǝ pi untuwo, ti tlyati pel lulur gǝs ka, peli tu kan tǝ bop den gusi lulur tuwo ar ba mbun da'a. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Untu ni esi, murgon ba shoti pel mal kin inabi su gip kor ranka da'a. Ti ni tǝ pi untuwo, pel mal kin inabi tu ba tatl ran juka kan ar shotka, rani eso ar lika ituwi. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mal inabi: Ar ni wule mati shambǝr kan ba ghur na ɗapti gwa. Muntuwo gǝri kin gon ni kan ba zho mal gǝs dǝ shoti su tatka, in le bisika ko ar ni muro se ar matka, ba pi un nari, ama mǝn ra na kini gip atl gǝmi da’a. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Untuni da'a, pel mal kin inabiwo dǝ shot ti gip pel rani. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Murgon ra kan ba ndu'e tin tǝ tla gus mal kin inabiwo, kan tǝ pal tǝ tla peli ra da'a, ti wule &lt; gusiyi njet nari.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Kopi pǝt shukutǝni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Gasi gon den pǝt Asabar pǝt shukutǝni, tǝ den kopi gip kǝn gerowo, ar ni mir mǝn kopi gǝs nǝm ceni gam gero wu den wumi wu den ci gesi. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />Kan mǝn Parisa jen ba wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kem kǝ pi argon tu kan Doka gǝmi ba ndu dǝ pi da gwa den pǝt Asabar?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A, kǝ shin ni gip tǝlankur da'aya? Argon tu gun Dauda pi nan guzum nǝm ti tǝ na berǝm ritǝn gǝs gwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Nan tǝ te gip bom kǝ Yami, tǝ pǝn zo bǝredi kǝ Yam tu kan ba pǝn da gwa tǝ ci, kan tǝ bi berǝm ritǝn gǝs, muntu kan ar hoyi tǝ ci da'a, bar Lǝɓa kǝ yam ni ba ci katl gwa&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Nya Mbarǝm ni'e Babom kǝ Asabar.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muntu itǝr tle ti amka gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Gasi gono den Asabar, tǝ te gip bom kumi shirǝm kǝ Yami tǝ den kulci. Mbarǝm gon ra teka muntu kan itǝr tle ti am shimlika gwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Ar ni mǝn momi na kulci mbarǝm shirǝm kǝ Yam na mǝn parise wi ti gere, wu shin imnu ti warke ti gas Asabar zan wu ri ti cina den'e tǝ jikat doka kǝ Musa kawi. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Yesu ngapo, tǝ mom damtǝn gǝzǝnka. Arni tǝ wul muntu itǝr tle tǝ amika gwa, &lt;&lt;Tlyam kǝ ɗir dlǝr cina ɗe!&gt;&gt; Ar ni tǝ tlyam tǝ ri dlǝr lasi.<verse eid="LUK 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;A ɓa tambe ine, unu dlat pitǝn ni ba pi gas shukutǝni, ho pitǝn na ko wani? Dǝ ɗǝli mbarǝm ma ko dǝ retl tika?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Kan tǝ wi kup gǝzǝn gere, tǝ wul mǝri'e,&lt;&lt; ta am gi&gt;&gt;. Tǝ ta ami, ar ni am gǝs pal hoyi. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Ama lo ci wur hoyi, kan wu nǝm damtǝn den argon tu wi pi Yesu gwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zǝzar mir mǝn kartǝn bar kutl cet rop</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Gasi gon gip muri juwo, Yesu to den tlǝndǝr kǝ shirǝm na Yami, tǝ ci gas tǝ den shirǝm na Yami. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Bar tlowo, tǝ labi mir mǝn kopi gǝsi, tǝ ɗǝli kutl cet rop gip wuri, tǝ pali wur wu dǝm mǝn kulci kar ti. <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Wi ni'e, Siman, muntu tǝ ne ti sun'e Bitrus gwa, na esi Andarawus, na Yakubu, na Yahaya, na Filibus, na Bartalamawus, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />na Matiyu, na Toma, na Yakubu nya Halfa, na Siman, muntu ba wul ti'e Zaloti gwa, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />na Yahuda nya Yakub, kan na Yahuda Iskaryoti muntu ɗir la'i Yesu gǝs Yam gwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbarǝm na womti kop Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />Ar ni tǝ ɗǝl sur nan wur kǝ ba ngǝlan lasi. Mbarǝm na womti nǝm kopi gǝsi. Eso mbarǝm na womti ɗǝl ɗir gip atl kǝ Yahudiya, na Urushalima, na ba atl kǝ Taya na Sidon, munju kan bi bar ɓula gwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Wu ɗir kǝ kumi gǝsi wu ndu tǝ warke wur gip arjen ju ba ci wur gwa, munju dun itǝr ba ghun wuro tǝ ɗǝlii wurka. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />Mbarǝm kup den ndu'i ne am den ti, nan iko kǝ Yam den ɗǝltǝn ter gip ti gwa, tǝ warke wur kup.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumi tǝmi na kumi dli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />Yesu bal ti den mǝn kopi gǝs tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝn mǝn albarka ni, kǝn kan na argon da gwa, Yamo gun gin ni. <verse eid="LUK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Kǝn mǝn albarkani kǝn mǝn kumi guzum kǝkǝni cina ɗewo tu gin ba la'i, kǝn mǝn albarkani kan den kulu kǝkǝn gwa, ki gyatli. <verse eid="LUK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Kǝn mǝn albarkani mbarǝm ni ba nge in gwa wu ɗǝli inka, wu zage ine, wu wule kǝn mǝn ɗasi tuni den kǝn mǝn kopi Nya Mbarǝm ni. <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Pini ghol mbatli, in untu ni zam kǝn gwa, dlar ni kǝ pini ghol mbatli, zo ɓatltǝn gin ra to kar Yamka, untun kori gǝzǝn pi mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam kan sur cina da in gwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Ar ba dǝm bar kǝ guna den kǝne, kǝn kan na bar kǝ am kǝkǝn gwa, kǝ kum tǝmi gin ituwi. <verse eid="LUK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Ar ba dǝm bar kǝ guna den kǝne, kǝn kan tu gin la kǝkǝn gwa, cina ɗewo guzum ba ci ine. Ar ba dǝm bar kǝ guna den kǝne, kǝm kan den gyatl kǝkǝn gwa, ki pi dun mbatl kǝ kuli! <verse eid="LUK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Ar ba dǝm bar kǝ guna den kǝne, kǝn kan kǝ cir kar mbarǝm gwa, untun kori gǝzǝn pi munju cen lar'e wi mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam ni gwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nduni mǝn nge gini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />&lt;&lt;A yari ine, kǝn mǝn kumi gǝni, nduni mǝn nge gini, pini munju ba ndu kǝn da gwa ho bari.<verse eid="LUK 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />La'ini mǝn yari bes shirǝm den kǝn albarka, liri ni mǝn ghuni gin Yami. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Murgon ni la'i in ankayama den gǝskǝmo bali ti gǝskǝmi gon esi, muntu nǝmi'i bar lulur kawo, tus kǝ gipi kǝ bi tǝka. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Muntu liri i baro bi ti, muntu zote i bar kawo ba kǝ ngen tǝ pali'i da'a. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Pi ni mbarǝm bar ju kan kǝ ndu'e wu pi in gwa.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />In kǝ ndu mǝn ju ba ndu kǝn katlo, akon ki zam albarka? Mǝn warwat pitǝn ba ndu mǝn ndu'i gǝzǝn pa'e. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Kǝn ni kǝ pi ho bar munju ba pi'in katlo, im ni ki zam albarka? Untun mǝn warwat pitǝn ba pi pa'e.<verse eid="LUK 6:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Munju ba mani ɓatli gin ni kǝ bi wur asǝm yam katlo im ni ki zam albarka rawu? Mǝn warwat pitǝn ma wu bi asǝm yam mbarǝme kǝ dǝ pali wur untu. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Kǝno ndu ni mǝn nge gi ni, pi wur ni alheri, bi ni asǝm yam ba kǝ la ni mbatl'e ba pali in da'a. Untun ki zam zo ɓatltǝn na nari, kǝn ngapo ki dǝm mimir kǝ Babom Yami. Tiwo mǝn alheri ni kar mbarǝm ju ba goode Yam da gwa, na mǝn ɗasi tu'e. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Dǝm ni mǝn kumi guna'i wule Ba gin mǝn kumi guna'i.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shin ni murgon na dun ger da'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />Ba kǝ shin ni murgon na dun ger da'a, kǝn ma ba shin kǝn nari da'a. Ba kǝ hukunte ni murgon da'a, kǝn ma ba hukunte in da'a. Ho'ini ya'ǝn warwat pitǝn gǝzǝn ka, kǝn ma ba ho'i in gegi ni. <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Bi ni, kǝn ma ba bi ine. Shar na la'i dǝ tǝtǝ'i har ar ba shotka, baa shoti in gip am luluri. Shar tu kǝ bi gipi, gipi ni ba bi ine.<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />Yesu pa yari wur misali gon tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Tabi ba dǝli esi tabi dlo ya? In tǝ pi untuwo kup gǝzǝn wi nda gip shuka. <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />Nye mǝn kulci ba man muntu ba kulci ti gwa ya? Ama kup nye mǝn kulci tun pa'iwo, ti dǝm wule muntu ba kulci ti gwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Unun kem kǝ shin nye jir tukan te ger dǝ gon ka kan basi nyash tu te ger da ika kǝ mom nari da'awe? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Imni ki mani wuli ya'i'e, &lt;Na ɗǝli'i nye jir tukan te ger da'ika gwa,&gt; kan kiwo kǝ nge shini basi nyash tu te ger da'i ka? Ki bes mbarǝme! Ɗǝli basi nyash kǝ ger da'i ka kani, kan kǝ'i shin bar hoyi, kǝ dǝ kǝ mani ɗǝli nye jir tukan te ger dǝ ya'i kagwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba mom kin den gǝritǝn gǝsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />Ho kin ba gǝri wani mimir da’a, untuni es wani kin ba gǝri ho mimir da'a. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Ba mom kin den gǝritǝn gǝsi. Ba kotl nyen den kin ir da'a, ko imbǝr den kin patl gami. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />Ho mbarǝmo tǝ pini ho bari, don ho bar ni su gip mbatl da ti ka, ama mǝn ɗasi tu'o, tǝ pini warwat pitǝne don wani barni gip mbatl gǝsi, argon tu su gip mbatl kawo arni bi ba yari.<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbarǝm rop mǝn tu'i bomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Unun kem kǝ wulǝn'e, &lt;Babomi, Babomi&gt; kan kǝ nge pi argon tu a wule kǝ pi gwawu? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Kup muntu ɗir karǝm tǝ kum argon tu a yari, tin tǝ pi argon tu a wul ti’e tǝ piwo, a yari in unu mbarǝm ni'e ti. <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Ti ni wule mbarǝm kan tli kǝ tu'i bomo, ar ni tǝ bor shu na dlyami, tǝ ɓa gǝs kushiyi den tate. Nan ɓula la'iwo, mal ɓula'i sur ɓo bomi, ar jiti ti da’a, don ɓa gǝsi den tate. <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Muntu kup kum shirǝm gǝn kan tǝ pi argon tu a wule tǝ pi da'a, tin wule mbarǝm kan la gǝs bom gǝs hoyi da gwa. Nan ɓula la'i mal sur ɓo bomiwo, ar ni ar yaska kup, ndetǝniwo ar tǝm shini da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Yesu warke zher kǝ bar mǝn bi utu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Kan Yesu pa'i yari kup argon tu kan tǝ ndu tǝ yari mbarǝmo, ar ni tǝ ndara Kaparnahum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Zher kǝ bar mǝn bi utu kǝ Roma den kumi dli, tǝra bi dǝ mǝshtǝni. Bar mǝn bi utu kǝ Romayi ba ndu zher gǝsi nari. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mǝn Yahuda na mǝn bǝni jen ma wi nǝra gǝs Bar bǝn kǝ Roma. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Nan tǝ kum'e Yesu rawo, ar ni tǝ kar kiri kǝ mǝn Yahuda, wu lir ti tǝ ɗir warke zher gǝsi. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Kiri yi lir Yesu hoyi, wu wule, &lt;&lt;In murgon ra kan ba ndu ne am rawo, mbarǝm tu ni. <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />Tǝ ndu mbarǝm gǝmi nari, tini ma tǝ tu'i mi bom kumi shirǝm kǝ Yami.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Kan Yesu ba kop wuri, tǝ dlyam na bom tu kan wuriwi da gwa, ar ni bar mǝn bi utu tu kar berǝm gǝs jen rǝnka, tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Babomi, ba kǝ ghun gam gi kǝ ɗirtǝn da'a, amo a kǝm kǝ ɗir lastu kan a dǝm gwa da'a. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Amo a pali gam gǝn argonni da'a nan a ri kar ki gwa. Untuwo, shirǝme, zher gǝn ba warke. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Ami ma am dǝ jenni ami ra, na mǝn bi utu karǝmi, a wul muntu'e, &lt;Rǝka,&gt; Kan tǝ ri, gon ngapo, &lt;Ɗiri&gt;, Kan tǝ ɗiri, a pa wul zher gǝni'e, &lt;Pi bar kǝni&gt;, Kan tǝ pi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Nan Yesu kum untuwo, ar ni tǝ nǝm bi na ame, kan tǝ bal ti rǝn den womti mbarǝm ju kan den kopi gǝs gwa, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A yari ine, ko gip Isra'ila a zam mǝn la'i Yam mbatl wule muntu wi da'a!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Nan munju kar wuri pal rǝn bomkawo, arni wu zam zheri warke wi.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu tli nya nagǝr tu kan bakos mǝshi tika gwa.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Ar ri dlyam wi da’a, ar ni Yesu ndara gip bǝn goni, muntu ba wul ti'e Nayin gwa, mǝn kopi gǝs na mbarǝm na womti ndara nan ti. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Tǝ mbi kosak na bǝdlabǝn tetǝn gip bǝni ituwi, arni tǝ zam mbarǝm pǝn mǝshi mbarǝm ɗirwi, tini nǝm den nase, bakos gǝs mǝsh kawi pa'e. Mbarǝm na womti la ti tǝpe. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Nan Yesu shin tiwo, guna ci ti den ti, arni tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Za kulu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Arni tǝ isha ti teka, tǝ taɓe bar kǝ pǝni mǝshi mbarǝmi, munju den pǝni ngapo kan wu dlǝr kǝ ba lasi. Kan Yesu ba wule, &lt;&lt;Nye moni, a wul ki'e kǝ tlyami!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Ar ni mǝshi mbarǝmi tlyami tǝ dǝm njon, kan tǝ nǝm shirǝmi! Yesu ta ti am dǝ mǝn gǝri gǝsi.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Ar ni bǝrti nǝm wur kup gǝzǝn na nari, arni wu nǝm ɗǝɗa Yami, kan wu wule, &lt;&lt;Bar mǝn shirǝm na Yam mbira kar mi wi, sekǝno Yam mom na mbarǝm gǝs wi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Shirǝm den argon tu Yesu pi gastuwo ar ri kup atl kǝ Yahudiya na atl ju kano ra markǝmi gwa.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Yohana mǝn Batisma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Mir mǝn kulci kar Yohana mǝn Batisma yari ti kup bar ju kan pi gwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />Ar ni Yohana labi mir mǝn kulci kar ti mbarǝm rop, tǝ kar wur ri kar Babomi ka, tǝ den ndu'i'e tǝ momi ti ni'e mǝn surtǝn tu ya, ko dǝ wu ɓut zuti. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Muntu wu ɓutiwo tini’e Almasihu </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Nan mbarǝm ju mbu bar kar tiwo, wu wul Yesu'e, &lt;&lt;Yohana mǝn Batismani kar mi kar ki, tǝ ndu'e tǝ momi, &lt;Ki ni'e mǝn surtǝn tuya, ko mǝ ɓut zuti?&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Gip wokoci yi, ar ni Yesu warke mbarǝm na womti munju kan den kumi dli, na arjen ju den ghuni gǝzǝn gwa, na mǝn dun itǝri. Kan tǝ bi ger tabi na womti. <verse eid="LUK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Arni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ri yarini Yohana argon tu kǝ kum kan kǝ shin gwa. Tabi den shini bari, munju kan na asǝm da'a wu den desi, mǝn ndǝcci den zami warketǝne, munju kan ba kum da'a wu den kumi, mǝshi mbarǝm den tlyamtǝn lasi, munju am ri wur kar da'a den kumi wazu zo shirǝm kǝ Yami. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Albarka ra den muntu kan pat asǝmka na sun gǝn da gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Kan mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yohana ndarawo, ar ni Yesu shirǝm na womti mbarǝmi den Yohana, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝri gip lǝp kǝ shini unu? Jir jukan itǝr ba jiti gwaya? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Dawo, unun ri ine? Mbarǝm mǝn la'i bar lulura? Shinni! Munju ba la bar lulur, na dǝmi kǝ kumi tǝmiwo, gip bom kǝ gunni wura. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Untu da'a, kǝ ri ni kǝ shini unu? Mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam na? Untuni, a yari i'ne, tǝ man mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yami. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Ti ni'e muntu rǝsh den ti gwa'e, &lt;Aa kar nye mǝn kartǝn bar gǝn cina da'i, muntu kan baa kǝrkǝmi'i guntǝp gi gwa.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />A yari ine, gip munju kan mǝtli gǝriwo, gon ra kan man Yohana nartǝn gwa da'a. Kup na untu, muntu kan'e heli gip mulki kǝ Yamo, tǝ man ti nartǝni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Nan mbarǝm kup na mǝn nǝmi wurpi bom kum untuwo, ar ni wu nǝm'e Yamo mǝn pitǝn korni, domici Yohana pi wur batisma wi. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Ama Parisawa na mǝn kulci mbarǝm shirǝm tu kan Yam bi Musa gwa, nge argon tu Yam ba ndu nan wur gwa, domici wu nge dǝ Yohana pi wur batisma. <verse eid="LUK 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />&lt;&lt;Na unun a ngash mbarǝm kǝ zhan kǝni, imni wura? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Wule mimirni wura, munju ba dǝm kǝ ba bar pǝt gwa, wu labi ezǝn, wu wule, &lt;Mǝ hori in mǝzhele, kǝ dlar da'a, mǝ la utu bomi, kǝ kul da'a.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Ar tu Yohana mǝn batisma ɗiri, tǝ ci burodi da'a, tǝ tla mati shambǝr da'a, kǝ pal kǝ wule, &lt;Tǝ mǝn itǝr ni.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Nya Mbarǝm ɗir tǝ ci tǝ tla, kǝ pal kǝ wule, &lt;Bar mǝn ci, bar mǝn tle, berǝm kǝ mǝn nǝmi wurpi bom na mǝn warwat pitǝne.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Kup na untu, munju kan nǝm hikima kǝ Yam tor gip mbatl gǝzǝno, pitǝn gǝzǝn ba gode'e hikimayi'e ge shirǝmi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nagǝr mǝn wani pitǝn shoti mir den kar asǝm kǝ Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Ba Parise gon la tibi kǝ ci bar kǝ ci. Ar ni tǝ ri bom da ti, tǝ dǝm kǝ ba ci fingali. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Kan nagǝr gon muntu ba pi ho pitǝn da gwa, kum' e Yesu den ci bar kǝ ci rǝn bom dǝ Ba Parise ka, kan tǝ ɗir na zo mbun let mir mǝn tǝmi kasǝri. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />Tǝ dlǝr kar da ti, kǝ ba kar asǝm gǝsi tǝ den kulu. Ar ni lun gǝs shot den kar asǝm gǝsi, tǝ sarka na ta gam gǝsi, tǝ nǝm ɓopi, kan tǝ bǝrkeka na mir mǝn tǝmi kasǝri.<verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Gip untuwo, nan Ba Parise tu kan la ti bi shin untuwo, ar ni tǝ dam ti gip mbatl gǝsi, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm kǝno mǝn shirǝm na Yamni haro, ti mom unu nagǝr ni'e muntu kan ba ne am den ti gwa, ar tu ti mǝn ho pitǝn ni da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Yesu nǝmi ti, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Saminu, a ndu shirǝm nan ki.&gt;&gt; Ar ni tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Malam, yari.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm gon ba kop mbarǝm rop wurpi, nǝmo wurpi zangu nantam kǝ zinariya, nǝm ngapo hauya rop na kutl. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Zinariya: Wurpi kǝ mǝn Romani, muntu kan an ri wurpi mbap kǝ mbarǝm kǝ pǝt nǝm gwa. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Nan wu mani ɓatli dawo, ar ni tǝ za'i wurka kup gǝzǝn ropi. Gip wuro woni ba ndu ti mani?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Saminu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Gip shini gǝno, muntu tǝ za'i ti narika gwa.&gt;&gt; Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ yari dlat.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Nan tǝ bali ger kar nagǝriwo, tǝ wul Saminu'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ shǝn nagǝr tuya, a ter gip bom gi kǝ bin mal ho'i kar asǝm da'a, tǝwo tǝ shot lun gǝs den kar asǝm gǝni, tǝ sarka na ta gam gǝsi. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Kiwo kǝ ɓopǝn da'a, tiwo, tun nan a tero, tǝ za ɓopi kar asǝm gǝn da'a. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓopi: Gip al’ada kǝ mǝn Yahudawo ɓopi gǝskǝme ko goshiwo ar ba nune shirmitǝnni na ghol mbatli. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Kǝ shotim mir den gam da'a, tiwo, tǝ shotin mir mǝn tǝmi kasǝr den kar asǝm gǝni. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Ra untuwo, a yari'i, wani bar ju tǝ piwo kup pǝni ti kawi, ar ni kem tiwo tǝ pi ndutǝn nari. Ama muntu pǝni ti nye heli wani pitǝnkawo, ndutǝn njem ni tǝ pi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Ar ni tǝ wul nagǝr mǝri'e, &lt;&lt;Pǝni'i wani pitǝn gi kawi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Munju den ci nan tiwo, wu wul ezǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Muntuwo woni'e ti, mǝn pǝni wani pitǝnkawe?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 7:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Ar ni Yesu wul gǝri'e, &lt;&lt;La'i Yam mbatl gi ɗǝli iwi, ndara na ghol mbatli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Mǝtli jen mǝn kopi Yesu ri na Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Den kar kǝ untuwo, Yesu kop gip bǝn jen na bi lǝpe tǝ den pi wazu kǝ zo shirǝm kǝ mulki kǝ Yami. Mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs kutl cet rop ra nan ti, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />eso mǝtli jen ra nan ɗǝli wur dun itǝr na kumi dli gǝzǝn gwa, Maryamu (nan ba wul ti'e Magadaliya) muntu nan dun itǝr nyingi ɗǝl gip ti gwa, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Yuwana gǝr kǝ Kuza mǝn dlǝri bom kǝ Hiridus gami, Suzana, na mǝtliyi jen'es na womti nan ba ne ga Yesu am ra na bar gǝzǝn gwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misali kǝ mǝn ngani badǝre</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Nan mbarǝm na womti den domtǝn, wu den ɗǝltǝn ɗir gip bǝn jen na womti, wu ɗir kar Yesu ar ni tǝ bi wur misali tu, tǝ wule, <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />&lt;&lt;Mǝn kori bar gon ri kǝ ngani badǝr gǝsi. Tǝ gip wi badǝr gǝso ar ni jen ro den tǝpe kan ba desika, kan yatl ba ɗami wu zhingeka. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Badǝri jen ba ro den goca, nan ar yetlo, kan woli ba landǝrka nan lasi na yari da gwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Badǝri jen ba ro gip ire, kan wu nar tor na badǝri kan iri ba tla badǝrika. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Jen eso kan wu nda den ho atli, ar ba yetli kan an ba wi ho ge hauya nantam man badǝr tu ngani gwa.&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Nan tǝ yari untuwo, ar ni tǝ tli yar yam tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Murgon tu na kǝm kǝ kumiwo, tǝ kumi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Mǝn kopi gǝs tambe ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Unun shirǝm tu ba yari?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Momi sǝrri kǝ mulki kǝ Yamo bi'in wi, ama jeno na misalin A shirǝm nan wuri, kǝ dǝ wu zhuwi, wi shin da'a, wu kumi, wi mom da'a.<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />&lt;&lt;Argon tu misali tu ba yari gwa utu, Badǝriwo shirǝm kǝ Yamni. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Munju den tǝpo wi ni'e munju kan kumi, ar ni Shetan ɗir pǝn shirǝmi gip mbatl gǝzǝnka, kǝ bǝse wu nǝmi wu zam ceto ra. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Munju ro den gocawo, wi ni'e munju kan nǝm shirǝm kǝ Yam na ghol mbatli nan wu kum gwa, ama wi na tlǝrti da'a, wu nǝm kǝ mir muri njem. Nan godetǝn ɗiro, ar ni wu pal gǝzǝn na kari. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Badǝr ju ro gip iro, wi ni’e munju kumi, wi gip untuwo ar ni ne mbatl den bar kǝ duniya, ngeni nartǝn na kumi tǝmi tla wurka wu pi hoyi da'a. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Ama badǝr ju ro den ho atlo, wini'e mbarǝm mǝn zo mbatl na ho pitǝn kan kum shirǝm kǝ Yami, wu nǝm na mbatl nǝm wu ɓal mbatl dlom gami, kan wu pi ho bari.<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumni shirǝm gǝn hoyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />Murgon ba mbǝsh pitila kan tǝ zupka na bar gal ko tǝ neka gǝs dandi muri da'a, ama ti ne to den ba dǝmi gǝska munju kup ter gipiwo, wu shin cirtǝni. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Bar gon ra na ghundǝri kan ba ɓulka da gwa, argon ra nan leka kan ba ɓulka ko dǝ ɗǝlika den kari da gwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Ngup kǝn ni na kandatu kǝ kumi, don murgon ni ra na baro ba mbǝli ti ra, ama muntu kan na argon dawo, ba nǝmi ti nye argon tu tǝ kum tǝ ra nari gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nasi Yesu na mir ezǝni ɗir karti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Arni nasi Yesu na mir ezǝn ɗir kar ti, wu ndu shini gǝsi, ama wu mbu tetǝn kar ti da'a, nan mbarǝm womtika gwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Kan murgon ba wul Yesu'e, &lt;&lt;Nǝna gi na mir ya'ǝn ra dlor te karika wu ndu shini gi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Tǝ nǝmi, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Nǝna gǝn na mir ɓyaro, wini'e munju ba kum shirǝm kǝ Yam kan wu dlǝr dene gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu matl itǝr kan itǝri ba dlǝri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Gasi gono Yesu shirǝm na mir mǝn kopi gǝs tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Mǝ teni te bishidiyi mǝnta.&gt;&gt; Arni wu to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal wu nǝm tetǝne. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Wu den tetǝn den malo anni Yesu nde umurka. Arni bar itǝr tli ɗir den bar ɓula'i, ar kem mal ba su gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal gǝzǝni wi ra gip hasari.<verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Mir mǝn kopi gǝs ba ri putu ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi! Babomi! Mal bari kǝ tle mi gam kawi!&gt;&gt; Tǝ tlyam tǝ matl itǝri na mal ju den tlitǝn gwa, kan itǝri ba za'i, ko unu ba sa shot. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Tǝ tambe mir mǝn kopi gǝs tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Akon ne mbatl gin ra?&gt;&gt; Gip bǝrti na dlǝkǝntǝn hoyi wu tambe ezǝni, &lt;&lt;Woni'e muntu? Tǝ matl itǝr na mal ma kan wu kop shirǝm gǝsi!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu warke mǝn dun itǝri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Wu nǝm tetǝn gip mali wu mbu bar gip ba las kǝ Garasinawa, muntu kan te bi bar ɓulaka daga Galili gwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Nan Yesu te ɗǝl bi ɓula'iwo, anni tǝ mo na mǝn dun itǝr gon daga gip bǝni, tǝ zam muri na womti wi tǝ la lulur da'a ko tǝ dǝm gip bomi, ama tǝ dǝmni gip shu gam bǝci'e.<verse eid="LUK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Nan tǝ shin Yesuwo, tǝ la yare kan tǝ nda cina dǝ Yesu tǝ den la'i yar, tǝ den wultǝm'e, &lt;&lt;Ununu kǝ ndu kǝ pi namǝni, Yesu, nya Bar Gun Yami? A lir ki, ba kǝ bin wuya da'a!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Tǝ yari ni untu nan Yesu tare matl dun itǝriwi kǝ dǝ tǝ ɗǝl gip mbarǝmika gwa. Biyi na womti dun itǝr kǝ gip ti ba kem in Mbarǝm ni ɓal ti na zap gǝlla am na asǝm dǝ pal dǝ le tika ma, tǝ kur ngot zap gǝllayika. Dun itǝri ba kur kem ti ritǝn gǝs gip lǝpe.<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Yesu tambe ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Unu'e sun gi?&gt;&gt; &lt;&lt;Womti&gt;&gt; tǝ wul untu, don dun itǝr na womti ra kan te gip ti gwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Wu pi ta liri gǝsi, ba tǝ kar wur wu su gip shu ne dun itǝr da'a. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Lasiwo alade ra na womti nan den ci bar kǝ ci gǝs tlǝndǝre gwa. Dun itǝri lir Yesu dǝ tǝ za wur wu te gip wuri, anni Yesu nǝmi wuri. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Nan dun itǝri ɗǝl gip mbarǝmiwo, wu te gip alade yi, kan womti alade ju ba tli na kǝtǝre, wu su ro gip ɓula wu tla mal wu mǝshka.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Nan mǝn le alade yi shin argon tu piwo, wu ri gip bǝn na bi lǝp na kǝtǝre, wu yari bar tu pi gwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Arni mbarǝm ɗǝl wu ri zhit argon tu pi gwa, nan wu ɗir kar Yesuwo, wu zam mbarǝmi nan dun itǝr ɗǝlka gip ti gwa, tǝra njon cina dǝ Yesu, tǝra na lulur den dli na mbatl nǝm, ar ni bǝrti nǝm wuri. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dǝmi cina den asǝm kǝ gono: Gip al’ada kǝ mǝn Yahudawo, ar ni’e dǝmi nye mǝn kulci kar ti. Untuwo, nan mbarǝm tu dǝm cina dǝ Yesuwo tǝ wul ni’e ti dǝm mǝn kulci kar Yesu. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Mǝn ju nan shino anni wu yari mbarǝm kanda tu mǝn dun itǝri zam warketǝn gwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Arni kup mbarǝm kǝ atl kǝ Garasinawa wi wul Yesu'e tǝ ndara tǝ za wuri, don bǝrti nǝm wur na nari. Arni tǝ to gip kungǝlǝn jikat mal tǝ ndara.<verse eid="LUK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Mbarǝm tu dun itǝri ɗǝl gip tiwo, tǝ lir Yesu'e ti kop ti, ama Yesu wul ti'e tǝ ndara, tǝ wule, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />&lt;&lt;Pal rǝn bomka kǝ yari argon tu Yam pi'i gwa.&gt;&gt; Arni mbarǝmi ndara, kan tǝ yari mbarǝm kǝ bǝni kup argon tu Yesu pi ti gwa.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu tli mǝshi nye gǝre kan tǝ warke gǝr mǝn kumi dli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Nan Yesu palo, mbarǝm na womti pi ɗem nan ti, tunkawo wi ni den ɓuti gǝsi. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Arni mbarǝm gon nan ba wul ti'e Yayirus, gun kǝ bom kumi shirǝm kǝ Yami, tǝ ɗir tǝ ngus cina dǝ Yesu tǝ den liri gǝsi dǝ tǝ ri bom da ti. <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />Don nya gǝs nye gǝr nan ne ti nǝm, nye mǝn sheti ghon kutl cet rop, ra bi dǝ mǝshtǝni.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Nan Yesu ra den tǝpo, womti mbarǝm tlaa ti nari. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Nagǝr gon gip wur nan bǝran den tatltǝn den ti kǝ sheti ghon kutl cet rop, ama tǝ zam muntu nan ba dlǝrika da gwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Tǝ ɗir tǝp kaar dǝ Yesu kan tǝ taɓe bi lulur gǝsi, bar tu arni shottǝn kǝ bǝran gǝsi dlǝri. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />&lt;&lt;Woni taɓem we?&gt;&gt; Yesu tambe. Nan kup mbarǝm ju wule wini dawo, arni Bitǝrus wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, mbarǝm ra na womti nan tlaa ki gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Ama Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;Murgon ra taɓe mi, A kum iko ɗǝl gipǝni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Nan nagǝr mǝri shin baa mom ti kawo, arni tǝ ɗir nda cina dǝ Yesu gip dǝdartǝn na bǝrti den ger kǝ mbarǝm ju kup ra lasi gwa, tǝ yar argon tu kem tǝ taɓe Yesu ra gwa, na kanda tu gip lasiwo tǝ warke gwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Nya gǝni, la'i mbatl gi warke iwi, ndara na ghol mbatli.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Nan Yesu ra den shirǝmo, arni nye mǝn kartǝn gon ɗǝl ɗir bom dǝ Yayirus, gun kǝ bom kumi shirǝm kǝ Yami tǝ wul Yayirus'e, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ'i ghun ba mǝn kulciyi da'a, nyayi mǝsh kawi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Na kumi untuwo, arni Yesu wul Yayirus'e, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ kum bǝrti da'a, la mbatli ti warke.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Nan tǝ mbu bar bom dǝ Yayiruso, tǝ za murgon kop ti kar te gip bomika da'a, sai ga Bitǝrus, Yohana na Yakub na basi nyayi na nase. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Ngapo, mbarǝm kup ra den la'i yar na kulu mǝshtǝn kǝ nyayi. Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Zani kulu, tǝ mǝsh nǝka da'a, umurni tǝ dene.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Arni wu gyatli ti, shini gǝzǝno tǝ mǝsh kawi. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Kan Yesu ba nǝm am gǝs, tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Nya gǝni, tlyami.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Ar ni rai gǝs pal gip ti, na zhotǝne kan tǝ tlyam dlor. Arni Yesu wul wur’e wu bi ti fingal tǝ ci. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Ar dlǝkǝn mǝn gǝri gǝsi, ama Yesu dǝli wur kǝm den ba wu yari murgon argon tu pi gwa da'a.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Yesu kar mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs kutl cet ropi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Arni Yesu labi mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs kutl cet rop wu dom wur kar ti, tǝ bi wur iko kǝ mani pi bar den am gǝsi, wu ɗǝli dun itǝri na warke kumi dlika kup. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />Tǝ kar wur wu pi wazu den Yam ba ndu mi na dǝmi cina da ti, wu pali mǝn kumi dli dlat. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Tǝ pa wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ba kǝ pǝn ni argon kǝ ndaratǝn da'a, ko dlo, ko poshe, ko fingal, ko wurpi. Ba kǝ rǝ ni na lulur rop da'a. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Kup bom tu nǝm kǝno dǝm ni lasi an ri gastu ki za bǝni gwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Kup bǝn tu nǝm kǝn dawo, kǝn ni kǝ za bǝni wo, bad ni kushka kǝ asǝm ginka zan kǝ honi gam ginka kar wuri.&gt;&gt; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bati kushka den asǝmkawo pitǝn kǝ mǝn Yahudani, ar’e “Ar pa den kǝne.” Mǝn bati kushkayi dǝli wur kǝm utuwi.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Arni wu tlyami, kan wu kop bǝn na womti wu den pi wazu zo shirǝm kǝ Yami, wu den warke mbarǝm kup las ju wu ri gwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hiridus gip damtǝne den bar ju Yesu den pi gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Nan Gun Hiridus kum bar ju den pitǝno ar ghun ti hoyi, den'e jen den wultǝn'e Yohana kan mǝshka gwani tlyam esi. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Jen wule Iliyani mbirawi, jen ngapo wu wule nǝm gip mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam kǝ terkani tlyam esi. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Hiridus wule, &lt;&lt;A kotli gam Yohana mǝn Batisma kawi, kan woni a kum shirǝm ju den ti esi?&gt;&gt; Tǝ ndu'e tǝ shin ti.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu bi fingal mbarǝm zangu kutl kǝ ba lasi nantam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Nan mir mǝn kartǝn bar kǝ Yesu pal ɗiro, wu yari Yesu argon tu kan wu pi gwa. Ar ni ti yem wur tǝ ndara nan wur njil gǝzǝn bǝn tu ba wul ti'e Betsaida gwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Nan womti mbarǝm mom las tu tǝrawo, ar ni wu kop ti, kan tǝ nǝm wuri. Tǝ pi wur shirǝm den zo dǝmi cina dǝ Yami. Tǝ pa warke munju den kumi dli gwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Nan pǝt ba su bino kan mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs kutl cet ropi ba ɗir kar ti wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Za mbarǝmi wu ri gip mir bǝn na bi lǝp ju kan wi zam bar kǝ ci gwa, na las tu wi mur gwa, ɗewo argon ra da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Ar ni Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝno bi wur ni fingal wu ci.&gt;&gt; Arni wu bali ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Burodi nantam na kos rop ni katl mǝn ra nari in untu no, mi ri wuri wur kup wu ci.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Mbarǝm ju lasiwo wu pi wule moni zangu kutl kǝ ba lasi nantam [500]. Ar ni Yesu wul mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs'e, &lt;&lt;Wul ni mbarǝmi'e wu dǝm atli, wu dom wur hauya rop na kutl-kutl.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Arni mir mǝn kartǝn gǝsi pi den yari gǝsi, wu kem mbarǝm kup wu dǝm atli. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Kan Yesu ba pǝn burodi nantam na kos rop, kan tǝ la gam yam tǝ goode Ba gun Yami, kan tǝ cetǝli tǝ bi mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs wu bi mbarǝm kup. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Arni kup gǝzǝn ci den bi tu gǝzǝni! Kan mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs ba yem shar kutl cet rop kǝ munju mbarǝm za gwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bitrus yari woni'e Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Gasi gon Yesu den shirǝm na Yam tǝ nan gǝsi, arni mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs ra kar ti, kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm ba wule ami woni?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Jen wule Yohana mǝn batisma, jen wule Iliyani, jen ngapo wu wule nǝm gip mǝn shirǝm na Yam jen kǝ terkani pal lasi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Ar ni Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝno woni kǝ wulǝm ra?&gt;&gt; Bitrus bali ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ki ni'e Almasihu kan Yam wule ti kar sur gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Arni Yesu dǝli wur kǝm hoyi den'e ba wu yari murgon shirǝm tu da'a.<verse eid="LUK 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />Tǝ pa wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ar nǝm ami Nya Mbarǝm te yarka a kum dli hoyi den bar na womti. Kiri mbarǝm na kiri mǝn keri bar ju domi Yam gwa, na mǝn bar momi shirǝm kǝ Yam wi nge mi, kan wu rin e, gip muri myakan ngapo ba tlim lasi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Arni tǝ wul kup gǝzǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Muntu kan ba ndu kopi gǝno, ti nge gam gǝs kakani, ti nǝm e tǝ kum dli ko tǝ mǝshi den tǝ mǝn kopi gǝn ni se na gǝni, kan tǝ kopǝni. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Kup muntu ba ndu gam gǝso ti i zam da'a. Ngapo muntu nge gam gǝs demǝno ti zam Yam bomi, <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />unu ho bar ni mbarǝm ba zami tin tǝ zam duniya kup kan tǝ zam Yam bom da gwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Muntu kup ba kum sham gǝn na shirǝm gǝno, ami Nya Mbarǝm a kum sham gǝsi gastu a pal sur na nartǝn gǝn, na nartǝn kǝ Ban na mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam mǝn tsarki kan ɗǝl sur kar Yam gwa. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Na ho bini A yari ine, jen ra gip kǝn dlor ɗe kan ba mǝsh da gwa se win wu shin zo dǝmi cina dǝ Yami.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu cirka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Kar dǝ muri wuzupse na yari shirǝm tuwo, kan Yesu ba pǝn Bitrus, na Yohana, kan na Yakubu, ar ni wu to den tlǝndǝr kǝ shirǝm na Yami. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Ti gip shirǝm na Yamo, ar ni bager gǝs canze ka, lulur gǝs ngapo ar cirka gholi tar. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Arni mbarǝm rop cwat kan wu nda shirǝm nan ti. Mbarǝm ropiwo, wi ni'e mǝn shirǝm na Yam Musa na Iliya. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Cirtǝn gǝzǝn nge ger kǝ shini nan wu cwat gwa, kan wu nǝm bali iri mǝshtǝn tu ti pi gwa, argon tu Bas ndu gwani'e tǝ mǝsh su Urushalima ka. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Bitrus na berǝm ritǝn gǝso wu nde umurka. Nan wu putu wu shin cirtǝn kǝ Yesu na mbarǝm rop ju kan dlor kar ti. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Nan mbarǝm ju ba za lasiwo, katl arni Bitrus nda shirǝm na momi arjen ju tǝ yari da gwa, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, ar hoyi nan mǝn ra ɗe gwa ar ndari dǝ tu mir ba shukutǝn myakan, nǝm ge, nǝm ngapo kǝ Musa kan nǝm kǝ Iliya.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Tǝ le bi gǝs kawi da'a arni dun yam le wurka, nan ar le wur kawo arni bǝrti nǝm wuri. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Arni yar ɗǝl sur gip dun yam tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Muntuwo nya gǝn ni, muntu a zǝzari gwa. Kum ti ni!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Nan shirǝmi pawo, arni wu shin Yesu ni dlor nan gǝsi. Mir mǝn kopi Yesu ngapo wu yon gǝzǝn top, wu yari murgon bar ju wu shin gip muri ju gwa da'a.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ɗǝli dun itǝr gip nyaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Kan bar tlowo, Yesu na mǝn kopi gǝs wi myakan ju ɗǝl sur den tlǝnɗǝro, anni mbarǝm na womti zam Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Anni mbarǝm gon gip womti mbarǝm ju labi Yesu, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A lir ki ba mǝn kulci, kum guna kǝ nya gǝn tu, ti ni katl tǝ nem ra. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Dun itǝr ba te gip ti, tǝ kem ti la'i yar katl untu. Dun itǝri ngapo tǝ kur ɓo ti dli gǝs den dǝdartǝni, kan dǝ bi gǝs ɗǝli hukǝtkǝte. Tǝ nǝra nan ti, gasjen gasjen ni tǝ za ti, tǝ kumi tǝ dli hoyi. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />A lir mǝn kopi gi dǝ wu ɗǝli ti, ama wu mani da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Arni Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝn mbarǝm kǝ zhan kǝni munju ba la mbatl da gwa, mǝn utu tu'e gigasini a dǝm nan kǝne, kan a mani na pitǝn gin juwe? Ɗiri nyayi ɗe.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Nyayi den ɗirtǝn ituwi kan dun itǝri ba byal ti atli, kan dli gǝs ba nǝm dǝdartǝni. Ama Yesu mbatl itǝri, tǝ ɗǝl gip ti, kan tǝ pali bǝbayi nya gǝsi. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Kup mbarǝm ju kan ra lasi nǝm bi na ame, wu den shini nartǝn kǝ Yami.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">Yesu pa shirǝm den mǝshtǝn gǝsi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Mbarǝm ju kup gip nǝmi bi na am ijuwi den argon tu kup tǝ pi gwa, ar ni tǝ wul mǝn kopi gǝs'e, <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />&lt;&lt;Ba kǝ mǝsǝni nǝka na argon tu kan a yari gwa da'a, baa balin kar ami Nya Mbarǝme dǝ la'ǝm am dǝ mbarǝme.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Wi ngapo wu mom gǝs kǝ shirǝmi da'a. Ghundǝri wur nǝka bǝse wu momi. Wi ngapo bǝrti ci wur kǝ dǝ wu tambe gǝs kǝ shirǝmi.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Woni'e bari cina dǝ Yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Arni shirǝm tli gip mǝn kopi gǝs den'e woni baa dǝm bari gip wuri. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Yesu mom damtǝn gǝzǝni, arni tǝ pǝn heli nya goni, tǝ neti markǝm dati. <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kup muntu nǝm heli nya tu gip sun gǝno, amin tǝ nǝmǝni, kup muntu nǝmǝn ngapo, tǝ nǝm ni muntu karǝm sur gwa. Muntu kan tini’e heli gip kǝn kup ti ni’e bari.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Yohana nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, mǝ shin murgon den ɗǝli itǝr gip sun gi, mǝn ngapo mǝ wul ti'e tǝ za'i, tiyo gip min ti ra da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Arni Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Za tǝni, muntu ba shin kǝn na dun ger dawo gegin ni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mbarǝm kǝ nye bǝn gon gip Samariya nge Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Gip untuwo, muri mbirawi kǝ paltǝn gǝs to yam kawo, tǝ kurgǝs hoyi dǝ ti su Urushalima. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />Tǝ kar mbarǝm jen dǝ wu kur ri gip nye bǝn gon gip Samariya kǝ dǝ wu kǝrkǝmi ti lasi. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Ama wu nge ti nan wu shin tǝ bǝtl gam Urushalima gwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.53 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mǝn Yahuda na mǝn Samariyawo wu mash da’a, ‘wu mbur ezǝni’. Mǝn Samariyawo wu na tlǝndǝr tu kan wu bote Yam lasi gwa bat na kǝ mǝn Yahuda. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Nan mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs ga Yakubu na Yohana shin untuwo, arni wu wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, kǝ ndu'e mǝ labi utu sur yam ar ker wur kaya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Kan tǝ bal ti den wur tǝ mbatl wuri. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Kan wuri gip nye bǝni goni.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kopi Yesu banyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Wu den ritǝno, arni mbarǝm gon wule, &lt;&lt;Aa kop ki kup lastu kǝ ri gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kusum na shu gǝzǝni, yatl kǝ to yamka na bin gǝzǝni, ama Ami Nya Mbarǝmo ami ra na ba muri da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Tǝ wul gon'e, &lt;&lt;Kopǝni.&gt;&gt; Arni mbarǝmi wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, za'ǝm a ri kap bǝba gǝn kani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Kan tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Za mǝshi mbarǝm wuri kap mǝshi mbarǝm gǝzǝni, kiwo ri la icǝn kǝ zo dǝmi cina dǝ Yami.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Gon ngapo tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt; Aa kop ki Babomi, in ki za'ǝm a pali bi mǝn bom gǝn kakan gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 9:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Arni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kup mbarǝm tu bǝtl am gǝs den yitta tlawo, ti tǝ bali ger karo tǝ ndar tetǝn gip bom kǝ Yam da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">Yesu kar hauya myakan na kutl cet rop</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Gip untuwo Babom Yesu ɗǝli mbarǝm jen hauya myakan na kutl cet rop. Tǝ kar wur rop-rop dǝ wu kur ri gip bǝn ju na kup lastu tǝ ri gwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Rishi kǝni nari, mǝn rǝshi ngapo njem ni wura, untuwo shirǝm ni na Yam ba mǝn kǝni, ti kar mǝn rǝshi jen ra ɗiri wu rǝshi ti kǝni. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Nɗarani, ar tu a kar kǝn wule mir tǝm gip dlom mamale. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Ba kǝ pǝn ni posh wurpi, ko posh wi bar da'a, ko kaptǝlaye. Shirǝmini murgon den tǝp da'a.<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Bom tu kup kǝ te gipiwo pareni wul tǝn'e, &lt;Dǝ muri mbatl kǝ Yam te gip bom kǝni.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />In mǝn muri mbatl ra gipiwo, muri mbatl gin ba kop ti. In ar ra dawo, ar ba pal kar kǝne. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Dǝm ni gip bomi cini kǝ tlani argon tu kup wu bi in gwa, mǝn mbap ndar ɓatltǝne, ba kǝ kop ni bom-bom da'a. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Kup bǝn tu kǝ te gipi wu nǝm kǝno, cini argon tu wu ne cina da in gwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Warkeni munju den kumi dli gip lasi gwa, wul wur ni'e wokoci kǝ dǝ Yam dǝm Gun gin mbirawi. <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Bǝn tu kup kǝ te gipi wu nǝm kǝn dawo, kopni guntǝp kǝ gip bǝni, wul ni'e, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />&lt;Ar pa den kǝni, kushka kǝ bǝn gin kan nǝmi mi asǝmka ma mǝ bati in bargin wi, kup na untu, mom ni'e wokoci kǝ dǝ Yam dǝm Gun gin mbira wi.&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bati kushka den asǝmkawo pitǝn kǝ mǝn Yahudani, ar’e “Ar pa den kǝne.” Mǝn bati kushkayi dǝli wur kǝm utuwi.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />A yari ine, gas metǝn na Yamo guna baa ci Ba-Gun Yam den Sodom man bǝn kǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bǝn ju nge kopiwo wi dǝm bar kǝ guna'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />&lt;&lt;Kashto gi Korasinu! Kashto gi Betsaida! Dǝ wule gip Taya na Sidon ni pi bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn kanda tu pi gip kǝn gwa, na wu ci atl gam terka wi, wu la lusguru wu den wi mudlǝr sur gami.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lusguru na mudlǝr gami: Shini ndetǝn kǝ mbarǝm cina dǝ Yami.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Den pǝt kǝ gǝniwo Yam ba shin guna kǝ Taya na Sida man kǝne. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />Ki Kaparnahum ngapo ɗǝɗa gi to yamkan baa pi ya? Ko nǝm, kaar ni ba pali'i dǝ ri'i kǝka, las tu mǝshi mbarǝm ba kum dli gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Tǝ wul mǝn kopi gǝs'e, &lt;&lt;Muntu kum argon tu kǝ yariwo tǝ kumǝn wi, untuni muntu nge ino, tǝ ngem ni, ama muntu ngemo tǝ nge ni muntu karǝm sur gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hauya myakan na kutl cet rop pal wi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Wi hauya myakan na kutl cet ropi pal ɗir na ghol mbatli wu wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, dun itǝr ma wu kumi mi bi gip sun gi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;A shin Shetan, Gun dun itǝr den ndetǝn sur wule ci bi kǝ Yami. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Kum ni, a bi in iko nan ki des ici na indǝri. Eso, a bi in kup iko kǝ tle gam kǝ Gun dun itǝri, warwat bar gon ba zamkǝn da'a. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Kup na untuwo ba kǝ pini ghol mbatl dene'e dun itǝr ra atli da in da'a, ama pini ghol mbatli, sun gin ra na rǝshi to yamka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu pi ghol mbatl na argon tu Yam pi gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Gip untuwo, Yesu la'i na ghol mbatl hoyi gip Ruhu kǝ Yami, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A gode i Bǝba, ba mǝn yam na atli, nan kǝ ghundǝr bar juka dǝ mǝn ceti gam na momi bar, Kan kǝ ɓuli munju kan pali gam gǝzǝn wule mimir ni gwa. Untu ni a gode i Bǝba ar mbuni i ger kǝ pi untu.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />&lt;&lt;Kup bar juwo Bǝba bin iko den wur wi, murgon ra nan mom ko woni'e nyayi da'a, Bǝbani mom ti nan gǝsi, untu ni esi, murgon mom Bǝbayi da’a nyayini mom ti nan gǝsi na muntu nyayi ndu tǝ ɓuli ti gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Nan wi ra nan gǝzǝno arni ti bal ti kar mǝn kopi gǝsi, tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Albarka ra den ger tu shin bar ju kǝ shin gwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />A yari ine, mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam na gun na womti ndu’e wu shin argon tu kǝ shini gwa, wu zam shini da'a, wu pa kum bar ju kǝn den kumi gwa, wu zam kumi da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ba mǝn Samariya mǝn shini guna'i</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Gasi gono, bar mǝn kulci mbarǝm shirǝm tu kan Yam bi Musa gwa, tǝ tlyam dlor tǝ kum kǝ bi kǝ Yesu tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;BaMǝn kulci, ununu aa pi kan a zam rai kan ba pa da gwawe?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Ar ni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Unun shirǝm kǝ Yam yari, im nu kǝ momi?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Mbarǝmi wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ ndu Babom Yam gi na mbatl gi kup, na damtǝn gi, na ndǝrtǝn gi kan kǝ ndu berǝm dǝmi gi kanda tu kǝ ndu gam gi gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Arni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;To ar hoyi, kima pi untu ki mǝsh da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Kan tǝ ndu'e tǝ ho gam gǝso, kan tǝ pa tambe Yesu tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kano woni'e berǝm dǝmi gǝni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Ar'ni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Pi bakos goni tǝ ɗǝl sur Urushalima tǝ su Yeriko, kan tǝ mo na mur mǝn dlǝri den tǝpe, kan wu ɓo ti wu nǝm bar gǝska kup kan wu lati atl wu za ti bi dǝ mǝshtǝni. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Gip untuwo kan mǝn keri bar ju kan ɗiri Yam gwa tǝ kop ɗir den tǝpi, tǝ ɗir shin ti ɓom atli, tǝ kop markǝmi tǝ ndara. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Untu ni'es, mǝn mbap gip Bom kǝ Yam ɗiri tǝ shin ti ɓom atlo, arni tǝ kop markǝmi, tǝ ndara.<verse eid="LUK 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Den kariwo arni ba mǝn Samariya gon ɗir lastu mbarǝmi ra gwa, tǝ shin tiwo ar ni guna ci ti den ti. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.33 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mbarǝm kǝ Samariya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wini mǝn Yahuda ba dǝɗanyi wuri, den wu yem mǝtli ɗir kari.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />Kan tǝ ri kar ti tǝ shoti mal inabi na mir den usu gǝsi, tǝ ɓali tika, tǝ pǝn ti tǝ ne ti den bar kǝm gǝsi, kan tǝ ri ti bom shukutǝn goni tǝ ne ger den ti. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mir na mal inabi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gip muri jawo wu pi un nari. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Bar tlowo kan tǝ yem wurpi dinari rop, kan ti bi bakos mǝn lasi tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;Da'i nem ger den mbarǝm tu, amin a pal ɗiro, argon tu kǝ jili den kar kǝ muntuwo a ɓatl ki.&gt;&gt;&gt; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.35 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dinari </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wurpi kǝ mǝn Romani gudǝli nǝmo an den bi nde pǝt nǝm kǝ mǝn mbapi. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Kan Yesu ba tambe ba mǝn momi shirǝm kǝ Yami, tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝkǝno gip mbarǝm myakan juwo, kǝ kum wule woni'e berǝm dǝmi kǝ muntu tu kan mur mǝn dlǝri den tǝp ju ɓo ti gwa wu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Arni kan ba mǝn momi shirǝm kǝ Yami ba wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Muntu kan shin guna gǝs gwa.&gt;&gt; Arni Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kima ri pi untu.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yesu ri bom dǝ Marta na Maryamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Nan Yesu na mǝn kopi gǝs ra den tǝp gǝzǝn kǝ sitǝn Urushalimawo, ar ni wu ri gip nye bǝn gon lastu nagǝr gon mǝn tu ba wul ti'e Marta ba nǝm ti bom da ti. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Tǝ na mǝn gipi gǝs ba wul ti'e Maryamu, muntu dǝm cina dǝ Babom Yesu tǝ den kumi shirǝm gǝsi gwa. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Ama Martawo, pi fingal pǝni ti mbatl kawi, arni tǝ ri kar ti, tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Babomi, kǝ shin ni diya mǝn gǝpi gǝn za'ǝm nangǝn ami den pi fingal gwa? Wul ti'e tǝ ri nem am ra.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Ar ni Yesu nǝmi ti, tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Marta, Marta! Mbatl gi tlikawi, kǝ den damtǝn den bar na womti. <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />Bar nǝm ni mbarǝm ba ndu'i. Maryamu pǝn ho bari, baa nǝmi tǝka da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Kulci shirǝm na Yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Gasi gon Yesu den shirǝm na Yam rǝn kǝti gonka, nan tǝ pa'iwo, gon gip mǝn kopi kǝ Yesu ba wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Babomi, kulci mi shirǝm na Yam, kanda tukan Yohana kulci mǝn ju kan ba kop ti gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝn ni ki shirǝm na Yamo wul ni'e, &lt;Bǝba, dǝ shin nartǝn kǝ zo sun gi, dǝ mulki gi suri. <verse eid="LUK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Bi mi fingal gǝmi kǝ se na gǝni <verse eid="LUK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Ho'i mi warwat pitǝn gǝmi ju kan mǝ pi gwa, don mima munju kan pi mi dlat dawo mǝ ho'i wuri. Te mi gip argon tu ba kem mi wani pitǝn gwa da'a.&gt;&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ci cina na kulci shirǝm na Yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Yesu wul mǝn kopi gǝs'e ba wule, gon gin na berǝm, ti ri kar ti kǝ dlom gasi ti wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Berǝm, bim. rance burodi gudǝli myakan ngapi. <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Berǝm gǝn gon ɗǝl kǝ ba ɓomi asǝm kan tǝ kop bom dam kǝkǝn tu ami ngap fingal nem ra nan a bi ti gwa da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Muntu te gipika ngapo ti nǝm ter gip kushi ti wule, ba kǝ ghunǝm da'a! Amiwo, a le bǝdlabǝn kawi, ami na mimir gǝn kup mǝ mur gǝmi atl wi, a mani tlitǝn yam a bi'i argon da'a. <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Na yari ine, da ma ti tlyam tǝ bi ti argon den ti berǝm gǝs ni dawo, ti tlyam tǝ bi ti ko mǝnen tǝ ndu'i sabo nan sham ci berǝm gǝsi nan pi ta liri gǝs da gwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />&lt;&lt;A yari ine, pini ta liri ba bi ine. Ngen ni ki zami, pini ta ɓe bǝdlabǝni, baa ɓuli ine. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Muntu kup liri, baa bi ti. Muntu kup ngeno ti zami, untu ni muntu kup ɓo bǝdlabǝno ba ɓuli ti. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Gon ra gip kǝn in nya gǝs ba liri ti kos kan tǝ bi ti ici gwa ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Ko dǝ nya gǝs liri mbutl kan tǝ bi ti indǝri we? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Kǝn mǝn ɗasi tu ma kǝ mom mbuni bar ju ki bi mimir gino, balle Ba gin kǝ to yamka, ti bi Ruhu kǝ Yami mǝn ju kan lir ti gwa.<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na gun dun itǝri Ba'alzabu, Shetan utuwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Yesu den ɗǝli dun itǝr mǝn bǝtli lǝka gip mbarǝm goni, nan dun itǝri ɗǝlo ar ni mbarǝmi shirǝme, kan mbarǝm na womti ba pi mamaki, <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />jen eso, wu wule, Yesu ɗǝli ni dun itǝr tu na iko kǝ Ba'alzabu gun dun itǝri.<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Jen ngapo, wu ndu'e wu gode Yesu, arni wu wul ti'e, tǝ pi bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn kan mbarǝm baa shin'e Yam ra nan ti gwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Yesu mom mbatl gǝzǝni, arni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kup mulki tu tatl rop kan den shini bes kǝ ezǝno, ar ba dlǝr da'a. Untuni bom ni tatl bomi rop wu den shini bes kǝ ezǝno ar ba yas ka. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Shetan ni tatl rop kan tǝ den shini bes kǝ gam gǝso, imni mulki gǝs ba ndǝr rawu? Kǝ wule na iko kǝ gun dun itǝr ni a ɗǝli wani itǝri. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Ami ni a ɗǝli wani itǝr na Ba'alzabulo, kano mǝn kopi gino na iko kǝ woni wu ɗǝli itǝri? Untuwo, mir mǝn kopi gin ni ba nǝm kǝn na shirǝm den bar ju kǝ yari gwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Ami ni ngap a ɗǝli wani itǝr na iko kǝ Yamo, mulki kǝ Yam suri in ituwi. <verse eid="LUK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />Ndǝri mbarǝm ni dlǝri bom gǝs gam kan tǝ ɓut hoyiwo, argon ba zam bar kǝ bom gǝs da’a. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Murgon ni ndǝr man ti kan tǝ ɗir ndati na dlan ngapo, ti man ti tǝ nǝmi ti bar kǝ dlan gǝska kup kan tǝ la mbatl dene gwa, kan tǝ bi jenka.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Muntu ne dli demǝn dawo tǝ ngen ni, muntu kan nem am gip domi dawo ti ni den gǝzanyika.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />&lt;&lt;Dun itǝrni ɗǝlka gip mbarǝmo, ti pi ta nǝtltǝn kǝ ba las tu mal ra da gwa, kǝ dǝ tǝ ngen ba shukutǝni, tin tǝ zam dawo ti wule a pal rǝn gip mbarǝm tu kan a ɗǝl ɗir gwa, <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />tin tǝ pal ɗir kan tǝ zam sar lasi kawi pal kǝrkǝmi kawo, <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />ti pa ri yem dun itǝr jen wi nyingi munju kan manti ɗasi tu gwa kan wu ɗir wu dǝm kǝ ba lasi den kar kǝ untuwo pa’i dǝmi kǝ mbarǝm tu ba man kǝ lai gǝsi wantǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kulci den imni mi kum tǝmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Nan Yesu yari untuwo, arni nagǝr gon gip womti mbarǝmi lati bi, tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;mǝn albarka ni'e nǝna tukan gǝr ki tǝ luki kan kǝ nar gwa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Albarka mani nartǝn den munju ba kum shirǝm kǝ Yam kan wu kop gwa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbarǝm ngen shini alama</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Nan mbarǝm dom wur es na womtiwo, arni Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm kǝ zhan kǝno mǝn ɗasi tuni, wu den ndu'i shini alama, ngapo wi zam shini alama gon da'a in kǝ Yunana mǝn shirǝm na Yam ni da gwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Ar nǝra wule Yunana kan dǝmi mǝn Neneba alama gwa, untu ni Nya Mbarǝm ba dǝmi zhan kǝni.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Yunana </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tǝ ra nǝm gip mǝn shirǝm na Yam kǝ terka tini Yam kar ti dǝ tǝ yari mǝn bǝn Neneba dǝ wu pal kar Yami.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Gas metǝn na Ba-Gun Yamo, gun kǝ Sheba gǝr mǝtli, ti tlyam na mǝn zhan kǝni, argon tu tǝ piwo ti byal wur atl den argon tu wu pi gwa. Don tǝ ɗilni ɗir bango kǝ duniya kǝ dǝ tǝ shin momi bar kǝ Solomon. Shin ni, muntu man Solomon nartǝn gwan kǝni. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Gas metǝn na Ban-Gun Yamo, mbarǝm kǝ Neneba ba tlyam na mbarǝm kǝ zhan kǝni wi byal wur atl den wu ci atl gam na wazu kǝ Yunana. Shin ni, muntu kan man Yunana nartǝn gwan kǝn ɗe.<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kulci den utu shini bari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />Murgon ba la utu den pitila kan tǝ ghundǝrika su shu ka, ko tǝ ghupka na bar gal da'a. Ama ti ne to den ba dǝmi gǝska munju te gip kushiyiwo wu shin bari. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Ger'e pitila kǝ dli, in ger gi hoyi no, ki shin bar hoyi. In ger gi ngap hoyini dawo, kup dli gi ba la'i na dǝmǝni, ki shin bar hoyi da'a. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Ɓa shini, cirtǝn tukan den kiwo dǝmǝn ni da'a, <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />dli gi ni kup la'i na cirtǝn es dǝmǝn ra kǝti gon dawo, ar ba bi cirtǝn las kup kandatu kan pitila ba bi'i cirtǝn gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kashto kǝ Parisawa na mǝn kulci mbarǝm shirǝm tukan Yam bi Musa gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Nan Yesu pa'i shirǝmo, ar ni ba Parise gon la tǝ bi kǝ dǝ wu ci fingali, kan Yesu te gipi, tǝ dǝm kǝ ci fingali. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />Ar dlǝkǝn ba Pariseyi nan tǝ shin Yesu dǝm kǝ ci fingali tǝ ho amka da gwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Babom Yesu ngapo ar ni tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝn Parisawawo, kǝ ho kar gal ka, na wuro male, gipi ngapo, kǝn ra laa'i na te ger den bar kǝ mbarǝme na ɗasi tu'e. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Kǝn kǝdlǝme, o fawo muntu pi kariwo, ti'es ni tǝ pi gipi diya? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Kǝn ngapo, bar ju kan kǝn ra nari kupo, bi ni munju kan am ri wur kar da gwa, arni ki cir cina dǝ Yami.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />&lt;&lt;Kashto gi ni, kǝn Parisawa, ar tu kǝ ɗǝli zakka kǝ ga bucumbu na mbǝlci na wol oro kup, ngapo kǝ pi ho bar na ndu'i Yam da'a. Munju ni mbun'e kǝ pi bat na wi mǝnja ka.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />&lt;&lt;Kashto gi ni, kǝn Parisawa, kǝ ndu dǝ bi in zo ba dǝmi te cina gip ba kumi shirǝm kǝ Yamka, eso, kǝ ndu dǝ shirǝmi in gip bar pǝte. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Kashto gini, don kǝn nǝra wule gam-bǝci kan ne ti tat da'a, munju mbarǝm ba desi na momi gǝzǝn da gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Arni gon gip mǝn kulci mbarǝm shirǝm tu Yam bi Musa gwa nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝn kulci, ki ni kǝ yari untuwo besini kǝ yari mi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Arni Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kashto gin pa'e kǝn mǝn kulci mbarǝm shirǝm tu kan Yam bi Musa gwa, kǝn ni kǝ bi mbarǝm gos gam ju kan man yar gǝzǝn gwa, kǝn na gam gin ngapo kǝ ne wur am ra da'a! <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />&lt;&lt;Kashto gini, don kǝn ni kǝ tu gam-bǝci kapi mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yami, munju kano ga gigi gin ni ri wur eka gwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Kǝn ra na momi'e, na ndu'i gin ni arjen ju ga gigi gin pi gwa wini wu ri wur’e kan kǝn den tu'i gam-bǝci gǝzǝni.<verse eid="LUK 11:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Ar ni kem Yam gip momi bar gǝs wule, &lt;A kari wur bar suka na mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yami na mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yesu, wi ri jen eka, wu pal wu tlat jeni.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Untuwo bǝran kǝ mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam kup ju kan shoti tun ne gǝs kǝ duniya, ar kop mbarǝm kǝ zhan kǝno ba pali in yare. <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />Tun den bǝran kǝ Habila ar ɗir den kǝ Zakariya muntu kan ri ti eka dlom ba keri bar ju kan ɗiri Yam na las mǝn tsarki. Hoyi ni a yari ine, kup ar ba kop rǝnka den mbarǝm kǝ zhan kǝni. <verse eid="LUK 11:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />&lt;&lt;Kashto gini, kǝn mǝn kulci mbarǝm shirǝm tu Yam bi Musa gwa, den kǝ pǝn bar kǝ ɓuli ilimika kǝn na gam gin ngapo kǝ te gipi da'a mǝn ndu'i tetǝn ngapo kǝ za wur wu te da'a. &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Nan Yesu za lasiwo, kan mǝn kulci mbarǝm shirǝm kǝ Yam na Parisawa wu nǝm tlati gǝs hoyi wu den lo'i gǝs kǝ dǝ tǝ yar bar na womti, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />wu den ndu'i'e wu kemi ti gam gǝs male.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Yesu dǝli kǝm mir mǝn kopi gǝs den setǝne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Gip untu nan mbarǝm na womti dom wur na nari har wu den desi ezǝno, arni Yesu pii shirǝm mir mǝn kopi gǝs kakani tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Pini kula na yisti kǝ mǝn Parisa mǝn se mbarǝme. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Argon ra na zupi kan ba ɓulka da gwaya, eso argon ra na ghundǝri kan ba mom da gwaya? <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Untuwo kup argon tu kǝ yari muriwo ba ɗǝl kari. Argon tu kǝ yari mol ko gip kushi tukan kǝ le bǝdlabǝn gamkawo ba yari den gam kushi.<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muntu baa bǝrti ti gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />&lt;&lt;Kǝn ga berǝm gǝni, a yari ine, ba kǝ kumni bǝrti kǝ munju baa ri dli eka gwa da'a, den kar kǝ untuwo wi’i mbu pi argon dene da gwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Aa yari in muntu ki kum bǝrti gǝs gwa. Kumni bǝrti kǝ Yami muntu kan tin tǝ ri dli ekawo tǝ ra na iko tǝ laa kǝn te utuka gwa. Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, ti ni ki kum bǝrti gǝsi.<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />&lt;&lt;Ba wur mir yatl nantamka den kabarshu rop diya? Kup na untu, Yam mǝsǝnika na ko nǝm gǝzǝn da'a. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Untuni kup ta gam gino na dlǝmi ni ar ra. Untuwo, kumni bǝrti da'a, kǝ man mir yatl na womti daraja. <verse eid="LUK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />&lt;&lt;A yari in esi, kup murgon tu shedem cina dǝ womti mbarǝmo, ami Nya Mbarǝm ma aa shede ti cina dǝ mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Muntu ngap kan nge momi gǝn cina dǝ mbarǝmo, ami ma a nge momi gǝs cina dǝ mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Kup muntu pi shirǝm mburtǝn den ami Nya Mbarǝmo, ba ho'i ti wani pitǝn gǝska, ama kup muntu ngap pi mǝgǝn shirǝm den Ruhu kǝ Yamo, ba ho'i ti wani pitǝn gǝska da'a.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />Wi ni wu ɗir kǝn gip bom kumi shirǝm kǝ Yami ko cina dǝ mǝn hukuntetǝne ko cina dǝ mǝn bǝno, ba dǝ tǝp ɗǝli gam gin ko unun ki yari ghun kǝn ni da'a. <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />Ruhu kǝ Yam ba kulci in argon tu ki yari wokociyi gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pi misali den kǝdlǝm mǝn bar kǝ ame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Arni murgon gip womti mbarǝm wul Yesu'e, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, wul erǝm gǝn'e tǝ bim bar gado gǝn kan bǝba gǝmi mǝsh za'i mi gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝme, woni nem mǝn tloyi shirǝm ko mǝn rabe in bar ju kan Bǝba gin mǝsh za'i in gwawe?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Tǝ ci cina na shirǝmi tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Lurani, dlyam ni na ndu'i barka na nari. Ho dǝmiwo ar dǝm den domi bar na nari da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Arni tǝ bi wur misali goni, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Pi mbarǝm gon mǝn bar kǝ ame, tǝ zam bar nar den kǝn gǝsi, <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />tǝ wul gip mbatl gǝs'e, &lt;Ununu a pi we? Ami ra na las tu kan a ne bar kǝ kǝn gǝnka gwa da'a.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Tǝ wule, &lt;Argon tu a piwo, a tatl ɓindi gǝnka, kano a tu jen kiri, gipini a ne bar kǝ kǝn gǝnka na bar ju kup kan a zam gwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Kan a wul gam gǝn'e, Kira na bar na womti kan ki neka ar ri'i sheti ghon na womti gwa. Shukuyi gam gi, kǝ pi ta ci kǝ pi ta tle, ki den kumi tǝmi.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Ama Yam wul ti'e, &lt;Ki kǝdlǝme! Gip gas kǝn ni kii mǝshi, bar ju kǝ domo kǝ woni ar ba dǝm we?&gt;&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Untuni ar ba dǝmi muntu kan domi gam gǝs bar kǝ am gwa, tǝra na argon es cina dǝ Yam da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu wul mir mǝn kopi gǝs'e wu la mbatl den Yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Ar ni Yesu wul mǝn kopi gǝs’e, &lt;&lt;Untu fawo a yari ine, ghun ni gam gin den dǝmi gin da'a, fingal gini, ko bar kǝ la'i kǝ dli gini. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Rai man fingali, dli ngap ar man tutul dli. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Shin ni ghanrati, wu ngani da'a, wu rǝsh da'a, wu ra na ba ne barka ko ɓindi da'a, kup na untuwo Yam ba bi wur fingali, daraja gin ngap ar man kǝ yatl na womti! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Woni gip kǝn gip ghuntǝn gǝso, ti mani ɓiti awa nǝm ra den muri gǝswe? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Kǝnni kǝ mbu pi nye heli bar untu dawo, unun kem nami bar jen ba ghun kǝne?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Shin ni buzǝn kin kǝ gip lǝpe kanda tu wu nar gwa, wu pi mbap da'a ko wu dlǝmi gam gǝzǝn luluri, kup na untuwo, a yari ine, ko Solomon kan gun ni na nartǝn gǝs ma tǝ taɓe la'i mbuni tutul dli wule kǝ nǝm gip wur da'a. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />In untuni Yam pi jir kǝ gip lǝpe na mbuntǝni munju ra sekǝni gǝniwo kan dǝ ker wur ka, bare kǝne, kǝn mǝn heli ngǝshtǝn den Yami. <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Ba kǝ lani mbatl den bar ju ki ci ko ki tla gwa da'a, ba ar ghun kǝn ni da'a. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Munju mom Yam dama wu ngen bar ju. Kǝn ngapo, Ba gin kǝ to Yamka mom bar ju ndari kǝ zam gwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Ama ngen ni pi bar ju Yam ba ndu kakani, arni ti bi in bar ju kup ndari kǝ zam es gwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />&lt;&lt;Kumni bǝrti da'a, kǝn heli garke gǝni, Ba gin kum tǝmi kǝ bi in zo dǝmi cina dǝ Yami. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Bar ju kǝn nariwo wurni ka, kǝ bi ni munju am ri wur kaar da gwa wurpiyi. Neni gam gin bar ju ba guska na zo bar ju ba lika da gwa to yamka, las tu mur ba pǝnka da'a, ghughur ma wi lika da gwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Lastu zo bar kǝ mbarǝm rawo, lasini mbatl gǝs ba nǝra.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ba ndu mǝn kopi gǝs wu dǝm gǝɗǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />&lt;&lt;Dǝmni gǝɗǝn, dǝ pitǝla gin nǝra den cirtǝni. <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Dǝmni wule zher ju kan den ɓuti dǝ babom gǝzǝn pal kǝ ba domtǝn kǝ gudlumi gwa. Tin tǝ pal ɗir tǝ ɓo bǝdlabǝno, wi ɓuli ti na zhotǝne. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Ar ba dǝmi zher ju bar kǝ ghol mbatli kano babomi ni pal tǝ zam wur wu nde umur kawi da gwa. Na ho bi ni a yari ine, ti tus bar lulur gǝska tǝ wul wur'e wu dǝm atli kan tǝ kop wur na nǝm-nǝm tǝ bi wur fingali. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Ar ba mbuni zher ju, tin tǝ pal kǝ dlom gas ko kǝ bǝtloni, tǝ zam wur den ɓuti gwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />&lt;&lt;Momni na untu, babom ni mom pǝt tu mur ba ɗiri ti gamo, ti za dǝ muri te ti gip bom tǝ yemi ti barka da'a. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Kǝn ma dǝmni gǝɗǝn don Nya Mbarǝm ba sur den pǝt tu kǝ la mbatl da gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zher mǝn aminci na muntu ra na aminci da gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Bitrus wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, mǝnni kǝ yari mi misali tuya ko mbarǝm kup ni?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Arni Babom Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Woni'e zher mǝn aminci na momi pi bari? Ti ni'e muntu babom gǝs ne ti bari tǝ ɓuti ti bom gǝsi, kan tǝ bi nami zheri fingal gǝzǝn hoyi gwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Ar ba mbuni zher tu kan babom gǝs ni pal tǝ zam ti tǝ den pi mbap gǝs gwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Ge shirǝm ni a yari ine, ti ne ti gam bar ju tǝra nari kup gwa.<verse eid="LUK 12:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />&lt;&lt;Ama zher tuni wul gip mbatl gǝs'e, &lt;Babom gǝn pal bǝle da'a,&gt; kano tǝ nda gip ɓe nami zher mǝn mbapi mǝtli na moni, kan tǝ nda gip ci na tle ar kem dǝ ɗu tlo ti. <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />Babom kǝ zher tu ba pal den pǝt tu kan tǝ la mbatl paltǝn gǝs da gwa, ti tlyat ti tǝ cetǝl ti kan tǝ pi ti hukunci na munju ba pi hoyi da gwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />Zher tukan mom argon tu babom gǝs ba ndu'e tǝ pi kan tǝ pi shiri da'a, ko tǝ nge pi argon tu babom gǝs ndu'e tǝ piwo, ba pi ti ɓotǝn kǝ tle masi. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Muntu na dǝmǝn gam den argon tu babom gǝs ba ndu'e dǝ pi, kan tǝ pi wani pitǝno, ba ɓo ti njem. Kup muntu bi ti nari baro ba ngen nari bar kar ti. Muntu kup bi ti bar na womti ba ngen bar na womti es kar ti.<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Surtǝn kǝ Yesu ba ɗiri tatltǝn kǝ bomi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />&lt;&lt;Untuni a ɗir kǝ la'i utu gip duniya. Ndu’i gǝnno na ar nǝm wi. <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Ami ra na batisma kǝ kumi dli tukan ba pim gwa, fawo ar den ghuni gǝni in pim wi da gwa. <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Kǝ kum wule a ɗiri ni ghol mbatl gip duniya ya? Ako! A yari ine, rabe gamni a ɗiri. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Ɗe cina, gip bom nǝmo, mbarǝm nantam ba tatl bomi rop, myakan den shini bes kǝ rop, rop den shini bes kǝ myakan. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Wi tatli, bǝba ba shin bes kǝ nya, nya ba shin bes kǝ base. Nǝna ba shin bes kǝ nya gǝsi, nyayi ba shin bes kǝ nas pa'e. Nakon ba shin bes kǝ nye kon gǝsi, nye kon ba shin bes kǝ nakon gǝs pa'e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Yesu wul domtǝn kǝ mbarǝmi es’e, &lt;&lt;Kǝn ni kǝ shin dun yam ni tli tor tǝp yemmawo, kǝ kur wule, &lt;Ghon ba nda,&gt; kan ar ndayi. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.54 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gip atl kǝ Palasɗinuwo, dun yam tu ba ɗiri ghono, tǝp yemmani tǝ ɗǝl suri arni wule kǝ atl gǝmi, kan ba tli tor gabǝs gwa da’a. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Kǝnni es kǝ kum itǝr den tlitǝn tor kuduwo, kǝ wule, &lt;Pǝt ba mati,&gt; kan ar mati. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Kǝn mǝn se mbarǝme, kǝ mani momi pitǝn kǝ dun yam na wultǝn kǝ itǝr den atli, ngapo, momi zhan kǝno kǝ mbu da’a.<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngash gos na mǝn ri gi cina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />&lt;&lt;Ununu kem kǝ nge mani momi bar ju mbun kǝ pi gwawu? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Gonni ri shirǝm gi bom tloyi shirǝmo, zho i kǝ kǝrkǝmika nan ti den tǝpe, kin kǝ nge giwo, ti ri’i cina dǝ mǝn tloyi shirǝmi, ti ngapo ti taki am dǝ mǝn ɓaltǝn kǝ dlomi, mǝn ɓaltǝn kǝ dlom ngapo ti laki gip bom kǝ moni. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />A yari i, ki ɗǝl da'a, se kin kǝ ɓatl argon tukan tloyi i kup gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Gip wokociyi munju ra lasiwo, kan wu yari Yesu argon tu kan zam mǝn Galili jen kan Bilatus kem dǝ ri wur eka nan wi den mboshi bar ju kan wi bi Yam gǝzǝn su Urushalimaka gwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝ wule munju ri wur'e na kumi dli untuwo wu man ni kup nami mbarǝm kǝ Galili warwat pitǝna? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Untuni da'a! Na yari inni, kǝnni kǝ za warwat pitǝn ginka dawo untun kup gin ki mǝsh wule gwazini. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Untu eso mbarǝm kutl cet wuzupse ju nan pike nda den wur ka, kan wu mǝshka su Siluwam kawo, kǝ wule wini wu man mǝn Isra'ila kup warwat pitǝna? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Untuni da'a! Na yari in ra, kǝnni kǝ za warwat pitǝn gin ju kǝ pal kar Yam dawo, kǝn ma untun ki mǝshi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Turum kan ba gǝri da gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Kan Yesu ba pi wur misali tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Bakos gon ra na kin turum gip kǝn gǝsi. Ya ri kǝ kotli nyeni, arni tǝ zam ko nǝm dene da'a. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Kan tǝ wul muntu ba ne ti ger den kǝni'e, &lt;Ɓa shini! Sheti ghon kǝ myakan ikǝn wi ami den ɗirtǝn kǝ kotli nyen turum kǝni, gastu kup a ɗiro a zam argon dene da'a. Wotl ti ka! Imni ba za ti tǝ tla laska katlu?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Kan mǝn ne ger den kǝni ba nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;Babomi, za ti kǝ sheti ghon nǝm ra, a domi ti atl gǝse a wi ti ghop. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Doro tin tǝ gǝr gwa ar mbuni, tin tǝ gǝr da ngapo se dǝ wotl tǝka.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu warke nagǝr gon den pǝt shukutǝni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Gasi gon den pǝt shukutǝni, Yesu den kulci mbarǝm te gip bom kumi shirǝm kǝ Yam gonka, <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />nagǝr gon ra lasi muntu kan dun itǝr tle tǝka gwa, kup tǝ ngonka wi, sheti ghon gǝs kutl cet wuzupse tǝ mani tlitǝn yam da'a, <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Yesu na shini gǝso, arni tǝ la tǝ bi tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Nagǝr mbarǝme, A pǝni i kumi dli gi kawi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Kan Yesu ba ne am den ti, arni nagǝr mǝri workǝca tlyam dlor kan tǝ ɗǝɗa Yami.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Argon tu ci lo bari kǝ bom kumi shirǝm kǝ Yam nar den'e Yesu warke nagǝr tu den pǝt shukutǝni. Arni tǝ wul nami mbarǝm'e, &lt;&lt;Muri mukka ra nan ar dlat dǝ pi mbap gwa, ɗir ni gip wur dǝ warke ine, bat na pǝt shukutǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Arni Babom nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝn mǝn se mbarǝme! Woni gip kǝn ba pǝtl tla gǝs ko bar kǝm gǝs kǝ ba ɓali gǝs tǝ ri bi ti mal den pǝt shukutǝn dawu? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Nagǝr kǝno, gǝs gal kǝ Ibǝrahim ni, muntu kan Shetan ne ti kǝba lasi sheti ghon kutl cet wuzupse gwa, ar ndari dǝ pǝtl ti am dǝ argon tu kan ɓal tika den pǝt shukutǝn da'a ya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Nan tǝ yari untuwo, munju kan ba ndu shini gǝs dawo arni sham nǝm wuri. Nami mbarǝm ngapo, kup wu pita ghol mbatl na bar mǝn dlǝkǝntǝn ju kan tǝ den pi gwa.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misali kǝ ge danzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Kan Yesu ba wule, &lt;&lt;Wule unun mulki kǝ Yam rawu? Na unun es a ngash tǝ we? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Mulki kǝ Yamo wule ge dǝnti ni ar ra, muntu kan man badǝr kup kaltǝn gwa, nan murgon ngani gip kǝn gǝs ar ba nari tǝ pi bar kini, kan yatl ba tu bin gǝzǝn den am kini gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misali kǝ yisti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Yesu wul es'e, &lt;&lt;Na unun a ngash mulki kǝ Yamu? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Ar nǝra wule yisti kan nagǝr gon kurtli gip ɗapti alkama kwano myakan gwa, kan yistiyi ba nga ɗaptiyi kup.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Guntǝp kǝ Yamo metni ar ra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Nan Yesu den tǝp gǝs kǝ sitǝn Urushalimawo, tǝ rat gip mir bǝn jen tǝ pi ta kulci mǝn bǝni shirǝm kǝ Yam. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Mbarǝm gon tambe ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, mbarǝm njemni ba zam tetǝn gip mulki kǝ Yama?&gt;&gt; Tǝ wul wur'e, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />&lt;&lt;Metini kǝ teni gipi tǝp kǝba heli bǝdlabǝni, domici mbarǝm ra na womti munju ba ndu tetǝn gipi kan ba mani da gwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Ba mǝn bomni tlyam tǝ le bǝdlabǝn bomika, kǝn ngapo ki dlǝr kari kǝ pita ɓe bǝdlabǝni, ki liri kǝ wule, &lt;Babomi, ɓuli mi bǝdlabǝn ngapi!&gt; Ama ti nǝmi in tǝ wule, &lt;A mom kǝn da'a, ko las tu kǝ ɗǝl ɗir gwa!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Kǝn ngapo kan kǝ wule, &lt;Mǝn kan mǝ ngas fingal mǝ pal mǝ tla gip gal nǝm nan ki fa gwaya, ki ngapo kǝ kulci rǝn gip bǝn gǝmi ka.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Ti ngapo ti wule, &lt;A yari ine, a mom kǝn da’a, ko lastu kǝ ɗǝl gwa. Tlinni kǝ ba ger ka, kǝn mǝn warwat pitǝne.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Ki kul na ngasi shine, gastu kan kǝnni kǝ shin Ibǝrahim, na Ishaku, na Yakubu, na kup munju kan Yam kar wur den am gǝs mbiwi gip Mulki kǝ Yami, ama kǝno dǝ kar kǝn kagwa. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Mbarǝm ba ɗir daga gip atl kundǝrǝndlip, wi dǝm kǝ ci nyel gip mulki kǝ Yami. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Bartuni munju kan kaar haro wi pal kǝ cina, kǝ cina ngapo wi pal kǝ kaari.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dun mbatl kǝ Yesu den Urushalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Wi ra gip untuwo, kan mǝn Parisa jen ba ɗir wu wul Yesu'e, &lt;&lt;Tli gi ɗe ca, Hirudus den ndu'i tǝ ri i eka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ri nǝka kǝ wulni ba mǝn ceni lar tu'e, &lt;Ami den ɗǝli dun itǝr sekǝni na ɗǝli kumi dli kǝ mbarǝmka, gǝni ma untu, mburni a pa'i mbap gǝni.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Ar nǝmǝn dǝ a pi ta nǝtltǝn gǝn sekǝni, gǝni na mburi. Ar ba tǝm kumi da'a dǝ mǝn shirǝm na Yam mǝsh rǝn kǝti gonka, ba'e gip Urushalimani ri ti eka da gwa!<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />Kashto, Urushalima, Urushalima, kǝn mǝn ri mǝn yari shirǝm kǝ Yam eka, mǝn la'i munju kan Yam kar wur sur kar kǝn gwa na tate, bisi mǝnen a ndu domi gin wule nas kor kan ba ghum mimir gǝs gip bibako gǝs gwa, arni kǝ nge gini. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Ar tu Yam za'i in bom gin koni wi, ki i shimǝn da'a, se gas tu kan kǝ wule, &lt;Mǝn albarkani, muntu kan ba sur gip sun kǝ Babom Yam gwa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Den pǝt shukutǝn gon kan Yesu ri bom dǝ bari gon kǝ mǝn Parisa kǝ dǝ tǝ ci fingalo, arni mbarǝm ne ti gere. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Cina da ti eso mbarǝm gon ra mǝn kǝmi asǝm na ame. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Kan Yesu ba tambe mǝn kulci doka na mǝn Parisa tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Doka gǝmi wule dǝ warke mbarǝm gas shukutǝna, ko ar wulra da'a?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Wu wule argon da'a. Yesu ngapo kan tǝ ne am den ba mǝri, tǝ ɗǝli ti kumi dli gǝs ka, tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ndara ndaratin gi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Woni gip kǝn na nya ko tla kan ba nda shuka den pǝt shukutǝni, kan ba ɗǝli ti torka bǝle-bǝle da gwawu?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Wi ngapo wu zam argon kǝ yari da'a.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pali gam gi argonni da’a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Nan Yesu shin munju kan yari wur ɗirtǝn kǝ ci fingali den zhotǝn kǝ nǝmi kiri ba dǝmiwo, arni tǝ yari wur shirǝm tǝ wule, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />&lt;&lt;Murgon ni lakǝn bi kǝ gudlumiwo, ba kǝ nǝmi ni gam gin ba dǝmi kǝ kiri da'a, kǝ mom da'a ko mǝn gudlumiyi yari muntu kan nar man ki gwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Kǝ shino, ba mǝn gudlumi ba wul ki'e, &lt;Tlǝka dǝ mǝnkǝn dǝm kǝba dǝmi gi tu.&gt; Na shamni ki tli kǝ pal kǝ ba heli ba dǝmi. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Ra untuwo, dǝmni kǝba heli badǝmi, muntu kan dom kǝnni shin kiwo, ti wul ki'e, &lt;Berǝm, ɗir ɗe,&gt; ti bi'i ho ba dǝmi. Ar ba kem kǝ cir cina dǝ munju kan tǝ laa kǝn bi nan wur gwa. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Muntu kup ɗǝɗa gam gǝso, ba pali tǝ den ti argonni da'a, kup muntu pali gam gǝs tǝ argonni dawo, ba ɗǝɗa ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Yesu wul babom tu kan la tǝ bi gwa'e, &lt;&lt;Kini ki la bi murgon kǝ ci fingal, kan kǝ la bi jen kǝ biki gwa, ba kǝ la bi berǝm, ko ya'ǝn, ko mǝn gi, ko berǝm dǝmi gi mǝn bar kǝ am katl da'a. Munjuwo, gas jeno wi la ki bi pa. Bar tuwo wi ɓatl ki argon tu kǝ pi wur gwa ituwi. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Kin ki la bi mǝn ci fingal gwa, yari munju am ri wur kar da gwa, na kurki, na muju itǝr tle wur am ko asǝmka gwa na tabi. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Na untun ki zam Albarka, kǝ mom'e munjuwo wi mbu ɓatli gi da'a. Yamni ba ɓatl ki gas tu kan mǝn zo mbatl kan mǝshka ba tlyam gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu shirǝm nan wur den bar biki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Nan wu kum untuwo, gon gip mǝn ju kan den ci fingal na Yesu ba wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝn albarkani'e muntu zam tǝ ci fingal gip mulki kǝ Yam gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Yesu nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm gon ra kan ne pǝt bar biki gǝsi, arni tǝ yari mbarǝm na womti. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Nan an mbi kǝ ci bikiyiwo, tǝ kar zher gǝs gon tǝ ri la bi munju tǝ yari wur gwa den'e ko unu piwi, ar mbi'e wu ɗir wi. <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Ama kup na bi nǝm wu nǝm la'i asǝm gipi ka, nǝm wule, &lt;A wur pel kǝn kan nǝmǝn te yarka a ri kǝ zhuwi gwa, pi hakkuri ka.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Gon ba wule, &lt;A'i wur tla gi kǝn gudǝli kutl, a ri kǝ ɓomi gǝzǝn den kǝn ituwi, pi hakkuri ka.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Untu esi gon ba wule, &lt;I gudlumin ni, a zam ritǝn da'a.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Zheri pal ɗir tǝ bali babom gǝs bar ju wu yari kup gwa. Kan lo ba ci babomi, kan tǝ wul zher gǝsi es'e, &lt;Zho'i kǝ kop guntǝp kǝ gip bǝn kup, kǝ ɗirim munju kan ra na bar kǝ am da gwa, na kurki, na tabi, na munju itǝr tle wur amka ko asǝmka gwa.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Zheri pal ɗir tǝ wul babom gǝsi'e, &lt;Argon tu kǝ yarimo a piwi, artu nami las i.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Babomi ba wul zher tu es'e, &lt;Pal rǝn den guntǝp kǝ gip bǝn na kǝ bi lǝpka kǝ la bi mbarǝm ɗiri, dǝ ba dǝmi ju la'i.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Na yari ine, mbarǝm nǝm ra gip munju kan yari wur biki kǝn kan ba la lǝka den fingal gǝn gwa da'a.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kopi Yesu banyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Bar womti mbarǝm den ritǝn na Yesu, kan tǝ bal ti den wur tǝ wule, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />&lt;&lt; Murgon tu ba kopǝn kup, tin tǝ ndu'ǝm nar man bas ko nas ko gǝr gǝs, na mimir gǝsi, na mǝn gǝs mǝtli na moni, har ma tǝ nge gam gǝs dawo, ti mani dǝmi mǝn kopi gǝn da'a. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Muntu kup pǝn gicciye gǝs tǝ kopǝn dawo, ti mani dǝmi mǝn kopi gǝn da'a. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Dǝ wule gon gip kǝnni ba ndu tu'i tlyari bino, ti dǝm tǝ shin mǝnen ti jili den tu'i bini kakani, ti shin ko tǝra na wurpi tu ba tu'i ti gwa diya. <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Tin tǝ la gǝs tu'i kan tǝ mani pa'i tu'i dawo, mbarǝm ba gyatli ti. <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />Wi wule, &lt;Mbarǝm kǝn la gǝs tu'i bine, artu tǝ mbu pa'i da'a.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />&lt;&lt;Ko dǝ wule, gun ni ba ɗǝl kǝ dlan na esi gunye, ai ti dǝm ti shin kakani mǝn bi utu gǝs dubu kutl ba mani dlan na kǝ esi gun kan ra na dubu hauya nǝma? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Tin tǝ shin ti mani dawo, ti kar mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs wu ri ngen dǝmi zhilǝlǝ tun mǝnja ira na dliyami. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Untuwo, muntu kup za argon tu tǝra narika tǝ kopǝn dawo, ti mani dǝmi mǝn kopi gǝn da'a.<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misali ki masi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Maso ho barni, ama tǝmtǝn gǝsni ɗǝlkawo, ba'i mani pali gǝs masa? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Ar ba'i pi argon gip kǝn da'a, ba'i dǝm ghop da'a, sai dǝ shotika katl. Muntu na kǝm kumi gwa naa tǝ kumi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Mǝn nǝmi wurpi bom na nami mǝn warwat pitǝn na womti den ɗirtǝn kar ti kǝ kumi kulci gǝsi. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Arni Parisiyawa na mǝn kulci mbarǝm doka kǝ Musa ngwar wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm kǝn ba nǝm mǝn warwat pitǝn tǝ ci tor gip gal nǝm nan wuri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Tǝ yari wur shirǝm tǝ wule, <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />&lt;&lt;Dǝ wule gon ra na tǝm hauya nantam kan nǝm gip wur ba jilka. Ti za hauya wupse na kutl cet ghwanǝm ju rǝn bi lǝpka tǝ nǝm ngeni muntu kan jilka se tin tǝ zam ti kan diya? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Tin tǝ zam ti ngapo, ti pǝn ti den bibyala na ghol mbatli. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Na ɗirtǝn gǝs bomo ti la bi ga berǝm, na berǝm dǝmi gǝs tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;Tayem ni ghol mbatli, tǝm gǝn kan jil kawo a zam tǝ wi.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Ne ɓa yari ine, untuni es ba pi ghol mbatl na nari to yamka, den mǝn warwat pitǝn nǝm kan ci atl gam tǝ pal kar Yam gwa, ar man kǝ mbarǝm hauya wupse na kutl cet ghwanǝm mǝn ho pitǝn ju kan ra na argon kǝ ci atl gam dǝ pal kar Yam da gwa.<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Misali kǝ wurpi kan jilka gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />&lt;&lt;Dǝ wule nagǝr gon ra na wurpi gǝs bar gǝlla kutl, kan dǝ nǝm jilka. Ti mbǝsh utu, tǝ sar kushi gǝska tǝ ngen wurpiyi hoyi se tin tǝ zam wurpi gǝs tu kan jilka gwa diya? <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wurpiyiwo ho wurpini wule bargǝlla tu mǝ jili gwa. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Tin tǝ zam ngapo, ti dom ga berǝm na berǝm dǝmi gǝs tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;Tayem ni ghol mbatli, a zam wurpi gǝn wi nan jilka gwa.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Nǝm barni, a yari ine, untuni ghol mbatl ba nǝra cina dǝ mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami den mǝn warwat pitǝn nǝm kan ci atl gam tǝ pal kar Yam den wani pitǝn gǝs gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bǝba mǝn zo mbatli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Tǝ pa wul ra'e, &lt;&lt;Pi bakos gon mǝn mir moni rop. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Nye mǝn gǝpiyi wul bas'e, &lt;Bǝba, bim argon tu ndari dǝ bin gip bar kǝ am gi nan ba bim kini kǝ mǝshka gwa.&gt; Ti ngapo tǝ tatli wur kup argon tu tǝ ra nari gwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Ar murka gho da'a, kan nye mǝn gǝpiyi ba dom kup bar ju tǝ zam gwa, tǝ ndara atl gon na dlyami tǝ jili bar gǝska kup den kumi dǝɗǝm katl. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Nan tǝ jili bar kǝ am gǝska kupo, kan guzum ba nda gip atli na nari, tin tu tǝ sa wi am koni. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Kan tǝ pal nye mǝn tle oro kǝ mbarǝm gon gip atli, muntu kan ne ti mǝn le alade gǝs gwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Tǝ ndu ma dǝ bi ti fingal kǝ alade ju ti ma tǝ ci, ko nǝm murgon ra kan bi ti argon gwa da'a.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />&lt;&lt;Kan tǝ tla bǝram kǝ dli gǝs tǝ wule, &lt;Mir mǝn tle oro kǝ ban mǝneni na fingal har wu ne gemi, amin kǝn ɗe ari kǝ mǝshtǝn wi na guzum wop! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Naa nǝm tǝp a pal rǝn bom dǝ ban ka a wul ti'e, &lt;Bǝba, a pi wani pitǝn cina dǝ Yam na cina da'i wi. <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Kǝkǝno a'i ndari dǝ wulǝm'e nya gi da'a, se de dǝ palin nǝm na mir mǝn tle oro da'i.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Se tǝ tlyam tǝ nǝm tǝp dǝ base. Ama tun tǝ'i na dlyami, arni basi shin ti kan guna ba citi den ti, tǝ kǝtǝr tǝ mbor ti, tǝ la'i ti am ɗir yar tǝ pi ti sumba. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sumba: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gip al’ada kǝ mǝn Yahudawo, sumbawo arni’e nune ghol mbatl na nari den metǝn na ezǝni. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Nyayi ba wul ti'e, &lt;Bǝba, a pi warwat pitǝn wi cina dǝ Yam na cina da'i . Kǝkǝno a'i ndari dǝ wulǝm'e nya gi da'a.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Ama basi wul zher gǝs'e, &lt;Pǝnni zo lulur na zhotǝne, kǝ la'ini nya gǝni. Kemi tǝni zobi te amka, kǝ kemi tǝni kaptǝlan te asǝmka. <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Nǝm ni basi tla kǝ mboshni. Na mǝ pini biki mǝ ci mǝ tla ni. <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />Nya gǝn kǝno ya mǝshnǝka hari artu ya pal wi, ya jilka artu zamti wi.&gt; Kan wu nǝm ci na tle.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />&lt;&lt;Bar ju kup piwo, mǝn bari kǝ nya tu rǝn gip kǝnka. Nan tǝ mbira ɗir kar bomo, se tǝ kum gangan na dlarni ba tli. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Kan tǝ la bi zher kǝ bas gon tǝ tambe ti tǝ wule, &lt;Unun ba ratlu?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;Mǝn gǝpi gi ni pali, arni be mbosh basi tla den'e nya gǝs pal bom lau.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Argon tu ci lo nye mǝn bariyi, arni tǝ nge tetǝn gip bomka. Kan bas ba ɗǝl ter kari tǝ pi ti shirǝm, tǝ lir ti. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Ama tǝ nǝmi basi tǝ wule, &lt;Ɓa shini! Sheti ghon na womti a ne'i den pi mbapi, a taɓe nge shirǝm gi da'a. Kup na untu kǝ taɓen bi nye mar nan mi ci mǝ tla na mir berǝm gǝn gwa da'a. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Ama nya gi kǝn kan yem bar kǝ am gi ri lika den mǝtli mǝn dǝmi kǝ gam gǝzǝn pal bomo, arni kǝ mboshi ti basi tla!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Bas ba wule, &lt;Nya gǝni, kiwo ki nǝra dlakǝt namǝni, kup bar ju ami ra nariwo geni. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Ama ar ndari mǝ pi biki mǝ pi ghol mbatli, den'e mǝn gipi gi mǝshka kan tǝ pal lasi, ya jilka kan ba zam ti.&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Yesu wul mir mǝn kopi gǝs'e, &lt;&lt;Pi mǝn bar kǝ am gon kan bi wakili gǝs gos gam tǝ ne ger dene gwa. Den kariwo ceti tǝ gamka den kandatu wakili gǝs den cetka na gos gam gǝsi gwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Arni babomi la tǝbi, tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;Unun a kum mbarǝm ba yari den ki untu? Dlǝmin bar ju am da'i gwa, ki'i dǝm wakili gǝn da'a.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Arni wakiliyi wul tor mbatl da ti'e, &lt;Kǝkǝn kan, Babom gǝn ba karǝmka den mbap kǝno unun a pi? Artu a mbu kori bar da'a, esi a kum sham kǝ liri bari. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />A mom bar kǝ pi wi in karǝmka den mbap kǝn kan mbarǝm baa nǝmǝn bom da wur gwa.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Arni tǝ labi kup mbarǝm ju babom gǝs ba kop wur asǝm yam gwa na nǝm-nǝm. Kan tǝ tambe nǝm tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;Mǝnen babom gǝn ba kop kiwe?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Tǝ wule, tǝ nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;Mbunlet mir zangu wuzupse.&gt; Arni wakiliyi wul ti'e, &lt;Nǝm tǝlankuri zho’i kǝ rǝsh zangu wupse.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Tǝ pa wul gon'e, &lt;Kiwo mǝnen tǝ kop ki?&gt; Tǝ nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;Shar o kǝ alkama hauya nantam.&gt; Wakiliyi wul ti'e, &lt;Tǝlankur tu rǝsh hauya wupse.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Arni babomi yar zo shirǝm den wayo kǝ wakili mǝn utu tu tu. Mbarǝm kǝ zhan kǝn mani kopi na ezǝn man mbarǝm kǝ cirtǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Yesu pa wule, &lt;&lt;A yari ine, maninǝ kopi na bar kǝ am gin kǝ zamni berǝmi. Untuni in bar kǝ am gin pa kawo ba nǝm kǝn gip bom kǝ dǝmi kan ba pa da gwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Muntu kup la ne mbatl den ti den heli baro ba la mbatl den ti den nari. Muntu na gaskiya den heli bar dawo, ti mani dǝmi mǝn gaskiya den bari da'a. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />In ne mbatl den kǝn den bar kǝ duniya kǝn dawo, woni ba ne mbatl den kǝn den ho bar we? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Eso in kǝ mani nǝmi bar kǝ mbarǝm hoyi dawo, woni ba bi in bar jen ra kan gegin nigwa.<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Zher gon ra kan ba mani bote babom rop gwa da'a, ko tǝ nge nǝmi, tǝ ndu nǝmi, ko tǝ pi nǝmi ho pitǝne, tǝ mbur nǝmi. Arba pi da'a kǝ bote Yam na wurpi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu shirǝm na Parisawa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Kan Parisawa mǝn ndu'i wurpino, na kumi argon tu Yesu yariwo, arni wu desi ti njipe. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Arni Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝn ni'e mǝn ndu'i dǝ mbarǝm mom'e kǝn mǝn pitǝn dlat ni, Yamo ti ni tǝ mom mbatl gini. Bar ju mbarǝm ba bi wur nartǝno, arni Yam ba nge shini. <verse eid="LUK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Doka kǝ Musa na tǝlankur kǝ mǝn shirǝm na Yamni mbarǝm pi ta kopi ndekes ar ri ɗirtǝn kǝ Yohana mǝn pi batisma. Tun lokociyi den pi wazu kǝ zo shirǝm kǝ Yam kǝ dǝmi cina da ti ko gonge den ndotǝn tǝ zam totǝne. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Kup na untu, ar ba mani pitǝn dǝ yam na atl paka, na dǝ wule la ko njemka gip doka kǝ Musa.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />&lt;&lt;Kup muntu kar gǝr gǝska kan ɓal na gono tǝ pi zǝna ituwi, eso, kup muntu gudlumi na gǝr tu bakos gǝs kar ti kawo, zǝnan tǝ den pi nan ti pa'e.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shirǝm den mǝn bar kǝ am na muntu kan am ri ti kar da gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;Pi mǝn bar kǝ am gon muntu ba la lulur mǝn wurpi gwa, tǝ ci ho fingal se na gǝni. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Bǝdlabǝn da ti ngapo ba kur ne mǝn liri bar goni, sun gǝs’e Li'azaru, muntu dli gǝs kup usuni gwa. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Tǝ ndu'e tǝ kur ci mir roɓǝs fingal ju ba ro sur am dǝ mǝn bar kǝ ami gwa. Yer ma wu kur ɗir lǝpti usu gǝsi.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />&lt;&lt;Gip untuwo, arni mǝn liri bari mǝshka, kan mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam ba te ti kar Ibǝrahim. Mǝn bar kǝ ami ngapo, nan ti mǝsho kan ba kap ti ka. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Ti te gip utu kawo, tǝ den ngasi kur bi, kan ti la ger yamo arni tǝ shin Ibǝrahim na dlyami na Li'azaru kar ti. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Kan tǝ laa bi tǝ wule, &lt;Bǝba Ibǝrahim, kum guna gǝn kǝ kar Li’azaru tǝ kem nye gam yasa gǝs gip mal tǝ la'in den lǝka gǝn a kum iɗatǝni. Gip utu kǝno ami den kumi dli.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Ama Ibǝrahim wul ti'e, &lt;Nya gǝni, tune, nan kira gip duniyawo, ki na ho bar na womti, Li’azaru ngapo tǝra na argon da'a. Kǝkǝn eso, tǝ den kumi tǝmi ɗe, ki ngapo kǝ den kumi dli. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Untu dama, Yam la bar shu gip dlom dami, den'e munju ba ndu tertǝn kar kǝno, wi mani da'a. Kǝn ma ki mani jikati ter da'a.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Arni mǝn bar kǝ am tu wule, &lt;A lir ki Bǝba, kar ti su bom dǝ mǝn gǝri gǝn ka. <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />Ami ra na mir byar nantam, tǝ dǝli wur kǝm ba wu ɗir kǝ ba las dun mbatl kǝn da'a.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Arni Ibǝrahim wul ti'e, &lt;Wi ra na Musa na mǝn yar shirǝm kǝ Yami, wu kum shirǝm gǝzǝni.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Mǝn bar kǝ ami wule, &lt;O'o, Bǝba Ibǝrahim, in mǝshi mbarǝm ni tli tǝ ri yari wuro, wi ci atl gam wu pal kar Yami.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Kano Ibǝrahim ba wul ti'e, &lt;In wu kum yari kǝ Musa na mǝn shirǝm na Yam dawo, ko gon tlyam gip gam-bǝci ma wi kum ti da'a.&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Yesu wul mir mǝn kopi gǝs'e, &lt;&lt;Bar ju ba kem mbarǝm kǝ wani pitǝno ar ba ɗiri, untuwo, ar ba dǝm bar kǝ guna den muntu pi tǝp kǝ ɗirtǝn kǝ wani pitǝni gwa! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Na dǝ gon kem mimir ju wani pitǝno, ar ba mani mǝri dǝ ɓali ti ghun ɗir yare, kan dǝ la ti su gip bar ɓulaka! <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Pini lura na gam gini, ya'ini pi'i hoyi dawo, matl ti, tin tǝ ci atl gamo, nǝmi ti. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Tin tǝ pi'i laifi bisi nyingi den pǝt nǝm, kan tǝ ci atl gamo, nǝmi ti.&gt;&gt; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Laifi bisi nyingi: Nyingiwo lamba kǝ mǝn Yahudani. Ar ni’e bar lamba. Wu shin ya’ini pi’i hoyi da’a kǝ bisi nyingiwo ar nar utuwi. Arni man untu, mbarǝmni ci atl gamo, ba nǝmi ti. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbǝli mi la'i mbatli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Arni mir mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;Mbǝli mi la'i mbatli.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Arni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;In kǝn ra na la'i mbatl wule ge dǝntiwo, ki wul bar kin dlǝngari tu'e, &lt;Tus na gǝs gi kǝ su ɓa su gip ɓula ka,&gt; ti kum yari gini.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Gon ra gip kǝn kan na zher kan ba kori ti bari, ko ba le ti tǝme nan tin tǝ pal ɗir gip kǝno, ti wul ti'e, &lt;Zho'i, kǝ dǝm kǝ ci bar gwaya?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Ti wul untu da'a, ti wul ti'e, &lt;Pǝnin fingal gǝn, dlǝr den asǝm gi kǝ win cina kakani, a ci a tla, kan kǝ'i ci ge diya?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Ti gode zher tu den mbap tu tǝ wul ti'e tǝ pi gwaya? Ba pi untu da'a! <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Untuni, kǝnni kǝ kop bar ju kup wul kǝn'e kǝ pi, ki wule, &lt;Miyo zherni katl. Miyo mǝnni den pi argon tu wul mi'e mǝ pi gwa.&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu warke mǝn ndǝcci kutl</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Den tǝp ritǝn Urushalimawo, tǝ kop den iyaka gip dlom kǝ Samariya na Galili. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Tǝ te gip nye bǝn gono, arni tǝ mo na mǝn ndǝci kutl, wu dlǝr teka jen. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Arni wu la bi na bar yare wu wule, &lt;&lt;Babom Yesu! Kum guna gǝmi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Nan tǝ shǝn wuro, tǝ wul wur e, &lt;&lt;Rǝnǝka kar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa, wu shǝn kǝne.&gt;&gt; Nan wu den tǝp ritǝno, arni wu warke. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Nan nǝm gip wur shin tǝ warkewo, kan tǝ pal ɗir tǝ den ɗǝɗa Yam na bar yare. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Tǝ ɗir nda cina dǝ Yesu, tǝ gode ti, ba mǝn Samariya ni'e ti. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm kutlni a warke wur diya? Akon ghwanǝmi ra? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Unun kem mǝn diki tun pal ɗir katl tǝ gode Yami?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Tlyam kǝ ndara wongi, ngǝshtǝn gi den Yam warke iwi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Surtǝn kǝ mulki kǝ Yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Nan Parisawa ndu wu mom gigasi ni zo dǝmi cina dǝ Yam ba cwatu, tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Dǝmi cina dǝ Yamo ba shin ti na ger da'a. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Murgon ba wule, &lt;Ar kǝni!&gt; ko &lt;Arta!&gt; da'a, gip dlom ginni ar ra.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Yesu pa wul mir mǝn kopi gǝs'e, &lt;&lt;wokoci den ɗirtǝne kan ki ndu shini pǝt nǝm gip pǝt kǝ Nya Mbarǝme, ama ki shin da'a. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Mbarǝm na womti ba wul kǝn'e, &lt;Shinni barta&gt;, ko &lt;Shinni ɗe,&gt; ama kop wurni da'a. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Gastu kan Nya Mbarǝm ba pal suro, ti sur wule ci bi kǝ Yami, kan ba cir tor gǝsi, kan ar nda bin gwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ama ti kum dli hoyi kakani kan dǝ mbarǝm kǝ zhan kǝn nge ti.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />&lt;&lt;Wule argon tu pi kǝ zhan kǝ Nuhu gwa, untuni ba pi den gastu kan Nya Mbarǝm ba pal sur gwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Mbarǝm den ci na tle, moni den gudlumi, den bi mǝtli kǝ gudlumi ar ri gastu Nuhu te gip bar kungǝlǝn jikat mal gǝs gwa, kan bar mal ba sur pǝn wurka kup. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Untuni gip muri kǝ Lutu, mbarǝm den ci na tle, wu den wuri na wurika, wu den ngani na tu'i bine. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Ama den pǝt tukan Lutu za Sodomo, arni shot bǝlǝm utu na gǝzhǝn utu sur yami, kan ba ri wur eka kup. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Untuni ba pi den pǝt tu Nya Mbarǝm pal gwa.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />&lt;&lt;Gasiwo, muntu den gam kushiwo, ba tǝ ɗǝl sur kǝ yemi gos gam gǝs gip bom da'a. Untuni, kup muntu kan ri bi lǝp kawo, bat na paltǝn bomi. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Tuneni nagǝr kǝ Lutu! <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.32 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nagǝr kǝ Lutu: Tini’e muntu nan Yam wul Lutu e tǝ ɗǝl tǝ za Sodom, nan wu ɗǝlo, anni tǝ bali ger kari, kan tǝ dǝmka masi. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Muntu kup ba ghundǝr mbatl gǝskawo, ar ba jilka, ama muntu la mbatl gǝskawo, ti zami. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />A yari ine, gastawo mbarǝm rop ba nde umur den dandi nǝm, ba pǝn nǝmka dǝ za nǝmi. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Mǝtli rop bani den lu'i bari, ba pǝn nǝmka dǝ za nǝmi. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Mbarǝm rop bani gip kǝne ba pǝn nǝmka dǝ za nǝmi.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aya kǝ hauya nǝm na kutl cet mukka tuwo, an ra gip kor tǝlankur kǝ Yam ɓe kǝ pari da’a. Ama pǝnni gip Matta 24:40 kan ba la gipi kǝ dǝ ar ri kor. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Mir mǝn kopi gǝs tambe ti, wu wule, &lt;&lt;A koni, Babomi?&gt;&gt; Ti wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Lastu mǝshi bar rawo, lasini zhipki ba dom wuri.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Shirǝm den nagǝr gon guri mǝn ndotǝne</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Yesu pa shirǝm na mir mǝn kopi gǝsi, tǝ bi wur misali gon tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Pini ta shirǝm na Yam ba kǝ cenni mbatlka da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Rǝn gip bǝn gon ka alkali gon ra, muntu kan laa Yam mbatl da'a, tǝ ra na guna ger den murgon da'a. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Nagǝr gon ra guri gip bǝni, muntu kan meti ritǝn kar ti tǝ kuli ti, &lt;Nem am ra dǝ bin argon tu ndarǝm gwa am dǝ mǝn nge gǝni.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Gip muri njemo ya nge, ama den kariwo, tǝ wul tor mbatl da ti'e, &lt;A mom'e a bǝrti Yam da'a, eso, a shin guna kǝ murgon da'a, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />kup na untuwo, guri kǝn ghunǝm narwi, a ɓal mbatl dlom gam a ne ti shim ame, a zam a shuku ra na ɗirtǝn gǝs se na gǝni kǝ ghuni gǝni.&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Kan Yesu ba wule, &lt;&lt;Ɓa kumni argon tu alkali tu kan ba bǝrti Yam da'a yari gwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Yam ba pi dlat munju tǝ la wur bi wu dǝm mbarǝm gǝs, munju ba kuli ti pǝt na gas gwa diya? Ti zhoti tǝ pi wur argon tu ndar wur gwa diya? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />A yari ine, ti pi wur dlat, na zhotǝne. Ama, gas tu Nya Mbarǝm ni suro, ti zam la'i mbatl den atl kama?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ba Parise na mǝn nǝmi wurpi Bom kǝ Yam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Yesu ba pa yari wur misali, mǝn ju kan ba pali gam gǝzǝn mǝn la'i Yam mbatlni, har wu mbur jenka gwa, <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />&lt;&lt;Mbarǝm jen rop te gip Bom kǝ Yam zam wu shirǝm na Yami, mǝn nǝm ba Parise, gon ngapo mǝn nǝmi wurpi bom ni. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Ba Parise tu tlyam kan tǝ shirǝm na Yam den gam gǝsi, tǝ wule, &lt;Yami, a goode'i nan ami wule nami mbarǝm da'a, wule mǝn nǝmi bar mbarǝmka, mǝn wani pitǝne, ko mǝn kopi mǝtli, ko wule mǝn nǝmi wurpi bom tu. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />A pi guzum mal bisi rop gip muri nyingi kup, kan a bi nǝm gip kutl kǝ argon tu kup a zam gwa.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Ama mǝn nǝmi wurpi bom tu dlǝr teka jen. Tǝ mbu la'i gam to yamka dama, ama tǝ ɓo am den ngetl tǝ wule, &lt;Yami, ami mǝn wani pitǝnni, shin guna gǝn ngapi.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />A yari in den'e, mbarǝm tu ri bomo Yam pǝni ti warwat pitǝn gǝs ka, ar man mǝn nǝm tu nan zam da gwa. Muntu kup ɗǝɗa gam gǝso ba pali ti argoni da'a, muntu ngap pali gam gǝs argonni dawo ba ɗǝɗa ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dǝmi wule heli mimiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Mbarǝm ne den ɗiri Yesu mimir tǝ ne am den wuri. Nan mǝn kopi gǝs shin untuwo, arni wu matl wuri. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Ama Yesu la wur bi tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Zani mimir wu ɗir karǝmi, hane wur nǝka da'a, zami zo dǝmi cina dǝ Yamo kǝ iri gǝzǝn ni. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Na ho bini a yari ine, kup muntu nǝm zo dǝmi cina dǝ Yam tor mbatl wule heli nya dawo, ti te gipi da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nduni Yam man bar kup</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Bar mbarǝm gon tambe Yesu, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Zo mǝn kulci, unun a pi nan a zam rai kan ba pa da gwawe?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Imni kǝ wulǝm'e zo'iwe? Zo'i ra da'a se Yam nan gǝsi. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Kǝ mom doka tu Yam bi Musa, &lt;Ba kǝ kop mǝtli da'a, ba kǝ ri mbarǝm eka da'a, ba kǝ pi mur da'a, ba kǝ kop kar kǝ lar da'a, ngusi gam bǝba gi na nǝna gi.&gt;&gt; &gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />&lt;&lt;A kop mǝn ju wi kup nan a'i heli gwa har sekǝni, tǝ wul untu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Nan Yesu kum untuwo, tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Har kǝkǝn ma kǝ'i hol bar nǝm. Wur kup bar ju ki nari ka, kan kǝ bi munju nan am ri wur kar da gwa, ki zam zo bar to Yamka. Kan kǝ ɗir, kǝ kopǝni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Nan tǝ kumo, arni dun mbatl nǝm ti na nari, don ti mǝn bar kǝ am ni naari. <verse eid="LUK 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Yesu wi ti ger kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;An ban nar wule unu dǝ mǝn bar kǝ am zam zo dǝmi cina dǝ Ba Gun Yami. <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Zami zo dǝmi cina dǝ Ba Gun Yam kǝ mǝn bar kǝ am ban man dǝ rakumi ɗǝl gip shu alura.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Munju kumo, kan wu tambe, &lt;&lt;Kan woni ba zam ɗǝltǝn ituwe?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;Argon tu mbarǝm ba mani pi dawo, Yam ba mani pi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Bitrus ba wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Mǝ za kup bar ju mǝn narika mǝ kop ki wi!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />&lt;&lt;A yari in na ho bi,&gt;&gt; Yesu wul wur ra'e, &lt;Gon ra gip kǝn kan za bomka, ko nagǝr gǝsi, ko mǝn bari na mǝn gǝpi, ko mǝn gǝri gǝsi, ko mimiri den bi zo dǝmi cina dǝ Ba Gun Yam, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />kan ba hol nǝmi gucipi na womti den duniya, to yamka ngapo mbatl tu ba mǝsh da gwa.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu pa yar kanda tu ti mǝsh gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Yesu ɗǝli kutl cet rop ju kǝti nǝm tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Mǝ toni Urushalima, toka ni bar ju kup mǝn shirǝm na Yam rǝsh den Nya Mbarǝmo ba la'i. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Wi bi ti am dǝ mǝn ju kan mǝn Yahudani da gwa. Wi lo ti, wi zage ti, wi bǝse ti mo'ǝmi, wi ɓo ti kan dǝ ri ti eka. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Den pǝt kǝ myakano ti tlyam lasi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Mir mǝn kopi gǝs mom argon tu tǝ shirǝm dene gwa da'a. Ghundǝri wur nǝka, arni kem wu mom argon tu tǝ shirǝm dene gwa da'a.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ɓuli ger tabi mǝn liri bari</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Nan Yesu pi kusa na Jerikowo, ba tabi gon ra ba dǝm bi guntǝp kǝ liri bari. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Nan tǝ kum womti mbarǝm den kopi kartiwo, tǝ tambe ko unun ba ratlu. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Yesu ba mǝn Nazaratni den shigetǝni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Tǝ la bi tǝ wule,&lt;&lt;Yesu nya Dauda, shin guna gǝni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Munju ra cina gip mbarǝmiwo wu matl ti, wu wule, &lt;&lt;Yon shot!&gt;&gt; Ama tǝ la yar ra na naari, &lt;&lt;Nya Dauda, shin guna gǝni!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Yesu dlǝri, kan tǝ bi bi'e dǝ ɗiri ba tabiyi kar ti, nan tǝ mbira kosakwo, Yesu tambe ti, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />&lt;&lt;Unun kǝ ndu'e a pi'i we?&gt;&gt; Tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, a ndu'e a shin bari!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Kan Yesu ba wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Shin bari! Ngǝshtǝn den Yam gi warke iwi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 18:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Kǝ lasi tǝ zam shini bari, kan tǝ kop Yesu, tǝ den ɗǝɗa Yami. Kup munju shino, wu ɗǝɗa Yami.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Zakka mǝn nǝmi wurpi bom kan nǝm kopi Yesu gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Yesu te gip Yeriko, tǝ den shigetǝn gip bǝni. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Mbarǝm gon ra nan ba wul ti'e Zakka gwa, bari kǝ mǝn nǝmi wurpi bom ni mǝn bar kǝ ame. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mǝn nǝmi wurpi bomi: Mǝn Yahuda ba nge wur nari den wu pi mǝn Roma mbapi, eso wu nǝm wurpi den wur narka. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Tǝ ndu'e tǝ shin woni'e Yesu, ama tǝ mani da'a nan mbarǝm womtika lasi gwa, kan tǝ tlyar da'a. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Ra'untuwo, tǝ nda cina na kǝtǝre tǝ to den bar kin dlǝngari goni bi tǝp tu Yesu den kopi gwa kǝ tǝ shin ti.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Nan Yesu ɗir lasiwo, tǝ tli ger yam tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Zakka, zho'i kǝ ɗǝl suri, sekǝno an nǝmǝn te yarka a dǝm bom da'i.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Zakka zhoti tǝ ɗǝl suri, tǝ nǝm Yesu bom da ti na ghol mbatli.<verse eid="LUK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Na shini untuwo, ar ni mbarǝmi kup ngwar wu wule, &lt;&lt;Tǝ ri kǝ dǝmi mǝn diki bom dǝ mǝn warwat pitǝne.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Ar ni Zakka tlyam tǝ wul Babom'e, &lt;&lt;Shini Babomi, a bi tatli kǝ argon tu ami nari gwa, dǝ munju kan am ri wur kar da gwa. In a cuce murgon ngap, a pali ti gucipi wupse.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Sekǝno ceto ɗir gip bom kǝn wi, tunkan mbarǝm tu ma nya Ibǝrahim ni gwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Ami Nya Mbarǝm surni kǝ ngeni kan a ɗǝli munju jilka wule Zakka gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shirǝm den zher kutl kan bi wur wurpi gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Nan wu den kumi bar ju tǝ yari wuro, kan tǝ yari wur shirǝmi, domici tǝ mbi kosak na tetǝn Urushalima wi, kan mbarǝm ngapo wu neka den mulki kǝ Yam ba cwat ituwi bǝle-bǝle. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Bar mbarǝm gon ri gip dlyami bǝn gon kǝ dǝ bi ti gun kan tǝ pal ɗir lasi. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Bitu ti ndarawo, tǝ labi zher gǝs wi kutl tǝ bi wur wurpi bali na nari, tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;Balini wurpi tu an ri paltǝn gǝni.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Ama kan mbarǝm kǝ bǝn gǝs ba nge ti, wu kar jen rǝnka wu wule, &lt;Miwo mǝ ndu mbarǝm tu kǝ gun gǝmi da'a.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Kup na untu, wu bi ti gunyi, tǝ pal ɗir bomi. Kan tǝ kar bar dǝ domi ti zher gǝs kutl ju kan tǝ bi wur wurpi gwa, tǝ mom tu kǝ bar ju wu zam den wurpiyi gwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Kǝ nǝm ter tǝ wule, &lt;Babomi, a zam gucupi kutl den muntu kan kǝ bin gwa.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Arni Babomi wul ti'e, &lt;Ar mbuni zo zhere, tun kan kǝ pi dlat den heli baro a bi'i gun kǝ bǝn kutl.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Zher kǝ ropi ter tǝ wule, &lt;Babomi, a zam gucupi nantam den muntu kan kǝ bin gwa.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Babomi wul muntu'e, &lt;Ki dǝm gun kǝ bǝn nantam.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Ama zher gon ɗir esi tǝ wule, &lt;Babomi, wurpi gin kǝni, a ghundǝrika gip tutule. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Amo a kum bǝrti gi, ki mbarǝm gon ni mǝn bantǝni. Mǝn ndu'i ci nguɓuk ni, kǝ rǝsh kǝn tu kin kǝ ngani da gwa.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Arni tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;Ki warwat zhere! Aa si'i gam gǝs mal den argon tu kǝ yari gwa. Kǝ mom den ami mbarǝm mǝn bantǝn ni, a pǝn argon tu kan a ne da gwa, a rǝsh argon tu a ngani dawo? <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Unun kem kǝ nem wurpi gǝnka gip bom ne wurpi da'a, in a pal ɗiro a zam mal dene ra gwa?&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Tǝ wul munju ɗir markǝm da ti'e, &lt;Nǝm ni wurpi kǝ am da tika, kǝ bi ni muntu kan na gucipi kutl gwa.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Arni wu nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;Babomi, tǝ ra na wurpi na nariwi ca!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;A yari ine, muntu nariwo ba bi ti ra, ama muntu nari dawo nye argon tu am dati ma ba nǝmka. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Ama mǝn nge gǝn ju nan ba ndu'e a dǝm gun gǝzǝn dawo, ɗir wurni ɗe dǝ ri wur eka cina dami.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu te Urushalima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Nan Yesu yari shirǝm juwo, arni tǝ nda cina tǝ ne gam Urushalima. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Nan tǝ ɗir kar mir bǝn jen nan ba wul wur'e Betfaji na Betanya nan markǝm tlǝndǝr kǝ Zaitunwo, tǝ kar mir mǝn kopi gǝsi wi rop, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Teni gip nye bǝn kǝ cina tu, in kǝ mbu baro, ki zam nye bar kǝm gon na ɓali nan taɓe totǝn den tiwi da gwa. Pǝtl tǝni kǝ ɗir tǝni ɗe. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />In murgon wul kǝn'e, &lt;Unun kem kǝ pǝtl tiwo?&gt; wul ti ni'e, &lt;Babom ni ba ndu'i.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Munju nan kar wuro wu ri zam kanda tu tǝ yari wur gwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Wu den pǝtli nye bar kǝmi ituwi, arni mǝn bar kǝmi wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kem kǝ pǝtl tiwu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Wu wule, &lt;&lt;Babom ni ba ndu'i.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Wu ɗir ti kar Yesu, nan wu wi lulur gǝzǝn den tiwo kan wu pǝn Yesu wu ne ti dene. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Tǝ den ritǝno, arni mbarǝm la lulur gǝzǝn den tǝpe. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wu wi lulur gǝzǝn den tǝpe: Muntuwo al’ada kǝ mǝn Yahudani, ar ba gode’e bi nartǝn mbarǝm utuwi. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Nan tǝ ɗir dap na tǝp tu ɗǝl kar tlǝndǝr kǝ Zaitun, arni kup mǝn kopi gǝs nǝm ɗǝɗa Yam na bar yar na ghol mbatl, den kup bar mǝn dlǝkǝntǝn nan wu shin gwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Wu den wul tǝn'e,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 19:38">&lt;&lt;Mǝn albarkani'e gun tu den surtǝn gip sun kǝ Babom Yam gwa! Salama ra to yamka, nartǝn ngapo kǝ Yam ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Arni mǝn Parisa jen gip womti mbarǝmi wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, matl mir mǝn kopi gi wu yoni!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Tǝ nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;A yari ine, in munju yon gǝzǝno, tat ju na gam gǝzǝn ba tli na la'i yare.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kuli Urushalima gami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Nan tǝ ɗir kosak tǝ shin bǝn Urushalimawo, arni tǝ kuli ti gami. <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Dǝ wule kǝ mom ni den pǝt kǝno argon tu ba ɗiri in dǝmi zhilǝlǝ ma, ama kǝkǝno ghundǝri in kawi. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Pǝt jen ba ɗiri in gami kan mǝn nge gin ba tu panye, wu gandǝl kǝne, wu tla kǝn wu pi dlan nan kǝn cina na kari. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Wi byal kǝn atli kǝn na mimir gin gip bǝni, kan wu ri in eka. Ba za tat gon den esi da'a, domici ba zam kǝn den kǝ nge la'i Yam mbatl den'e Yam sur kǝ ɗǝli gin gwa.<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kulci mbarǝm gip Bom kǝ Yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Arni tǝ te gip dǝbom Bom kǝ Yami, tǝ nǝm ɗǝli mǝn ju den wuri barka gwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ar ra na rǝshi,&gt;&gt; &lt;Bom gǝn ba dǝm ba shirǝm na Yami,&gt; ama kǝ pali ba dǝmi kǝ mur wi.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19.46 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bom gǝn ba dǝm ba shirǝm na Yami: Lastuwo pǝn tini gip tǝlankur kǝ mǝn shirǝm na Yam Ishaya 56:7. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 19:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Se na gǝni tǝ pi ta kulci te gip Bom kǝ Yamka, ama kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam, na mǝn kulci mbarǝm doka kǝ Musa, na kiri kǝ bǝni ngen tǝp tu wi ri ti eka gwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />Ama wu zam tǝp nǝmi gǝs da'a, domici mbarǝm kup den ndu'i kumi shirǝm gǝs nari.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Gasi gon nan Yesu ra den kulci mbarǝm gip dǝbom Bom kǝ Yam, tǝ den pi wazu kǝ zo shirǝm kǝ Yami, kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam, na mǝn kulci mbarǝm shirǝm tu kan Yam bi Musa gwa, na kiri babomi wu ɗir kar ti. <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />Wu wule, &lt;&lt;Yari mi, na unu ikoni kǝ den pi bar ju, woni bi’i bi?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Tǝ nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Am ma a tambe ine, kǝkǝno yarin ni, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />batisma kǝ Yohanawo kar Yam ni ɗǝl sura ko kar mbarǝm ni?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Arni wu bali shirǝm tu gip dlom gǝzǝni, wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝn ni mǝ wule sur yam no, ti wule, unun kem kǝ nǝm shirǝm gǝs da'a? <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Ama mǝn ni mǝ wule, kar mbarǝm no, mbarǝm kup ba la mi na tate domici wu nǝm'e Yohana mǝn shirǝm na Yamni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Ar ni wu nǝm wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝ mom las tu ar ɗǝl sur gwa da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Kan Yesu ba wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ami ma a yari in na ikoyi gongeni a pi bar ju da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shirǝm den mǝn mbap mǝn ɗasi tu’e</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Arni tǝ nǝm yari mbarǝm shirǝmi, &lt;&lt;Pi mbarǝm gon kan pi kǝn inabi, kan tǝ bi jen dǝ wu zam ɓomi dene, kan tǝ ndara gip bǝn goni, tǝ dǝm rǝnka kǝ sheti ghon na womti. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Nan pǝt kotli inabiyi ɗiro, kan tǝ kar zher gǝs gon rǝn kar mǝn mbap den kǝn gǝs tuka, dǝ wu bi ti inabiyi jeni. Ama arni mǝn mbap ja ɓo zher tu wu kar ti am koni. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Tǝ pa kar zher goni, ti esi wu ɓo ti, wu bi ti shame, wu kar ti am koni. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Esi, tǝ pa kar mbarǝm kǝ myakan, muntuwo arni wu kumi tǝ dli, wu la tǝka. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Arni mǝn kǝn inabi tu wule, &lt;Unun a piwu? Aa kar nya gǝn nan a ndu ti gwa, wolo wi shin nartǝn gǝsi.&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Ama nan mǝn mbap ja shin tiwo, arni wu wul ezǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Nya tu baa nǝm gǝs bar kǝ bas tu rawi, na mǝ ri ti eka, dǝ kǝni dǝm gwagǝmi ra.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Arni wu byal ti kar kǝn inabiyi kan wu ri ti eka. Unu ari ni ba mǝn kǝn tu ba pi wurwe? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Mǝn ɓomi zami den kǝn gǝs juwo ti ri wur eka, kan tǝ bi jen kǝn inabiyika.&gt;&gt; Nan mbarǝm kum untuwo, arni wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ar ba pi da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />Ama tǝ wi wur gere, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Unun shirǝm kǝ Yam yariwe? &lt;Tat tu mǝn tu'i bom ngewo ar ni'e ho tat kan ne ti den bi tu'i bin gwa!’ <verse eid="LUK 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Kup na untu, muntu kan nda den tat tuwo ti ceccenka, ama tati ni nda den murgono ar ba lu tika tǝ dǝm wule ɗapti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Mǝn kulci mbarǝm na kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam ndu'e wu nǝm Yesu bartu, ama wu kum bǝrti kǝ mbarǝme, shini gǝzǝno den wurni tǝ yari shirǝm tu.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ar ndari dǝ bi Kaisar wurpi boma?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Arni wu wi ti gere, wu yem mbarǝm jen mǝn pǝni asǝm wu pi wule ho mbarǝm ni, kǝ dǝ wu kem Yesu tǝ yari wani shirǝmi, zan wu ri ti cina dǝ bar mǝn dandi kǝ bǝni. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Wu tambe ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, mǝ mom'e shirǝm gi na kulci giwo dlatni ar ra, eso kǝ pi bar kǝ ndu'i gam da'a, ama kǝ kulci mbarǝm ho shirǝm kǝ Yam ndekes. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Ar ndari mǝ bi Kaisar wurpi boma ko ar dlat da'a?&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kaisar: Sunni kan ba ne bar gun kǝ Roma gwa. Kup muntu to den danda kǝ Roma gip zhan tawo ba lati bi nari. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Ama tǝ mom pitǝn gǝzǝnka, kan tǝ wul wur'e, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />&lt;&lt;Nunen ni kabarshu, shishidǝr na sun kǝ woni dene? Wu wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝ Kaisar ni.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kabarshu: Ba wulni wurpiyi’e Dinari, wurpi kǝ mǝn Romani. Muntu kan na shishidǝr na sun kǝ bar mǝn dandi kǝ Romayi dene gwa. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Bi ni Kaisar bar tu kan kǝ Kaisarni gwa, kan kǝ bi ni Yam bar ju kan kǝ Yam ni gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Bartuwo, wu'i mbu nǝmi gǝs na shirǝm den argon tu tǝ yari cina dǝ mbarǝm gwa da'a. Shirǝmi dlǝkǝn wuri, arni wu yon shot.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shirǝm den tli mǝshi mbarǝme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Arni Sadukiyawa jen munju kan la mbatl den'e tli mǝshi mbarǝm ra da gwa, wu ɗir kar Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />Wu tambe ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, Musa rǝshi mi'e, erǝm kǝ mbarǝm ni mǝshka kan tǝ ra na gǝr nan gǝr dawo, ar mbun'e dǝ mǝri pǝn gǝri kǝ dǝ tǝ zami erǝm gǝs tu nya. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Mbarǝm jen ra wi nyingi, nan bi nyin nǝm gwa, bariyi gudlumi na gǝre tǝ mǝshka tǝ zam nya da'a. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />Kǝ rop ma untu, <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />kan kǝ myakani ba pǝn gǝri. Untuni kup gǝzǝn nyingiyi wu mǝshka wu zam gǝri nan ti da'a. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Den kariwo, kan gǝr tu ba mǝshka. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Gas tli mǝshi mbarǝmo gǝr kǝ woni ti dǝm gip wuri we? O fawo, kup gǝzǝno wu gudlumi nan tigwa!&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Arni Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Mimir kǝ zhan kǝn baa gudlumi eso baa ri wur gip kushi. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Ama munju ndar tlitǝn bi dǝ mǝshtǝno wini wi dǝm gip zhan mǝn ɗirtǝne, wi gudlumi da'a ba ri wurka gip kushi da'a. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Wi'i mǝsh da'a, wi ni nǝm na mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yami, wi mimir kǝ Yam ni domici wu tli bi dǝ mǝshtǝn wi.<verse eid="LUK 20:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Eso, Musa nune tetla'e mǝn ju mǝsho wi tlyami, nan tǝ yar shirǝm kǝ lundum nan utu nǝm ama ar kerka da'a. Kan tǝ labi Babom Yam ti ni'e Yam kǝ Ibǝrahim, Yam kǝ Ishaku, Yam kǝ Yakubu. <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Tǝ Yam kǝ mǝshi mbarǝmni da'a, tǝ Yam kǝ munju ra na rai gwani, kar tiwo, kup munju wini rawo mǝn rai ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Arni mǝn kulci doka kǝ Musa jen nǝmi wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, kǝ pi ho shirǝmi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Bartuwo, mbatl dlǝri wur kǝ wu i tambe ti argon da'a.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Woni'e Almasihu?</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Imni ba wule Almasihuwo nya Dauda niwe? <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.41 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kǝristi/Almasihu: Kǝristi na Almasihuwo kup bar nǝm ni, sede Almasihuwo na bi kǝ Girikni Almasihu ngapo na Ibraniyancini. Tini terkawo mbarǝm den ɓuti surtǝn gǝsi. Tini mǝn shirǝm na Yam yari’e ti sur ɗǝli mbarǝm gip dun mbatl gǝzǝni. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Dauda ngap na gam gǝs tǝ yari gip Zabura'e,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">&lt;&lt;Babom wul Babom gǝn'e,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">&lt;Dǝm den am shimli gǝni, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20.42 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dǝm den am shimli: Ar ni’e dǝmi gip nartǝn kǝ kumi tǝmi kar Yami. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />se amin a kem mǝn nge gi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:43">dǝm ba ne asǝm gi.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Dauda la ti bi'e &lt;Babomi,&gt; imni es ti dǝm nya gǝs rawu?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Nan mbarǝm kup den kumi gǝso, arni tǝ wul mir mǝn kopi gǝs'e, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />&lt;&lt;Pini hankali na mǝn kulci mbarǝm doka kǝ Musa, mǝn ndu'i ndǝtltǝn gip kiri luluri, mǝn ndu'i e dǝ shirmi wur gip bar pǝte, mǝn ndu'i dǝ bi wur zo ba dǝmi gip bom kumi shirǝm kǝ Yami na ho ba dǝmi kǝ ba biki. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Wini'e mǝn ci bar kǝ mǝtli ju nan moni gǝzǝn mǝshka gwa, kan wu pi tlyari shirǝm na Yami kǝ dǝ shin wi ho mbarǝm ni. Wini ngap wi zam wani ɓatltǝn mǝn nartǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Nagǝr gon guri bi kup argon tu tǝ ra nari gwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Nan Yesu ra gip Bom kǝ Yamo, tǝ shin mǝn bar kǝ am den wi baiko gǝzǝn gip pantimota ba domi wurpi. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Arni tǝ shin nagǝr gon nan guri kan am ri ti kar da gwa, tǝ wi kabarshu rop. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kabarshu rop: Gip bǝniwo kabarshuni wu pi mbap nari da’a. Wurpi tu pi mbap nari ɗewo heli wurpini.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Arni tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Na ho bini a yari ine, nagǝr tu kan am ri ti kar da'a, wi bar nan man kǝ mbarǝm kup gwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Wiwo wu yemni gip womti bar kǝ am gǝzǝn kan wu bi, ama tiwo gip argon tu tǝra nari da gwan tǝ bi kup bar tu tǝ ra nari gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu shirǝm den yastǝn kǝ Bom kǝ Yam na ndoltǝn kǝ zhan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Mir mǝn kopi gǝs jen ra nǝm shirǝm den Bom kǝ Yami, na mbuni tat ju nan tu bomi nari na mbuni bar ju nan pi ti bar kǝ mbuntǝn nari gwa. Arni Yesu wule, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />&lt;&lt;Bar ju kan kǝ shino, pǝt ba ɗiri nan ba za tat gon den esi gwa da'a, kup ba yasi ka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Arni wu tambe ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ba mǝn kulci, gǝgasi ni untu ba piwu, kan ununu ba dǝm alama bar juni ba pi gwa we?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Arni tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Neni gere, ba dǝ murgon jili in nǝka da'a, jen ra na womti nan ba ɗir na sun gǝni wu wule, &lt;Ami ni'e Almasihu!&gt; kan, &lt;Pǝt ngap an mbirawi kosak!,&gt; kop wurni da'a. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Kǝn ni kǝ kum shirǝm kǝ dlan na meti tli mbatlo, ba kǝ kumni bǝrti da'a. Dole bar ju ba pi kakani, ama pa'i bar kup mbira na zhotǝn wi da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Arni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Atl ba tli esi atl gami. Mulki ba tli esi mulki gami. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Atl ba jirkǝt na nari, ba pi guzum na aloba kǝ ba las na womti. Ba shin bar kǝ bǝrti na womti na kiri alama den ɗǝltǝn sur yami.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Ama kapǝn dǝ bar ju kup piwo, baa nǝm kǝn dǝ kumi in dli, wi ri in gip bom kumi shirǝm kǝ Yami, na bom kǝ moni, ba ɗir kǝn cina dǝ mǝn bǝni na kiri kǝ atli den kǝn gwanni. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Bartuni ki zam bi yari shirǝm demǝni. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Dlǝrǝni mbatl gini, ba ar ghun kǝnni kafin dǝ ri in cina da wur kanda tu ki bali wur gwa da'a. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Domici aa bi in shirǝm na bobya, nan mǝn nge gin gon ra kan ba mbu kemi in gam gǝs mal gwa da'a. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Mǝn gǝri gin na ya'ǝn pa, mǝn gin na berǝm gin ba la'i in gǝs yami, wi kem dǝ ri jen eka. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Mbarǝm kup ba nge ine den bi sun gǝni. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Ama ta gam gin nǝm ra nan ba jilka gwa da'a. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Kǝn ni kǝ ɓa mbatl dlom gamo, ki zam zo dǝmi cina dǝ Yami.<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />Ama kǝn ni kǝ shin mǝn bi utu gandǝl Urushalima kawo, mom ni'e bari kǝ yasika ituwi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Munju kan ra su Yahudiya kawo, wu kǝtǝr wu to gǝzǝn gip tlǝndǝre, kan munju ra gip bar bǝno wu ɗǝli, munju ra rǝn bi lǝpka ngapo ba wu su gip bar bǝn da'a. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />wokoci tuwo wokoci hukuntetǝn ni, kǝ dǝ laa'i bar ju kup rǝsh gip shirǝm kǝ Yam gwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Kashto kǝ mǝtli mǝn tu'e na munju den bi mimir nyin gwa, gas tle wuya na nari gip atlo, lo kǝ Yam ba sur den mbarǝm ju. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Ba ri jen eka na bar sǝɓǝri dǝ nǝm jen dǝ pali wur zher gip atl kup, muntu kan mǝn Yahudani da gwa wi tsanante Urushalima ar ri patǝn kǝ muri mulki kǝ munju kan mǝn Yahudani da gwa.<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Ba shin bar ju taɓe shini da gwa den pǝte na kyare na zingesi, gip duniya ngap mbarǝm kup ba dam wur na bǝrti den mǝn zhe’e mal na wultǝn kǝ bar ɓula'i. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />Mbarǝm ba sumaka na bǝrti, mbatl ba tari wur na shini bar ju den pitǝn gip duniya gwa, domici ba jirkǝt kiri bar ju nan to Yamka gwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Bartuni wi shin Nya Mbarǝm den paltǝn sur gip dun yami, na iko na cirtǝn mǝn nartǝni. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Bar juni nǝm pitǝno, tlini yam kǝ lani gam yami, pǝt ɗǝltǝn gin mbirawi kosak.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Arni Yesu yari wur shirǝm gon tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Shinni kin turume na kin kup. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Wini wu pare gilitǝno, kǝn na gam gin, ki mom'e lurpi mbirawi. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Untu esi, kǝnni kǝ shin bar ju den pitǝno, ki mom'e zo dǝmi cina dǝ Yam mbirawi kosak.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Na ho bi ni a yari ine, mbarǝm kǝ zhan kǝn ba mǝsh da'a se bar juni kup pi kani. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Yam na atl ba pa'i, ama ko njem shirǝm gǝn ba pa da'a.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu shirǝm den dǝmi gǝɗǝn</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Dǝm ni gǝɗǝn, ba kǝ za ni la'i tu gin na huli bar na zhe'e pitǝne, na ghuntǝn kǝ dǝmi kǝ duniya ar tla gam ginka da'a. Ba dǝ pǝt tu ɗir bat na momi gin ar nǝm kǝn wule tarko da'a. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Domici ar ba ɗir ni den mbarǝm kup nan ra den kar atl gwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Ama dǝmni gǝɗǝn ko gǝgasi, kǝn den shirǝm na Yami, kǝ dǝ kǝ zamni ndǝri mbatl nan ki ɗǝl gip bar ju kup kan ba pi gwa, kǝ dǝ kǝ zamni dlǝri cina dǝ Nya Mbarǝm ra.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Den pǝt kup, tǝ den kulci mbarǝm gip dǝbom Bom kǝ Yami, kǝ gas ngapo, tǝ kur ɗǝl tǝ to mur dǝ bar tloyi ti den tlǝndǝr nan ba wul ti'e Tlǝndǝr Zaitun gwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Kǝ cigǝni eso, mbarǝm kup ba ɗir kar ti gip dǝbom Bom kǝ Yam kǝ kumi kulci gǝsi.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Nan biki kǝ burodi nan ba wi ti yisti da'a, muntu ba wul ti'e biki jikat bǝdlabǝn mbirawo. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Biki kǝ burodi nan ba witi yisti gwa da’a: Bikini kan mǝn Yahuda ba pi, kan ba tune wur na ɗǝltǝn gǝzǝn ter Masar, bom bota. Ɗǝltǝni ne wurka na zhotǝne, wu zam pi burodi gǝzǝn kanda tu wu kur pi gwa da’a. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Nan kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam, na mǝn momi shirǝm tu Yam bi Musa den ngeni tǝp tu kan wi ri Yesu eka gwa, ama bǝrti ba ci wur den mbarǝmi.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Kan Shetan ba te gip Yahuda kan ba wul ti'e Iskaryoti gwa, nǝm gip kutl cet rop ju. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Kan Yahuda ba ri kar kiri mǝn keri bar ju nan ɗiri Yam na kiri gip mǝn ne ger den Bom kǝ Yami, kan tǝ bali nan wur den kanda tu kan ti bali kar Yesu gwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Ar gholi wur mbatli, kan bi ba nde wur nǝm den wi bi ti wurpi. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Tǝ nǝmi wuri, kan tǝ pi ta ngeni guntǝp tu kan ti bi Yesu am dawur nan mbarǝm ba nǝra lasi na womti da gwa.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ci fingal kǝ pa'i bisi na mir mǝn kartǝn gǝsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Nan pǝt burodi nan na yisti da'a ɗiro, pǝt tu kan ba mbosh bagala pashi bǝdlabǝn dene gwa, <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Yesu kar Bitǝrus na Yohana, tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Rǝnǝka kǝ pi mini bar kǝ jikat bǝdlabǝn mǝ cini.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Akon kǝ ndu'e mǝ pi we?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝn ni kǝ te gip bǝno, mbarǝm gon ra na tat mal ba mo nan kǝne, kop tǝni kǝ rǝni bom tu tǝ te gipi gwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />Kan kǝ wulni ba mǝn bomi'e, &lt;Ba mǝn kulci wul ki'e, &lt;&lt;Kushi shu'i mǝn diki nǝko, las tu ami na mir mǝn kartǝn gǝn ba ci fingal jikat bǝdlabǝn gwa we?&gt;&gt; &gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Ti ta'i in am den bar kushi kǝ to yami ka, na bar ju kup kǝ ndu gwa gipi. Pi ni lasi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Wu ndara wu ri zam kup bar ju nan Yesu yari wur gwa. Kan wu pi bar kǝ jikat bǝdlabǝni.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Nan bar mbi denewo, Yesu na mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs ba dǝm bi gali. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;A ndu na ghol mbatl na nari A ci biki jikat bǝdlabǝn kǝn nan kǝn kan a nde kumi dli. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />A yari ine, A'i ci biki jikat bǝdlabǝn da'a, se argon tu ba ci bikiyi den am gǝsni la'i gip mulki kǝ Yam wu gwa.&gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mulki kǝ Yam: Mulki kǝ Yamo ba’e barni kan ba shin na ger da gwa, ama ar ba zamni gastu mǝ pali Yesu dǝm gun gǝmi gwa. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Kan tǝ pǝn wuro mal inabi, tǝ goode Yam tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Nǝm ni kǝ ghorti ni kup gini. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />A yari ine, A'i tla mal gǝri kin inabi da'a se mulki kǝ Yam ni sur kani.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Kan tǝ pǝn burodi, tǝ goode Yam, tǝ cettǝli, kan tǝ bi wuri, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Dli gǝn kan bi sabo nan kǝn gwa utu, pini ta pi untu kǝ tuneni namǝni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Untuni esi, kar dǝ fingal kǝ gaso, tǝ pǝn wuro mal inabi, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Wuro mal kǝno pel alkawari kǝ bǝran gǝn ni, muntu shoti sabo nan kǝn gwa, <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />ama mǝn den si am gip gal nǝm na muntu kan ba rin kǝ la'i gǝs yam gwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Nya Mbarǝm ba mǝsh den argon tu Yam ne bi dene gwa, ama kashto kǝ mbarǝm tu kan la'i ti gǝs yam gwa!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Kan wu nǝm tambe ezǝn den'e, woni gip wur ba dǝm'e tin ti pi argon tuwu.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Kan musu ba tli gip dlom gǝzǝn den'e woni ba dǝm bari gip wuri. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Gun kǝ munju kan mom Yam da'a ma, wu gode mbarǝm gǝzǝn iko, kup na untuwo mǝn cina ja ba ne gam gǝzǝn mǝn pitǝn dlatni. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Ama kǝno untun ki pi da'a. Kǝno, bari gip kǝno tǝ pali gam gǝs wule ti'e heli, kǝ cina gin ngapo wu pali gam gǝzǝn wule zhere. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Ofawo woni'e bari, muntu kan na fingal cina da ti gwaya ko muntu bi fingali gwa? Muntu kan na fingal cina da ti gwani diya? Ama kup na ami'e bari gip kǝno, ami nǝra wule mǝn pi fingal gini.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />Kǝnni kǝ ndem kaari gip goji gǝni. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />A bi in iko kǝ pini mulki wule gunye, kanda tu kan Ba-Gun Yam bim gwa, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />don kǝ ci kǝ tlani den tebur gǝn gip mulki gǝni, kǝ dǝm den dandi kǝ sarauta kǝ pini sharia bom kutl cet rop kǝ Isra'ila.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Siman, Siman, kumi, Shetan tambe'e dǝ za ti tǝ gode ine, tǝ bǝtke in wule alkama. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Ama a shirǝm na Yam den am gin wi, Siman, ba dǝ la'i mbatl gi ɗatka da’a. Kin kǝ ci atl gam kǝ bali wani pitǝn gi kar gwa, ɓa'i bigul ya'ǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Siman nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, a pǝni mbatl gǝn a tǝ nan ki gip bom kǝ moni, ko a mǝsh nan ki.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Yesu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;A yari'i, Bitǝrus, kamin dǝ tus kor laa yar sekǝno, ki wule kǝ momǝn da'a bisi myakan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Arni Yesu wul mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs'e, &lt;&lt;Gas tu a kar kǝn am koni, kǝ pǝn posh wurpi, ko bar posh, ko kaptǝlan dawo unun kǝ holu?&gt;&gt; Wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ko nǝm.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ama kǝkǝno, kǝnni na bar posh na posh wurpiwo pǝnni, muntu na bar suɓur dawo, ya wur lulur gǝska tǝ wur nǝm. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Ar ra na rǝshi gip shirǝm kǝ Yami, &lt;Dlǝm ti gip mǝn warwat pitǝne,&gt; A yari inra, shirǝm tu ba pa demǝni. Untuni es kup bar ju rǝsh demǝno, demǝnni ba la'i.&gt;&gt; <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.37 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dlǝm ti gip mǝn wani pitǝne: Aya tuwo zamni gip tǝlankur kǝ mǝn shirǝm na Yam Ishaya 53:12. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Mir mǝn kopi gǝs ba wule, &lt;&lt;Ɓa shini, Babomi, bar suɓur rop ni jini.&gt;&gt; Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ar kǝmwi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu shirǝm na Yam den tlǝndǝr zaitun</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Yesu ɗǝl tǝ to gǝs den tlǝndǝr kǝn zaitun kanda tu tǝ kur pi gwa, kan mir mǝn kopi gǝs ba kop ti. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Na mbu'i bar lasiwo, ar ni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Shirǝmni na Yam bǝse kǝ ndani gip godetǝne.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Tǝ isha tǝka kar wuri den bi dlyamtǝn kǝ la'i tate, tǝ ngus atl tǝ shirǝm na Yami. <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />&lt;&lt;Bǝba, arni pǝni'i mbatlo, pǝnim kumi dli kǝnka, kup na untuwo, dǝ kop pǝni kǝ mbatl gi ba'e gwan da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Kan mǝn kartǝn kǝ Yam ba cwat sur yam tǝ ɓa'i ti bigule. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Tǝ mbi gip dun mbatl na nari wi, ar ni tǝ meti shirǝm na Yam hoyi, kan bangani ba nǝm ɗǝltǝn den ti wule gudǝl bǝran ba ro atli.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Nan tǝ shirǝm na Yam tǝ tlyam tǝ pal ɗir kar mir mǝn kopi gǝso, Yesu zam wur den nde umuri, nan dun mbatl nari wurka gwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Tǝ tambe wur, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Imni kǝ nde umurka wu? Tlini yam kǝ shirǝmni na Yami bǝse kǝ ndanika gip godetǝne.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbarǝm ɗir kǝ nǝmi Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Yesu'i gip shirǝmo ar ni mbarǝm na womti ɗiri, kan mbarǝm tu ba wul ti'e Yahuda, nǝm gip kutl cet ropi, tin tǝ nde wur cina. Tǝ te kar Yesu tǝ shirǝmi ti na sumba den shirmitǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22.47 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Sumba: Sumbawo, shirmitǝn kǝ mǝn Yahudani, arni’e la’i lǝka den gǝskǝm kǝ ya’i gip zhan kǝ Yesu. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />Ama Yesu tambe ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Yahuda, ki bali kar Nya Mbarǝm na sumba ya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Nan mǝn kopi Yesu shin argon tu kan ba ri kǝ pitǝno, ar ni wu wule, &lt;&lt;Babomi, an mbi’e mǝ wotl na bar suɓur gǝmiwa?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Kan gon gip wur ba wotl zher kǝ bar mǝn keri bar ju kan ɗiri Yam gwa, tǝ pǝni ti kǝm kǝ shimli den gamka.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Ama Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Zani untu!&gt;&gt; Kan Yesu ba ne am den kǝm kǝ mǝri tǝ warke ti.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Kan Yesu ba wul kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa, na kiri mǝn ne ger den Bom kǝ Yam, na kiri kǝ bǝni, mǝn ju ɗir kǝ nǝmi gǝs gwa, &lt;&lt;Kǝ ɗir na bar suɓur na dlo kǝ nǝmi gǝno ami mur mǝn dlǝri den tǝp na? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Ko gonge pǝte ami ra nan kǝn gip bom kǝ Yami, kǝ nǝmǝn da'a. Ama kǝkǝn ni'e wokoci gini na iko kǝ dǝmǝni.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bitǝrus wule tǝ mom Yesu da'a</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Wu nǝm Yesu, wu ndara nan ti wu te ti gip bom dǝ bar mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa. Bitǝrus kop wur nye pǝrsi nye pǝrsiyi. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Ama wokoci tu wu hor utu dlom dǝbom bomiwo kan wu dǝm atl kup gǝzǝni, Bitǝrus dǝm atl nan wuri. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Nye mǝn bom gon nye gǝr shin Bitǝrus njon atl lasi gip cirtǝn kǝ utu. Tǝ shin ti zhetzhet tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Mbarǝm tu ma tǝ ra nan ti.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Ama tǝ nge, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Nye gǝre, a mom ti da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Ɓom dǝmika njemo, bakos gon ba pa shin ti kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ki ma kin gip wuri.&gt;&gt; Ama Bitǝrus nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Bakos mbarǝme, ami ra gip wur da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Bar kǝ awa nǝm den kariwo, bakos gon ba dlǝr den yari'e, &lt;&lt;Na ho bi ni mbarǝm tu ra nan ti, domici tǝ ma ba mǝn Galili ni.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Bitǝrus bali ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Bakos mbarǝme, a mom argon tu nan kǝ shirǝm dene da gwa!&gt;&gt; Gip lasi tǝ gip shirǝm ituwi, ar ni tus kor laa yare. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Kan Babom ba bal ti tǝ wi ger ndǝr te den Bitǝrus ka. Kan Bitǝrus ba dami shirǝm tu Babom yari ti gwa den'e, &lt;&lt;Kapǝn dǝ tus kor laa yar sekǝno, ki wule kǝ momǝn da'a bisi myakan.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Ar ni tǝ ɗǝl gǝs te karika kan tǝ kul na nari.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbarǝm yari Yesu zhe'e shirǝmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Mbarǝm ju kan den ne ger den Yesu ba nǝmi ti yari zhe'e shirǝm kan wu den ɓe gǝsi. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Wu ɓali ti bagerka kan wu wul ti'e &lt;&lt;Pi mi anapci, woni ɓo iwe?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Wu yari ti wani shirǝm jen'es na womti.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu cina dǝ mǝn bǝni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Nan bartlowo, ar ni domtǝn kǝ kiri kǝ bǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda na kiri mǝn keri bar ju nan ɗiri Yam gwa, kup na mǝn momi shirǝm tu nan Yam bi Musa gwa, wu dom wuri, kan ba ri Yesu cina da wuri. <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />Wu wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Yari mi, ko ki ni'e Almasihu?&gt;&gt; Yesu nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Amin a yari in ma ar ba nǝmi in mbatl da'a, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />amin a tambe in eso ki mani kǝ balin da'a. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Ama kǝkǝn na cina ɗewo, Nya Mbarǝm ba dǝm den am shimli kǝ Yam mǝn iko.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Kan wu tambe kup gǝzǝn wu wule, &lt;&lt;Ki nya Yam na?&gt;&gt;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Tǝ nǝmi wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Untun kǝ yari'e amini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Ar ni wu wule, &lt;&lt;Kǝ unun mǝ'i ngen seda jen ra wu? Ar tu mǝ kum bi da ti wi gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Ri Yesu cina dǝ Bilatus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Kan kiri kǝ bǝn kup ba la Yesu cina wu ri ti cina dǝ Bilatus gun kǝ Roma. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Kan wu nǝm gadlǝr gǝsi, wu wule, &lt;&lt;Mǝ zam mbarǝm kǝn ne mi den guzǝl mbarǝm kǝ atl gǝmi ka. Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;Ba wu ɓatl wurpi bom dǝ Kaisar da'a,&gt; Eso tǝ wule, ti ni'e Almasihu gunye.&gt; &gt;&gt;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kaisar: Tini’e bar gun kǝ atl kǝ Roma kup. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Kan Bilatus ba tambe Yesu, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ki ni'e gun kǝ mǝn Yahuda ya?&gt;&gt; Yesu nǝmi ti, tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Yari gi utu.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Kan Bilatus ba yari kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa, na mbarǝm ju nan ra lasi gwa, &lt;&lt;Amiwo a zam mbarǝm kǝn na jiltǝn gon da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Arni wu hori ti utu ra, wu wule, &lt;&lt;Na kulci gǝs ni tǝ tli mbatl mbarǝm kǝ atl kǝ Yahuda kup. Ya nǝm ni tor Galili, tǝ kop las har tor ɗe.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Na kumi untuwo, arni kan Bilatus ba tambe ko ti ba mǝn Galili ni.<verse eid="LUK 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Nan ya kum'e ti ni gip atl kǝ Hiriduso, arni tǝ wule dǝ ri ti cina dǝ Hiridus, muntu kan ra su Urushalimaka gip muri ju gwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Nan Hiridus shin Yesuwo, ar gholi ti mbatl nari, domicin tunkani ya den ndu'i shini kǝ Yesu, don tǝ ɓom muri na kumi shirǝm den tǝwi, ndu'i gǝso dǝ Yesu pi bar kǝ dlǝkǝntǝn jen tǝ shini. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Kan Hirudus ba tambe ti bar na womti, ama Yesu yon gǝs top. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Kiri mǝn keri bar ju kan ɗiri Yam na mǝn kulci doka tu Yam bi Musa gwa ra dlor-dlor, kan wu pi ta ɗiri shirǝm li gam mǝn ndǝrtǝn den Yesu na womti. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Kan Hirudus na mǝn bi'utu gǝs ba nǝmi ti yari usun shirǝm na shini shu, kan wu la'i ti bar lulur kǝ gunye, wu pali ti rǝn kar Bilatus ka. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Ter kawo Hirudus na Bilatus ba kum gos kǝ ezǝn da'a, ama daga gastuwo arni wu dǝm berǝmi.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Bilatus la bi kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam gwa, na kiri kǝ bǝni na nami mbarǝme, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />kan tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ ɗirim mbarǝm kǝn den tǝ tli mbatl mbarǝme. A ngen momi bar ju kǝ yari den ti cina da'ine, ar tu a zam ti na am gip bar ju kǝ yari den ti gwa da'a. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />Hiridus ma untu ni, ar tu ya pali ti ɗir am dami wi, ar tu kǝ shin ya pi argon nan ndari dǝ ri ti e gwa da'a. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Ra untuwo, a ɓo ti a za ti tǝ ndara. <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" /><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tǝlankuri jenni la aya tu, ama an ra gip jen da’a. Aya 17: An nǝm ti te yar ka, tǝ pǝtli wur mbarǝm nǝm gip muri kǝ biki jikat bǝdlabǝni. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Arni kup gǝzǝn wu la yar na bi nǝm, wu wule, &lt;&lt;Pika na mbarǝm tu, kan kǝ pǝtli mi Barabas!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />(Barabas kan ɓal ti bom-moni den tǝ kem dǝ tli mbatl mbarǝm kǝ bǝn kan ba ri gon eka gwa).<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Bilatus ndu'e tǝ pǝtl Yesu ka, arni tǝ shirǝm nan wur ra esi. <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Ama wu tli na womi bari, wu wule, &lt;&lt;Dǝ giciye ti ka! Dǝ giciye tǝ ka!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Kǝ myakani, Bilatus ba wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Den unu? Unun mbarǝm kǝn pi wani wu? A zam argon den ti nan ndari dǝ ri ti eka gwa da'a. Ra untuwo, a kem dǝ ɓo ti kan a pǝtl tǝ ka.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Ama la'i yar gǝzǝn na nari den liri dǝ ri ti ekawo, ar kem tǝ kopi wuri.<verse eid="LUK 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Arni Bilatus gudlumi tor mbatl den ti pi wur argon tu wu ndu gwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Kan tǝ pǝtli wur mbarǝm tu kan la ti bom-moni den tǝ tli mbatl bǝn yam kan ba ri gon eka gwa, muntu wu wul ra gwa, tǝ bi wur Yesu wu pi ti argon tu wu ndu gwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wu giciye Yesu ka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Nan wu den ritǝn na Yesuwo, arni wu nǝm Siman ba mǝn Sayirin, muntu ɗǝl ɗir bi lǝp tǝ te gip bǝn utuwi gwa. Wu ne ti giciye kǝ Yesu yar wu wul ti'e, tǝ kop Yesu kari. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Mbarǝm na womti ba kop tǝ kari, na mǝtli gip wur munju den kulu na ɓe ngetl guna den ti gwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Yesu bali ger kaar tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Mǝtli kǝ Urushalima, kulim ni gam da'a, ama kuli ni gam gin na mimir gini. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Don pǝt jen ba ɗir lokoci tu ki wule, &lt;njikǝn na mǝtli ju kan zam gǝri da'a, na nyin ju kan tle wur da ma wu mani ghol mbatli.&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Untuwo, mbarǝm ba wul tlǝndǝr'e, &lt;Nde mi ni gamka!&gt; wu wul zhiki'e, &lt;Kup mi nika!&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Mbarǝm ni pii yari kin untuwo, imnu ba ndo na koni we?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Mbarǝm jen rop, kup gǝzǝn mǝn wani pitǝne, ba laa wur cina dǝ ri ri wur eka nan ti. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Nan wu ɗir las tu ba wul ti'e Kula-gamo, kan wu ɓa ti den giciye bartu, nan ti na mǝn warwat pitǝn ju, nǝm den am shimli, nǝm am yali gǝsi. <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Yesu wule, &lt;&lt;Bǝba, gafarte wuri, domici wu mom argon tu wu den pi gwa da'a.&gt;&gt; Kan wu pi caca den lulur gǝs wu rabe.<verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Mbarǝm dlǝr wu den shini, kiri kǝ bǝn ma wu yari ti zhe'e shirǝmi, wu wule, &lt;&lt;Tǝ ɗǝli jen wi tǝ ɗǝli gam gǝs la, in zǝzar ti den ti'e Almasihu kǝ Yam gwa.&gt; &gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Mǝn bi utuyi ma wu ɗir yari ti zhe'e shirǝmi, wu ta'i ti mati male. <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />Wu wul es'e, &lt;&lt;Ɗǝli gam gi, in ki ni'e gun kǝ mǝn Yahuda gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />To gami da ti kawo arni wu rǝsh'e, MƏNKƏN NI'E GUN KƏ MƏN YAHUDA<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Mǝn nǝm gip mǝn warwat pitǝn ju kan giciye wur lasi, ba yari tǝ mǝgǝn shirǝm tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ki ni'e Kǝristi diya? Ɗǝli gam gi nam mi mana!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Ama esi tu ba matl ti, tǝ wul ti'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝ bǝrti Yam diya, ar tu kǝ ri e nan ti nan pi in shari'a nǝm nan ti gwa ya? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Miwo hukunte mi dlat. Mǝn den nǝmi argon tu ndar pitǝn gǝmi gwa. Ama mbarǝm tuwo tǝ pi warwat bar gon da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Kan tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Yesu, daa mom namǝn kin kǝ mbi gip mulki giwi gwa.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Yesu ba nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Na hobini a yari i, sekǝn tu ma ki nǝra namǝn to yamka.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mǝshtǝn kǝ Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Bar ju ba piwo pǝt to dlom yamwi, arni dǝmǝn nda gip atl kup ar ba ri gǝlla am myakan kǝ siti. <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />Don pǝt za cirtǝnka, kan labǝle kǝ Bom kǝ Yam ba tarka gip dlomi. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.45 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Labǝle: Giɓǝr tutulni kan ba le bǝdlabǝn bin kari kǝ Bom kǝ Yami. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Yesu ba la yar na nari, tǝ laa bi tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Bǝba, gip am da'ini a bi rai gǝni!&gt;&gt; Nan tǝ yari untuwo, kan tǝ dli shukutǝn tǝ kotl mbatlka.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Nan bar mǝn bi utu tu shin argon tu kan piwo, arni tǝ ɗǝɗa Yam tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Na ho bi mbarǝm tuwo mǝn warwat pitǝnni da'a.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 23:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Nan kup mbarǝm ju dom wur kǝ shini bar ju shin argon tu piwo, wu ɓo am den ngetl wu ndara. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.48 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ɓe ngetle: Shini gunani na dun mbatli. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Ama kup munju mom ti, mǝtli ju kop ti kar tor Galili, wu dlǝr na dlyami wu den shini bar ju den pitǝn gwa.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kapi kǝ Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Ho mbarǝm mǝn zo pitǝn gon ra nan ba wul ti'e Yusufu gwa, ti ni gip kiri kǝ bǝni. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23.50 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Kiri kǝ bǝni: Kiri mbarǝmni kǝ mǝn Yahuda. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />Tǝ la am gip arjen ju wu gudlumi kan wu pi gwa da'a. Tǝ mǝn atl kǝ Yahudiya gip bǝn Arimatiyani. Tini den ɓuti mulki kǝ Yami. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Tǝ ri kar Bilatus, tǝ lir dli kǝ Yesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Kan tǝ shu suri, tǝ ghumka gip tutul ghumi mǝshi mbarǝme, tǝ ne gip gam-bǝci kan bor gip tat nan ne murgon gipi wi da gwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Gas kǝrkǝm barni, ar sawi njem dǝ te gip pǝt shukutǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda. (Asabar)<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Mǝtli ju kan kop Yesu tor daga Galili ba kop Yusufu wu shin gam-bǝci'i, na kanda tu muri dli gǝs su gipika gwa. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />Kan wu ndara wu ri gǝzǝn bom wu kǝrkǝm mir mǝn tǝmi kasǝr na mir bǝrketǝne. Ama wu kop doka kǝ Musa, kan wu shuku den pǝt shukutǝn kǝ mǝn Yahuda.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Yesu mǝsh kan tǝ tli lasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Gasi kǝ cigǝni den pǝt lahadi, mǝtli ju ri kǝ ba gam-bǝci'i na mir mǝn tǝmi kasǝri kan wu pi gwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Arni wu zam tat tu kan bi gam-bǝci'iwo kutǝli kawi. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Nan wu te gipiwo, wu shin dli kǝ Babom Yesu da'a. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Nan wi gip damtǝn gip mbatl gǝzǝn den bar tuwo, arni parat wu shin mbarǝm rop cwat kar wur dlor, na ghol lulur kǝ dli da wur mǝn cirtǝni. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Wi gip bǝrtiwo, arni wu ɓa gam atli. Kan mbarǝmi ba wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kem kǝ ngen mbarǝm mǝn rai gip mǝshi we? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Tǝ'i da'a, tǝ tli wi! Dam kǝn ni den argon tu tǝ yari in nan tǝ'i nan kǝn su Galilika gwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />Den'e baa bi Nya Mbarǝm am dǝ mǝn warwat pitǝne, wi ɓa ti den kini, den pǝt kǝ myakan ngapo ti tli lasi.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Arni wu dam shirǝm gǝsi.<verse eid="LUK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Nan wu pal ɗiro, arni wu yari kutl cet nǝmi na mbarǝm jen kan ra lasi gwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Mǝtli ju kan yari mir mǝn kartǝn gǝs kutl cet nǝmiwo, wi ni'e, Maryamu Magadala, na Yowanna, na Maryamu nasi Yakubu, na mǝtli jen kan ra nan wur gwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Ama mir mǝn kartǝn gǝsi pali shirǝm kǝ mǝtliyika zhe'e shirǝmi, wu la mbatl da'a. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Ama Bitǝrus tlyam kenja, tǝ ri kǝ ba gam-bǝci'i na kǝtǝre tǝ te gipi, tǝ shin tutul ghumi mǝshi mbarǝm tu ghum ti gipi gwa markǝme, arni tǝ pal ɗir bom tǝ den damtǝn den argon tu pi gwa.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbarǝm rop den tǝp Imawus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Den pǝt nǝmi eso, rop gip mir mǝn kopi Yesu ra den tǝp gǝzǝn kǝ ritǝn nye bǝn gon kan ba wul ti'e Imawus, muntu dlyamtǝn gǝs na Urushalimawo bar kǝ mil nyingi ni gwa. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24.13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mil nyingi: Gip Girikwo, wi na bar kǝ gode dlyamtǝn gǝzǝni ‘stadia’, milni wu gode nari da’a. </char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Wi den shirǝm na ezǝn den argon tu pi gwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Wi den shirǝm na bali da wuri, ar ni Yesu na gam gǝs ri kar wuri tǝ nǝm ritǝn nan wuri. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Ama wi ra gip dǝmǝn gami wu mom'e ti ni da'a. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kǝ bali na ya'ǝn untuwu?&gt;&gt; Arni wu dlǝr kǝ ba lasi na dun mbatli.<verse eid="LUK 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Nǝm gip wur muntu ba wul ti'e Kiliyobas nǝmi ti tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Ki ni'e mǝn diki nangi gip Urushalima kan mom bar ju pi gip mir muri jin gwaya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Unu ari uju we?&gt;&gt; Wu nǝmi ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Bar ju pi den Yesu kǝ Nazare gwa. Mǝn shirǝm na Yamni hari, mǝn ndǝrtǝn gip pitǝn na shirǝm cina dǝ Yam na mbarǝme. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Muntu kan kiri mǝn keri bar ju ɗiri Yam na kiri mbarǝm gǝmi la'i ti gǝs yam wu hukumte ti kǝ dǝ tǝ mǝshi, wu pa giciye tǝ ka. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Mǝ la mbatl den tin ti ɗǝli Isra'ila, ar tu sekǝno muri myakan ikǝnwi na pitǝn kǝ bar tu. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Eso, mǝtli jen gip mi dlǝkǝn mi, wu ri kǝ ba gam bǝci'i kǝ cigǝni, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />ama wu zam dli gǝs da’a. Nan wu pal ɗiro, wu wule wu shin mir mǝn kartǝn kan ɗǝl sur kar Yam nan wul wur'e Yesu ra na rai gwa! <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Jen gip mi kǝtǝr rǝnka kǝ dǝ wu shini ger gǝzǝni, arni wu zam kanda tu mǝtli ju yari gwa, ama tiwo wu shin ti da'a.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Arni Yesu wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝn kǝdlǝme! Mǝn iɗa mbatl kǝ nǝmi bar ju kup mǝn shirǝm na Yam yari gwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Kǝ mom'e ar nǝm Almasihu te yarka dǝ tǝ kum dli den bar ju kup kan tǝ to gǝs gip nartǝn gǝs da'aya?&gt;&gt;<verse eid="LUK 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Pare den rǝshi kǝ Musa na mǝn shirǝm na Yam kup, tǝ ɓuli wur argon tu rǝsh gip Shirǝm kǝ Yam kup den ti gwa.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Nan wu ɗir kar nye bǝn tu wu riwo, Yesu pi wule ti ɓeni cina, <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />ama wu lir ti wu wule, &lt;&lt;Dǝm nan mi, sit pi wi, pǝt ba ri kǝ ndetǝn bin wi.&gt;&gt; Kan tǝ ri bom nan wuri. <verse eid="LUK 24:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Nan wu dǝm kǝ ci fingalo, arni tǝ pǝn burodi, tǝ lir Yam, tǝ cetǝli kan tǝ nǝmi wur bi.<verse eid="LUK 24:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Kan ger gǝzǝn ba ɓuli, nan wu mom tiwo, ar ni tǝ jili wur gerka. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Wu wul ezǝn'e &lt;&lt;Mbatl gǝmi ker gip mi bitu tǝ shirǝm nan mi den tǝp nan tǝ ɓuli mi Shirǝm kǝ Yam gwa diya?<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Workǝca, arni wu pal su Urushalima ka, kan wu zam kutl cet nǝm ju kan dom wur kǝba las nǝm gwa, na nami mbarǝmi. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Wu den wultǝn'e, &lt;&lt;Na ho bini Babom tli wi, tǝ ɗǝl kar Biturus!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Wi ropi ngapo wu yar argon tu pi den tǝp gwa, na kanda tu wu mom ti nan tǝ cetǝli wur burodi gwa.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu cwat kar mir mǝn kopi gǝsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Wu'i gip shirǝm dene ituwi, arni Yesu dlǝr dlor gip dlom da wur tǝ wule, &lt;&lt;Dǝ ghol mbatl dǝm nankǝne.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Bǝrti nǝm wuri dli gǝzǝn den dǝdartǝni, wu wule tlonni wu shini. <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Arni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Unun kem bǝrti nǝm kǝne, kǝ kum wule untuni pi dawu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Shin ni am gǝn na kar asǝm gǝni, ami ni na gam gǝni, neni am demǝni kǝ shin ni na gam gi ni, ai tlon ra na tlu dli na gul da’a, amo kǝ shin ami ra nari.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Nan tǝ wul untuwo, tǝ gode wur am na kar asǝm gǝsi.<verse eid="LUK 24:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Kan wu den ghol mbatl hoyi na nǝmi bi na amo, ama wu den shinni, wule untuni pi dawo, arni tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Kǝn ra na bar kǝ ci ɗeya?&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Wu bi ti bo'i kose, <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />arni tǝ nǝm kan tǝ ci cina da wuri.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Tǝ wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Bar ju kan a yari in gwa uju, nan a'i nan kǝn gwa, den'e, doleni dǝ laa'i kup bar ju nan rǝsh demǝn gip Doka kǝ Musa na tǝlankur kǝ mǝn shirǝm na Yam na Zabura gwa.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="LUK 24:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Arni tǝ ceti wur gamka dǝ wu mom rǝshi Shirǝm kǝ Yami. <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Tǝ pa wul wur'e, &lt;&lt;Ar ra na rǝshi terka'e, Almasihu ba kum dli den kar muri kǝ myakano tǝ tli lasi. <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Eso, gip sun gǝs ni ba pii atl kundǝrǝndlip wazu kǝ paltǝn kar Yami, na ho'i wani pitǝnka, pare gip Urushalima. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Kǝn ni kǝ shin bar ju pi gwa. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Ar tu aa kari in bar sur na bar ju Ba gǝn wule ti bi gwa. Ama dǝmni gip bǝn dǝ bi'in iko sur yam kani.<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu to gǝs yami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Ar ni Yesu ɗǝli wur kar bǝn Baitanya, lasini tǝ tli am yami, tǝ la'i wur albarka. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Tǝ den la'i wur albarka ituwi, arni tǝ za wur kan ba pǝn tika to yamka. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Wi eso, arni wu ngus, wu ɗǝɗa ti, kan wu pal su Urushalima ka, laa'i na ghol mbatl na nari. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Se na gǝni wi ra te gip Bom kǝ Yamka, wu den ɗǝɗa Yami.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>